window.SECTOR_DNA={"xlb":{"analog":"The current setup — Downturn phase after a +46.6% post-crash recovery, RS rank #7, dollar firming as a headwind (+3.4% DXY), China demand soft but copper structurally tight — most closely rhymes with the December 1, 2015 leg that followed the September 2015 dead-cat bounce. In that case XLB had rallied +18.2% off the commodities-panic low, then rolled over for another 18.4% decline as the Fed's first rate hike, continued oil weakness, and the China circuit-breaker crash compounded the selloff. The present analog: XLB has bounced off the April 2025 tariff crash, the dollar is firming again, and re-acceleration requires either a Fed easing pivot or a clear China stimulus catalyst — absent either, the path of least resistance is continued RS erosion toward support.","analog_zh":"当前形态——46.6%的崩后复苏之后进入回落阶段，相对强度排名第7，美元走强构成逆风（DXY +3.4%），中国需求疲软但铜供应结构性紧张——最接近2015年12月1日那轮在9月\"死猫反弹\"之后出现的回落行情。当时XLB自大宗商品恐慌低点反弹+18.2%后再度回落18.4%——美联储首次加息、油价持续疲软与中国股市熔断危机层层叠加扩大了跌势。当前的类比：XLB从2025年4月关税崩盘低位反弹后，美元重新走强，下一轮再加速需要美联储转向宽松或中国明确的刺激催化剂——若两者均缺席，相对强度持续侵蚀至支撑位是阻力最小的路径。","bottom_signals":["Dollar peaking and reversing lower after a sustained strong-dollar regime — a DXY peak is often coincident with XLB troughs within 1-4 weeks","Copper-gold ratio bottoming near multi-year lows while gold outperforms — flight-to-safety exhaustion combined with an industrial-metals oversold condition","China announcing a major stimulus package targeting infrastructure or manufacturing — PBoC rate cuts plus fiscal infrastructure spending are the most consistent XLB re-entry triggers","XLB ranking dead-last (10-11 of 11) in a multi-sector selloff with VIX above 30 — forced selling of the most-hated cyclical marks durable lows"],"bottom_signals_zh":["美元在持续强势体制后见顶回落——DXY峰值通常与XLB触底在1-4周内同步出现","铜金比在多年低位企稳而黄金表现强势——避险情绪耗尽叠加工业金属超卖状态","中国宣布以基础设施或制造业为目标的重大刺激计划——中国人民银行降息加财政基建支出是最持续的XLB再入场触发信号","XLB在多板块抛售中垫底（11个板块中排名第10-11）且VIX高于30——最被厌弃周期股的强制抛售标志持久性低点"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["US dollar regime — DXY direction is the single most reliable lever; a weak dollar is a tailwind for all dollar-priced materials, a strong dollar is a direct headwind","China industrial demand impulse — infrastructure cycles, PBoC stimulus, and property-sector health drive copper, iron ore, and chemicals volume","Global reflation vs deflation quad — the cyclicals-over-defensives rotation and oil direction define the macro backdrop XLB trades within","Commodity price cycles in copper, gold, and oil — XLB earnings are directly leveraged to spot prices via miners, chemicals, and specialty materials","Fed rate regime and credit conditions — tightening means a strong dollar plus recession fears (a double headwind); easing means dollar relief plus risk-on (a double tailwind)"],"drivers_zh":["美元体制——DXY走向是最可靠的单一杠杆；美元走弱对所有以美元计价的原材料形成顺风，美元走强是直接逆风","中国工业需求脉冲——基础设施周期、中国人民银行刺激及房地产行业健康状况驱动铜、铁矿石和化工品需求量","全球再通胀与通缩象限——周期股相对防御股轮动及油价走向定义XLB的宏观交易背景","铜、黄金与原油的大宗商品价格周期——XLB盈利通过矿业、化工与特种材料直接杠杆现货价格","美联储利率体制与信贷条件——收紧意味着强美元加衰退恐慌（双重逆风）；宽松意味着美元缓解加风险偏好（双重顺风）"],"median_cycle_months":24,"summary":"Materials (XLB) cycles structurally on the intersection of three recurring forces: the US dollar regime, China's industrial demand impulse, and the global reflation vs deflation quad. When all three align (weak dollar + China stimulus + reflation quad), XLB becomes a top-3 sector; when they reverse (strong dollar + China slowdown + deflation-scare), it becomes the worst-ranked cyclical. Unlike Tech, which can melt up on earnings or AI narratives independent of commodities, XLB's returns are almost entirely determined by the macro backdrop — it has no idiosyncratic earnings engine, making it the purest sector-level expression of the global commodity cycle. The median peak-to-peak cycle of roughly two years makes it a mid-cycle sector whose leadership windows are well-defined and often preceded by a dollar peak or China policy pivot.","summary_zh":"材料板块（XLB）的周期结构性地由三大力量交叉决定：美元体制、中国工业需求脉冲以及全球再通胀与通缩象限。当三者同向共振（弱美元+中国刺激+再通胀象限），XLB跻身前三板块；当三者反转（强美元+中国放缓+通缩恐慌），它便沦为表现最差的周期股。不同于科技板块可依靠盈利或AI叙事独立拉升，XLB的回报几乎完全由宏观背景决定——它没有特异性的盈利引擎，是全球大宗商品周期最纯粹的板块级表达。约两年的峰到峰中位周期长度，使其成为一个中周期板块，其领涨窗口定义明确，通常以美元见顶或中国政策转向为前兆。","top_signals":["Dollar trend reversing higher after prolonged cyclical weakness — a DXY turn up of +5% or more typically precedes XLB relative-strength peaks by 1-3 months","Copper-gold ratio rolling over from elevated levels (above ~+30% on a leg basis) signals industrial demand peaking before XLB registers the price decline","China property or manufacturing PMI turning down after a stimulus-led overshoot — the end of the credit impulse is the end of the commodity bid","XLB leading SPY by a wide margin within a single leg while VIX is suppressed below 15 — excess complacency marks cyclical sector peaks"],"top_signals_zh":["美元趋势在经历周期性走弱后重新反转上行——DXY上涨+5%或以上通常领先XLB相对强度见顶1-3个月","铜金比从高位（单轮约+30%以上）回落——工业需求见顶信号早于XLB价格下跌出现","中国房地产或制造业PMI在刺激驱动的超调后重新下行——信贷冲动终结即大宗商品买盘终结","XLB在单轮行情内大幅领先SPY且VIX低于15——过度乐观情绪标志周期板块见顶"]},"xlc":{"analog":"The current setup most rhymes with the June 2018 - February 2020 leg: in both cases XLC sits at the bottom of the sector league table in a mega-cap-led, tech-driven market where XLC's specific holdings face company-specific headwinds rather than a broad market selloff. In 2018-19, XLC underperformed despite Tech ripping because Facebook/Cambridge Analytica and ad-targeting uncertainty weighed on its anchor names; today, Meta and Alphabet underperform despite a tech/semis melt-up because the market is penalizing capex inflation over ad monetization acceleration. Both regimes resolved when the company-specific overhang cleared and the digital ad cycle reaccelerated.","analog_zh":"当前格局与2018年6月至2020年2月的腿最为相似：两种情形下，XLC均在大市值、科技主导的市场中位居板块排行榜末位，而其特定持仓面临个股特定逆风，而非市场整体下跌所致。2018-19年，尽管科技板块大涨，XLC依然跑输，因为Facebook/剑桥分析和广告定向不确定性拖累了核心持仓；如今，Meta和Alphabet在科技/半导体暴涨中跑输，因市场正在惩罚资本开支通胀超过广告变现加速。两轮格局均在个股特定压制解除、数字广告周期再加速后得到修复。","bottom_signals":["XLC ranking last or near-last (rank 10-11 of 11) while semis and tech lead (sector neglect trough, not liquidation)","VIX mean-reverting below 20 after a spike to 40-plus (risk-on regime flip)","Equal-weight outperforming cap-weight (breadth broadening signals rotation peak; reversion to mega-cap likely)","Meta and Alphabet beating on ad revenue with manageable capex surprise (ad cycle reacceleration catalyst)"],"bottom_signals_zh":["XLC排名垫底或接近垫底（11个中第10-11），而半导体/科技领涨（板块被忽视的底部，而非清仓式低点）","VIX在飙升至40以上后均值回归至20以下（风险偏好象限切换）","等权重跑赢市值加权（广度扩散——轮动见顶，均值回归至大市值的概率上升）","Meta和Alphabet广告营收超预期且资本开支惊喜可控（广告周期再加速催化剂）"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["digital ad cycle (Meta/Alphabet revenue acceleration vs deceleration)","rate regime / 10Y yield direction (long-duration growth re-rating)","AI capex cycle (capex-versus-monetization balance for hyperscalers)","mega-cap breadth (narrow tape amplifies XLC; broad tape dilutes it)","macro quad rotation (growth-up reflationary vs slowdown/deflation-scare)"],"drivers_zh":["数字广告周期（Meta/Alphabet营收加速vs减速）","利率象限/10年期美债收益率方向（长久期成长估值重定价）","AI资本开支周期（超大规模云厂商资本开支与变现的平衡）","大市值行情广度（窄幅行情放大XLC；宽幅行情稀释XLC）","宏观象限轮动（成长上行再通胀vs慢增长/通缩恐慌）"],"median_cycle_months":18,"summary":"XLC cycles on two interlocking engines: (1) the digital ad cycle — when ad spending accelerates in a reflationary/growth-up macro quad, Meta and Alphabet re-rate higher and pull the basket up; when the ad cycle turns (recession/ATT shock/AI-capex margin drag) the same concentration punishes it violently. (2) Rate duration — XLC's long-duration streaming and platform growth names price like bonds inverted: they soar when yields fall (TLT rallies) and collapse when rates surge, which is why the 2021-22 rate shock produced the worst bear leg (-46.7%) and the 2022-25 goldilocks/disinflation quad produced the best bull leg (+137.2%). The sector's mega-cap concentration (Meta + Alphabet ~55% of XLC) means sector-level moves are really single-stock thesis rotations packaged as a macro bet.","summary_zh":"XLC的周期性由两大相互锁定的引擎驱动：（1）数字广告周期——当广告支出在再通胀/成长上行宏观象限加速扩张时，Meta和Alphabet估值上行，拉动篮子走高；当广告周期转向（衰退/苹果ATT冲击/AI资本开支压缩利润），同样的集中度便形成反向惩罚。（2）利率久期——XLC持仓的长久期流媒体和平台成长股像债券倒置般定价：收益率下行时（TLT上涨）暴涨，利率飙升时崩塌，这正是2021-22年利率冲击造就最惨熊市腿（-46.7%）、而2022-25年黄金区间/去通胀象限成就最强牛市腿（+137.2%）的根本原因。板块高度集中于大市值股（Meta + Alphabet占XLC约55%），意味着板块走势本质上是单只股票的叙事轮换被包装成了宏观赌注。","top_signals":["VIX collapsing to below 15 with equal-weight lagging cap-weight by more than 10% (hyper-narrow mega-cap melt-up exhaustion)","Meta and Alphabet guiding sharply higher capex without matching revenue acceleration (capex-trap inflection)","10Y yield breaking above 4.5% on inflation re-acceleration (long-duration de-rating trigger)","XLC leading all 11 sectors YTD with growth-over-value spread above 50% (euphoria exhaustion signal)"],"top_signals_zh":["VIX跌至15以下，等权重跑输市值加权超10%（超窄幅大市值暴涨耗竭）","Meta和Alphabet大幅上调资本开支指引但营收加速未能匹配（资本开支陷阱拐点）","10年期美债收益率因通胀再加速突破4.5%（长久期杀估值触发点）","XLC年初至今领涨11个板块，成长跑赢价值超50%（亢奋耗竭信号）"]},"xle":{"analog":"The current 2026 post-ceasefire selloff rhymes most closely with the 2022-11-15 leg (November 2022 to March 2023): in both cases, Energy had just completed a supply-disruption-led premium rally to #1, then reversed sharply as the catalyst faded (OPEC+ Oct 2022 cut wearing off / China-demand worry vs Iran ceasefire 2026), with money rotating hard into tech/growth (the late-2022 ChatGPT-driven AI bid in Comm/Tech mirroring the 2026 AI melt-up). In both cases Energy went from #1 to #11 in under four months, oil fell 20%+, and the broader tape was narrow/mega-cap-led. The imperfect fit: the 2022-23 reversal was compounded by an SVB credit shock, whereas the 2026 move is a cleaner geopolitical-premium drain.","analog_zh":"当前2026年停火后的下跌行情与2022年11月15日那段最为相似（2022年11月至2023年3月）：两次都是能源刚完成供应中断引发的溢价行情升至第1后急剧反转，催化剂消退（2022年10月OPEC+减产效应衰减/中国需求担忧，对应2026年伊朗停火），资金大举轮动进入科技/成长（2022年末由ChatGPT点燃的通信/科技AI买盘，与2026年AI逼空上涨如出一辙）。两次情境下，能源都在不到四个月内从第1跌至第11，油价下跌20%以上，更广泛盘面均为狭窄/巨头主导。不完全吻合之处：2022-23年的反转还叠加了硅谷银行信用冲击，而2026年的下跌是更纯粹的地缘政治溢价抽离。","bottom_signals":["Oil prices at multi-year lows with US rig counts declining sharply (supply destruction underway)","Energy RS rank #11 for 2+ months with record short interest in XLE/XOP (capitulation)","OPEC+ announces surprise deep cuts or geopolitical supply disruption emerges","Dollar peaks and rolls over -- DXY topping is historically bullish for crude and XLE"],"bottom_signals_zh":["油价处于多年低点且美国钻机数急剧下滑（供应破坏进行中）","能源RS排名持续2个月以上垫底（第11），XLE/XOP空头兴趣创纪录（恐慌性出逃）","OPEC+宣布超预期大幅减产或地缘政治供应中断突发","美元见顶回落——DXY顶部历史上对原油和XLE呈看涨信号"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["WTI/Brent crude oil price direction (primary driver ~70% of variance)","OPEC+ supply policy decisions (cuts/hikes/market-share pivots)","US shale production cycle (rig counts, break-even dynamics)","USD direction (inverse correlation -- DXY up hurts, DXY down helps)","Global growth / China demand cycle (commodity demand multiplier)","Geopolitical risk premium (wars, sanctions, supply-route threats)"],"drivers_zh":["WTI/布伦特原油价格方向（主要驱动因素，约占方差的70%）","OPEC+供应政策决定（减产/增产/市场份额转向）","美国页岩油产量周期（钻机数、盈亏平衡动态）","美元方向（负相关——美元涨则不利，美元跌则有利）","全球增长/中国需求周期（大宗商品需求乘数）","地缘政治风险溢价（战争、制裁、供应路线威胁）"],"median_cycle_months":12,"summary":"Energy (XLE) is structurally oil-price-beta on steroids: its cycle is almost entirely determined by WTI/Brent direction, which in turn cycles through OPEC supply-policy decisions, US shale production dynamics, global growth/demand signals, and dollar direction. When oil rises in a reflation quad (cyclicals beating defensives, falling dollar, rising copper-gold), Energy almost always ranks #1 of 11 sectors. When a deflation scare, dollar surge, or supply glut crushes crude, Energy is invariably last. The sector also carries a secondary geopolitical-premium cycle layered on top: wars, sanctions, and supply-route disruptions (Hormuz, Nord Stream) cause sharp non-fundamental oil spikes that Energy equities amplify. The third axis is the opportunity-cost trade: in AI/tech melt-up tapes, Energy is starved of capital even when oil is stable because money rotates to high-growth sectors, making the sector's RS rank a function of both oil and the overall market leadership regime.","summary_zh":"能源板块（XLE）在结构上是放大版的油价贝塔：其周期几乎完全由WTI/布伦特价格方向决定，而油价本身又随OPEC供应政策、美国页岩油产量动态、全球增长/需求信号以及美元方向循环波动。当油价在再通胀象限中上涨（周期超防御、美元走弱、铜金比上升），能源几乎总能跻身11个板块第1。当通缩恐慌、美元飙升或供应过剩打压原油，能源必然垫底。该板块还叠加了一个次级地缘政治溢价周期：战争、制裁和供应路线中断（霍尔木兹、北溪）会引发能源股进一步放大的非基本面油价飙涨。第三个轴是机会成本交易：在AI/科技逼空上涨的盘面中，即便油价稳定，能源也会被资金冷落，因为资金轮动至高增长板块，使得板块相对强弱排名既取决于油价，也取决于整体市场领导板块的切换。","top_signals":["Oil price reaches multi-year highs and majors' free-cash-flow yield compresses below 5% (overvaluation)","OPEC+ pivots to production increases or Saudi abandons price defense (supply catalyst)","Energy RS rank #1 sustained 3+ months in a growth/tech-led tape (exhaustion of rotation flows)","Dollar strength inflects -- DXY breaking above key levels signals commodity headwind"],"top_signals_zh":["油价创多年新高且大型能源公司自由现金流收益率压缩至5%以下（估值过热）","OPEC+转向增产或沙特放弃价格防御（供应催化剂）","能源RS排名持续3个月以上位居第1且处于成长/科技主导的盘面（轮动资金耗尽）","美元走强拐点——DXY突破关键位发出大宗商品逆风信号"]},"xlf":{"analog":"Today's setup (mid-cycle, RS#5, value-friendly reflation quad, semis melt-up crowding out flows, deregulation tail) most closely rhymes with the 2018-12-24 to 2020-02-14 leg: banks ranked mid-pack (#6) in a tech/growth-led recovery (SMH +88.9%) while growth was constructive but NIM was compressed by a dovish Fed, and the macro was reflation/growth-up. The key difference today is that NIM is supported by a hiking-bias Fed rather than compressed by a pausing/cutting one -- which makes the setup structurally more favorable for XLF than in 2019, but the semis-led narrow breadth creates the same 'starved' dynamic where XLF lags until a growth-to-value rotation triggers.","analog_zh":"当前格局（周期中段，RS第5，利好价值的再通胀象限，半导体熔涨虹吸资金，放松监管尾风）最像2018年12月24日至2020年2月14日的走势段：银行在科技/成长领涨复苏中排名居中（第6，SMH +88.9%），增长具备建设性但净息差被偏鸽的美联储压缩，宏观处于再通胀/增长上行象限。今日的关键差异在于净息差由加息倾向的美联储支撑，而非被暂停/降息的美联储压缩——这使当前XLF的结构性条件比2019年更有利，但半导体领涨的窄幅广度制造出同样的\"被冷落\"动态，XLF落后直至成长向价值的轮动触发。","bottom_signals":["Central bank emergency liquidity (LTRO/QE/BTFP) that removes tail-risk of bank funding crisis","XLF ranked #9-11/11 while SPY drawdown is -15% to -35% and VIX spikes above 30 (over-sold washout)","Credit spread normalization (HYG-LQD tightening) with broad-breadth recovery (equal-weight beating cap-weight)","Policy pivot (Fed pause/cut) combined with weaker dollar and curve re-steepening"],"bottom_signals_zh":["央行紧急流动性（LTRO/QE/BTFP）消除银行融资危机的尾部风险","XLF排名11档中第9-11，SPY回撤-15%至-35%且VIX飙升至30以上（超卖出清）","信用利差正常化（HYG-LQD收窄）同时宽幅广度复苏（等权重跑赢市值加权）","政策转向（美联储暂停/降息）结合美元走弱和曲线再变陡"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["Yield-curve slope (NIM driver -- steep curve = tailwind, flat/inverted = headwind)","Credit cycle (provisions rise at tops, reserve releases and spread compression at troughs)","Macro regime quad (reflation/growth-up = XLF leader; stagflation/slowdown = XLF laggard)","Policy catalysts (Fed pivots, deregulation, CCAR/stress tests, emergency facilities like LTRO/BTFP)","Capital flow rotation (value beats growth when breadth broadens; growth melt-ups leave banks starved)"],"drivers_zh":["收益率曲线斜率（净息差驱动——曲线变陡=顺风，平坦/倒挂=逆风）","信用周期（顶部计提上升，底部准备金释放和利差压缩）","宏观体制象限（再通胀/增长上行=XLF领涨；滞胀/放缓=XLF落后）","政策催化剂（美联储转向、放松监管、CCAR/压力测试、LTRO/BTFP等紧急工具）","资本流动轮动（广度扩张时价值胜成长；成长熔涨时银行被冷落）"],"median_cycle_months":24,"summary":"Financials (XLF) cycles on four interlocking structural forces: the yield-curve slope (a steep curve widens NIM, flat/inverted compresses it), the credit cycle (rising provisions and loan-loss fears mark tops, reserve releases and tightening spreads mark bottoms), macro regime transitions (XLF is a cyclical-value sector that leads in reflation/growth-up quads and gets hit hardest in slowdown/deflation-scares and stagflation), and policy inflection points (Fed pivots, deregulation waves, and bank-specific events like CCAR, LTRO, BTFP are the single sharpest catalysts). Banks lead the broad market in reflation and broad-breadth environments; they lag in narrow growth/tech melt-ups where flows chase secular growth over value.","summary_zh":"金融板块（XLF）的周期性由四重相互关联的结构性力量驱动：收益率曲线斜率（变陡扩大净息差，平坦/倒挂则压缩）、信用周期（计提上升和贷款损失担忧标志顶部，准备金释放和利差收窄标志底部）、宏观体制转换（XLF是周期-价值板块，在再通胀/增长上行象限中领涨，在放缓/通缩恐慌及滞胀中受打击最重）以及政策拐点（美联储转向、放松监管浪潮和银行特定事件如CCAR、LTRO、BTFP是最锐利的单一催化剂）。银行在再通胀和宽幅市场广度环境中领涨大盘；在窄幅成长/科技熔涨中落后，资金追逐长期成长而非价值。","top_signals":["Yield curve flattening/inverting as Fed hikes into late cycle (NIM compression signal)","XLF ranked #1-2/11 with VIX compressed below 12 and high-beta premium stretched (risk-on exhaustion)","Stagflation quad: oil surging while growth expectations fall -- banks caught between bad credit and bad NIM","Breadth narrowing sharply (equal-weight lagging by >8%) while XLF still rallying -- distribution phase"],"top_signals_zh":["美联储晚周期加息引发收益率曲线平坦化/倒挂（净息差压缩信号）","XLF排名11档中第1-2，VIX压缩至12以下且高贝塔溢价拉伸（风险偏好耗尽）","滞胀象限：油价飙涨同时增长预期下滑——银行陷入信用恶化与净息差承压的两难","市场广度急剧收窄（等权重落后>8%）同时XLF仍在上涨——分发阶段"]},"xli":{"analog":"The 2025-2026 leg most rhymes with 2016-2018: both followed a sharp policy-shock trough (January 2016 oil/China fear vs. April 2025 reciprocal tariffs), both saw Industrials emerge as genuine top-3 sector leaders in a reflation/growth-up quad with a weakening dollar, both were characterized by infrastructure/defense fiscal-spending catalysts (Trump 1.0 infrastructure/defense vs. reshoring plus defense buildout), and both featured ISM re-accelerating after a contraction. The key difference is that the current leg has AI-power/datacenter electrification as a structural demand driver absent in 2016-2018, which could extend it beyond the ~32-month length of that prior rally leg.","analog_zh":"2025-2026年本轮上涨最像2016-2018年那段：两者均紧随政策冲击触底（2016年1月油价/中国恐慌 vs. 2025年4月对等关税），两者均见证工业股作为真正的前三领头板块崛起——处于再通胀/增长向上象限且美元走弱，两者均有基础设施/国防财政支出催化剂（特朗普一期基建/国防 vs. 制造业回流加国防建设），且两者的ISM均在收缩后重新加速。关键区别在于：本轮新增了AI电力/数据中心电气化作为结构性需求驱动因素，这在2016-2018年是缺失的，有望使本轮上涨段延伸超过彼时约32个月的长度。","bottom_signals":["ISM Manufacturing troughs and re-crosses 50 after a multi-month contraction","Fed signals a pause or pivot as rate-cut expectations rise sharply","Oil stabilizes after a commodity flush on a demand-driven rebound rather than further supply glut","VIX spikes to 30-plus and defensives outperform cyclicals by 10 points or more — classic overshoot trough signature"],"bottom_signals_zh":["ISM制造业PMI多月收缩后触底并重新突破50","美联储发出暂停或转向信号，加息预期急速下降","大宗商品抛售后油价企稳，需求驱动反弹而非供给继续过剩","VIX飙升至30以上、防御股大幅跑赢周期股10个百分点以上——经典超调触底特征"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["ISM Manufacturing PMI regime (above/below 50 as primary cycle gate)","Federal Reserve rate cycle (hikes headwind, cuts/pause tailwind)","U.S. fiscal infrastructure and defense spending cycles","DXY dollar strength (strong dollar crushes multinational revenue)","oil price direction (demand-driven rise is reflation tailwind; supply-shock crash evaporates capex)","global synchronized growth vs. slowdown regime"],"drivers_zh":["ISM制造业PMI体制（50以上/以下为主要周期闸门）","美联储利率周期（加息为逆风，降息/暂停为顺风）","美国财政基础设施与国防支出周期","美元指数强弱（美元走强压制跨国营收）","油价方向（需求驱动上涨为再通胀顺风；供给冲击暴跌蒸发资本开支）","全球经济同步增长vs.放缓体制"],"median_cycle_months":21,"summary":"Industrials (XLI) cycles are fundamentally driven by the intersection of the global manufacturing PMI regime, U.S. fiscal policy (infrastructure and defense spending), the Federal Reserve interest-rate cycle, and the dollar/oil nexus. As a capital-goods-heavy, multinational-exposed sector (Boeing, Caterpillar, GE, Honeywell, RTX), XLI surges when the ISM is expanding above 50, the dollar is weak or stable, oil is rising on demand, and the Fed is easing or on hold — the reflation/growth-up quad. It underperforms when the ISM contracts, the dollar rallies crushing multinational revenue, credit spreads widen, or growth-scare flight-to-safety rotations send flows to defensives. Since 2011 XLI has consistently ranked in the top 3-4 during reflation-up regimes (2016-2018, 2020-2022, 2022-2024, 2025-2026) and in the bottom half during dollar-strong manufacturing contractions (2015-2016) or abrupt policy-shock selloffs (Q4 2018, Feb-Mar 2020, 2025 tariff shock).","summary_zh":"工业板块（XLI）的周期从根本上由全球制造业PMI体制、美国财政政策（基础设施与国防支出）、美联储利率周期以及美元/油价关系的交叉共同驱动。作为资本品占比高、跨国敞口显著的板块（波音、卡特彼勒、GE、霍尼韦尔、RTX），当ISM扩张在50以上、美元疲弱或稳定、油价因需求上升且美联储宽松或按兵不动时，XLI大幅上涨——即再通胀/增长向上象限。当ISM收缩、美元走强压制跨国营收、信用利差走阔或避险轮动将资金引向防御股时，XLI跑输。自2011年以来，XLI在再通胀上行体制（2016-2018、2020-2022、2022-2024、2025-2026）中大体排名前3-4，在美元走强的制造业收缩（2015-2016）或政策冲击性抛售（2018年四季度、2020年2-3月、2025年关税冲击）中排名后半。","top_signals":["ISM Manufacturing rolls over and prints two or more consecutive readings below 50","DXY breaks out to multi-year highs crushing multinational revenue guidance","Caterpillar or Boeing issue explicit forward-guidance warnings citing demand or tariff headwinds","XLI relative-strength rank drops from top-3 to middle-tier while defensives begin to lead"],"top_signals_zh":["ISM制造业PMI见顶并连续两个月或以上低于50","美元指数突破多年高点，跨国企业营收指引下调","卡特彼勒或波音明确发出需求/关税逆风的前瞻性警告","XLI相对强度排名从前3滑落至中游，防御板块开始领涨"]},"xlk":{"analog":"Today's setup (2026-03-30 rally cresting at early June, narrow +55% melt-up, SMH +74.4%, Broadcom guidance top, VIX ~16, equal-weight lag -8.6%) rhymes mechanically with the August 2022 peak-inflation hope rally (2022-06-16 to 2022-08-15: +23%, SMH +20.8%, goldilocks quad, then killed by a single hawkish catalyst at Jackson Hole): both legs were semis-led, growth-over-value risk-on rips terminated by a single identifiable event (Jackson Hole speech / Broadcom guidance refusal) rather than a macro regime change. The key difference is positioning -- 2022 was a counter-trend bounce inside an ongoing bear, whereas the current leg sits at a genuine cyclical top (cycle pos ~84, RS rank #1). If the 2022 mechanism holds, the next leg is a -15% to -25% selloff over 2-4 months into a VIX 28-52 spike, before a base forms for the next AI narrative re-ignition.","analog_zh":"当前市场形态（2026年3月30日启动的上涨腿于6月初见顶，SMH +74.4%，博通指引不及预期，VIX约16，等权落后-8.6%）与2022年\"通胀见顶预期\"反弹腿（2022-06-16至2022-08-15：+23%，SMH +20.8%，金发姑娘象限，最终被杰克逊霍尔单一鹰派催化剂终结）在机制上最为相似：两段腿均由半导体引领、成长跑赢价值，且均被单一可识别事件（杰克逊霍尔讲话/博通指引拒绝上调）而非宏观机制转变所终结。关键差异在于仓位——2022年是熊市内的反趋势反弹，而当前腿位于真正的周期顶部（周期位置约84，RS排名第1）。若2022年机制成立，下一腿将是持续2-4个月、幅度-15%至-25%的回调，伴随VIX升至28-52，之后才能为下一轮AI叙事重燃构筑基础。","bottom_signals":["VIX spike above 30-50 with defensives decisively leading cyclicals in the selloff (flight-to-safety rotation confirms macro overhang)","SMH breaks down 20%+ from recent high -- semis capitulation has historically marked within 2-4 weeks of XLK trough","Fed pivot signal (pause/cut announcement) or trade-war truce removes the macro overhang and provides the rebound catalyst","Equal-weight begins to outperform cap-weight as breadth broadens out, presaging XLK snapback from a washed-out base"],"bottom_signals_zh":["VIX飙升超过30-50，防御板块在抛售中大幅领先周期板块（避险轮动确认宏观压力）","SMH从近期高点下跌20%以上——半导体投降式下跌历史上出现在XLK低点前后2-4周内","美联储政策转向信号（暂停/降息宣布）或贸易战停火消除宏观压力，提供反弹催化剂","等权开始跑赢市值加权，市场广度扩散，预示XLK将从洗盘后的底部展开反弹"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["Interest-rate duration: ZIRP/QE inflates multiples; rate surges crush long-duration growth","AI/tech capex narrative: recurring super-cycle (mobile, cloud, genAI) drives earnings reacceleration","Mega-cap concentration: Apple/Microsoft/Nvidia dominate XLK weight, amplifying index moves","Semis (SMH) as leading indicator: semis top/bottom 2-6 weeks ahead of XLK turns","Trade/geopolitical supply-chain risk: China tariffs and export controls directly hit chip supply chains"],"drivers_zh":["利率久期敏感性：零利率/QE推升估值倍数；利率飙升重创长久期成长股","AI/科技资本开支叙事：反复出现的超级周期（移动、云计算、生成式AI）驱动盈利加速","大盘股高度集中：苹果/微软/英伟达主导XLK权重，放大指数波动","半导体（SMH）作为领先指标：半导体见顶/见底领先XLK转折2-6周","贸易/地缘政治供应链风险：中美关税与出口管制直接冲击芯片供应链"],"median_cycle_months":8,"summary":"Technology (XLK) cycles on the intersection of interest-rate duration sensitivity and a self-reinforcing capex/earnings super-cycle narrative. As the longest-duration sector in the S&P 500, its multiples expand in ZIRP/falling-rate environments and contract violently when real rates rise -- nearly every major selloff since 2018 has been led by a TLT selloff or a real-rate repricing. Rallies are amplified by a structural narrative engine: mobile (2011-18), cloud/FAANG (2013-20), COVID digitization (2020-21), and generative AI (2022-present) each provided a multi-year earnings acceleration that justified multiple expansion and caused mega-cap concentration (equal-weight consistently lagging cap-weight in bull legs). Tops are flagged when SMH leadership breaks on a specific catalyst, breadth narrows to extreme, and the sector sits at rank #1 with VIX compressed near 12-16. Troughs have consistently occurred when VIX spikes above 30-50 with defensives leading, and a clear policy pivot or tariff truce provides the snapback catalyst.","summary_zh":"科技板块（XLK）的周期由两大核心逻辑交织驱动：利率久期敏感性，以及资本开支/盈利超级叙事的自我强化效应。作为标普500中久期最长的板块，其估值倍数在零利率/降息环境中扩张，一旦实际利率上升便剧烈收缩——2018年以来几乎每次重大回调均由美债抛售或实际利率重定价所引领。反弹则被结构性叙事引擎放大：移动互联网（2011-18）、云/FANG（2013-20）、新冠数字化（2020-21）、生成式AI（2022至今），每一轮均提供了多年期盈利加速，使估值多重扩张合理化，并导致大盘股高度集中（牛市腿中等权持续落后市值加权）。顶部信号包括：SMH领涨行情因特定催化剂中断、市场广度极度收窄、以及板块以第1名高位停留而VIX压缩至12-16附近。低点则一贯出现在VIX飙升超过30-50、防御板块大幅领先、以及美联储政策转向或关税休战提供反弹催化剂之时。","top_signals":["SMH outperforms XLK strongly into the leg then stalls on a specific catalyst (earnings guidance miss, rate shock, or geopolitical supply-chain news)","Equal-weight vs cap-weight spread reaches -15% to -29% -- extreme narrow leadership is exhaustion, not strength","VIX compressed to 12-16 with XLK at RS rank #1","Growth-value spread above +30% signals crowded positioning vulnerable to mean-reversion"],"top_signals_zh":["SMH在本轮上涨腿中显著跑赢XLK后，因特定催化剂（盈利指引未达预期、利率冲击或地缘政治供应链消息）停滞","等权vs市值加权价差达到-15%至-29%——极度狭窄的领涨是衰竭信号，而非强势信号","VIX压缩至12-16，且XLK维持RS排名第1","成长-价值价差超过+30%，显示仓位过度拥挤，易受均值回归冲击"]},"xlp":{"analog":"Today's setup (June 2026) most rhymes with the 2018-05-03 to 2020-02-14 leg: in both cases XLP sits near a cycle trough in relative terms after a long growth/tech-led melt-up has drained defensive flows, the Fed has shifted from hiking to neutral/cutting holding yields in check, and geopolitical uncertainty (trade war then, tariffs now) creates sporadic risk-off bids that briefly lift staples before risk appetite reasserts. The key difference is that in 2018-2020 the VIX was more sustainably elevated by trade-war news flow, while in 2026 the VIX has re-compressed toward the low-to-mid teens in a reflation quad, suggesting the defensive bid is weaker this cycle and the analog points to continued relative underperformance unless a macro shock re-elevates VIX past 25.","analog_zh":"2026年6月当前格局与2018年5月3日至2020年2月14日那段行情最为相似：两种情形下，XLP均在科技/成长逼空行情长期抑制防御资金流入后处于相对周期低谷附近；美联储均已从加息转向中性/降息抑制收益率上行；地缘政治不确定性（彼时为贸易战，当前为关税）制造了间歇性避险买盘短暂推升必需消费品，但风险偏好随即再度主导。关键差异在于：2018至2020年间贸易战消息流更持续地支撑VIX处于高位，而2026年VIX已在反通胀象限中回落至10多点的低位区间，表明当前周期中防御买盘强度更弱，该类比指向持续相对跑输的前景——除非宏观冲击使VIX重新突破25。","bottom_signals":["VIX spike above 25 with defensives leading cyclicals by 5%+ in a rolling 30-day window: flight-to-safety rotation marks relative trough for XLP","10Y yield surges past 3.5% in a short window under 6 months: bond-proxy over-de-rating creates mean-reversion entry","SPY drawdown exceeds 15% while XLP drawdown is less than half of SPY's: relative cushion signals sector trough approaching before market bottom"],"bottom_signals_zh":["VIX突破25且防御板块在滚动30日窗口内领先周期板块超过5%：避险轮动标志XLP相对阶段性低点","10年期收益率在6个月以内飙升突破3.5%：债券替代品过度杀估值形成均值回归布局机会","SPY回调超过15%而XLP回调不及SPY一半：相对缓冲历史上常预示市场低点前出现板块底部信号"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["Fed rate cycle: cuts/pause = tailwind via bond-proxy re-rating; hikes = headwind","10-year Treasury yield level vs sector dividend yield spread (key 2.5-3% threshold)","VIX/recession fear regime: VIX above 25 triggers defensive rotation bid into staples","Dollar strength: DXY up is headwind for large-cap multinationals P&G, Colgate, Unilever","Commodity/input cost inflation vs pricing power: margin squeeze then recovery lag","Tech/growth melt-up periods systematically drain flows from low-vol defensives"],"drivers_zh":["美联储利率周期：降息/暂停=通过债券替代品重评带来顺风；加息=逆风","10年期国债收益率与板块股息收益率利差（关键2.5-3%阈值）","VIX/衰退恐慌体制：VIX突破25触发防御轮动避险买盘","美元强弱：DXY上涨是宝洁、高露洁、联合利华等跨国巨头的逆风","大宗商品/投入成本通胀与定价权的周期博弈：利润率承压再到恢复的滞后","科技/成长逼空行情期间系统性抽干低波动防御板块资金流入"],"median_cycle_months":36,"summary":"Consumer staples is the market's classic bond-proxy and late-cycle shelter: it outperforms when the Fed is cutting or pausing (yield-spread compression favors its high dividend), when recession fears spike (non-discretionary demand is non-negotiable), or when trade/geopolitical shocks send VIX above 25. It underperforms in two distinct regimes - rising-rate environments (bond-proxy re-rating) and risk-on melt-ups (capital deserts defensives for higher-beta growth) - which together account for the majority of calendar time, explaining why XLP perennially lags SPY on a cumulative basis despite being a safe sector. The recurring structural engine is yield-spread arbitrage: when the sector dividend yield (~2.5-3%) compresses toward the 10-year Treasury yield, the relative yield advantage vanishes and marginal capital can earn a similar payout with zero equity risk.","summary_zh":"必需消费品是市场典型的债券替代品与周期末期避风港：当美联储降息或暂停加息时（收益率利差收窄利于高股息板块）、衰退恐慌飙升时（非可选消费需求具有刚性）、或贸易/地缘政治冲击使VIX突破25时，该板块跑赢大盘。在两种截然不同的环境下跑输：利率上行期（债券替代品杀估值）与风险偏好驱动的逼空行情期（资本从防御板块流向高贝塔成长股）——这两种情形合计占据日历时间的大部分，解释了为何XLP尽管被视为安全板块，却在累积收益上长期落后于SPY。核心结构驱动力是股息收益率价差套利：当板块股息收益率（约2.5-3%）压缩至接近10年期国债收益率时，相对收益优势消失，边际资金可在零股票风险下获得相似回报。","top_signals":["10Y yield compresses below 2.5% AND VIX below 15 simultaneously: yield premium vanishes, risk appetite normalizes, flows exit defensives","Tech/semis lead all 11 sectors by 10%+ for 12+ consecutive months: defensive flows at trough, contrarian rotation signal","High-beta minus low-vol spread widens beyond +10% over a 12-month window: momentum extreme historically preceding XLP relative peak"],"top_signals_zh":["10年期收益率同时压缩至2.5%以下且VIX低于15：收益率溢价消失、风险偏好回归正常，资金流出防御板块","科技/半导体领跑11个板块高达10%+且连续12个月以上：防御资金处于谷底，周期轮动的反向信号","12个月窗口内高贝塔跑赢低波动超过+10%：动量极端，历史上常预示XLP相对周期高点"]},"xlre":{"analog":"The current setup (2025-04-08 to present) most rhymes with the 2016-11-10 to 2020-02-21 leg: REITs are mid-recovery off a deep trough (tariff crash vs Trump reflation trough), rates have eased marginally from the panic high (TLT +4.2% vs +30.8% over the full prior bull), but a tech-led mega-cap melt-up (semis +240.9% now vs +130% then) is consuming flows and relegating XLRE to a rank #7 follower. The key difference is that the 2016-2020 leg lasted ~39 months because the Fed had ample room to cut three times in 2019; today the oil-shock CPI (~4.2%) and Fed hiking bias truncate the runway, suggesting a shorter, shallower bull that tops earlier — closer to the 2022-06-16 to 2022-08-15 two-month relief bounce than a multi-year compounding run.","analog_zh":"当前格局（2025年4月8日至今）最接近2016年11月10日至2020年2月21日那段行情：REIT正从深度低谷（关税崩盘 vs 特朗普再通胀低点）中途复苏，利率从恐慌高点小幅回落（TLT+4.2% vs 上一完整牛市的+30.8%），但科技领涨的大型股熔涨（半导体+240.9% vs 当时+130%）持续抽走资金，使XLRE沦为排名第7的跟随者。关键区别在于：2016-2020那段延续约39个月，因为美联储2019年有充足空间三度降息；而今油价冲击CPI（约4.2%）和美联储加息倾向压缩了跑道，暗示这是一轮更短、更浅的牛市，筑顶更早——更接近2022年6月16日至8月15日那段为期两个月的纾解反弹，而非多年复利行情。","bottom_signals":["10Y yield peaking / TLT rallying >5% — REIT trough has historically followed within 1-4 weeks","Utilities co-leading with Real Estate and credit spreads tightening — flight-to-safety bid exhausted, pivot imminent","XLRE ranked #10-#11 for 2+ consecutive legs with VIX elevated — capitulation exhaustion","Fed language pivot (pause/cut language) or CPI surprise lower — the causal trigger for yield reversal"],"bottom_signals_zh":["10年期收益率见顶/TLT单段上涨>5%——REIT低点历史上在随后1-4周内出现","公用事业与房地产共同领涨且信用利差收窄——避险需求耗尽，转向临近","XLRE连续2段以上排名第10-11且VIX高企——投降式耗尽","美联储措辞转向（暂停/降息表态）或CPI意外走低——收益率逆转的因果触发"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["10-year Treasury yield direction (cap-rate mechanism)","Fed policy regime (hike/pause/cut cycle)","Dollar strength (headwind via global capital flows and refinancing costs)","Subsector demand shifts (e-commerce/industrial, AI datacenters, multifamily)","Risk-on vs risk-off rotation (defensives-vs-cyclicals flow balance)","Credit conditions (HYG/LQD spread — REIT leverage cost)"],"drivers_zh":["10年期美债收益率方向（资本化率机制）","美联储政策周期（加息/暂停/降息）","美元强弱（通过全球资本流动与再融资成本形成逆/顺风）","子板块需求结构转变（电商/工业、AI数据中心、多户型住宅）","风险偏好vs避险轮动（防御股-周期股资金平衡）","信用环境（HYG/LQD利差——REIT杠杆成本）"],"median_cycle_months":19,"summary":"Real Estate (XLRE) cycles as a mechanically rate-sensitive bond proxy: its primary driver is the direction and level of long-term Treasury yields (10Y / TLT), which move inversely to REIT valuations via the cap-rate discount mechanism. Every major peak has coincided with a yield surge or rate-regime shift (the Trump reflation trade Nov 2016, the Fed hiking cycle 2022-23, the post-election yield backup 2024), and every major trough has been triggered by a yield decline or Fed pivot (the 2015-16 deflation scare, the 2019 pause, the 2022-23 peak-CPI turn, and the 2024 cut cycle). Structural sector tailwinds from e-commerce (industrial/logistics REITs), data-centre cloud demand, and multifamily housing shortages have added a second-order return layer on top of the rate signal, becoming increasingly important post-2020 as the subsector mix shifted away from office and retail toward digital infrastructure.","summary_zh":"房地产（XLRE）作为机械性利率敏感的债券替代品循环运行：核心驱动是长端美债收益率（10年期/TLT）的方向和水平，通过资本化率贴现机制与REIT估值呈反向关系。每一次重大峰值均与收益率飙升或利率象限转变同步（2016年11月特朗普再通胀交易、2022-23年美联储加息周期、2024年大选后收益率回升），每一次重大低谷均由收益率下行或美联储转向触发（2015-16年通缩恐慌、2019年暂停加息、2022-23年CPI见顶转折、2024年降息周期）。电商（工业/物流REIT）、数据中心云需求和多户型住宅供给短缺带来的结构性板块顺风，在利率信号之上叠加了二阶回报层，且2020年后随着板块构成从写字楼、零售向数字基础设施转移而愈发重要。","top_signals":["10Y yield surging / TLT falling >5% in the leg — the single most reliable peak signal","Financials and Energy leading while XLRE ranks #9-#11 — reflation rotation out of bond proxy","Dollar strengthening >3% DXY concurrent with yield rise — double headwind confirming regime shift","VIX rising with defensives lagging cyclicals — rate-regime selloff (not just risk-off)"],"top_signals_zh":["10年期收益率飙升/TLT单段下跌>5%——最可靠的单一见顶信号","金融股和能源股领涨而XLRE排名第9-11——再通胀轮动流出债券替代品","美元同步走强>3%（DXY）叠加收益率上升——双重逆风确认象限转变","VIX上升而防御股跑输周期股——利率象限抛售（非单纯避险）"]},"xlu":{"analog":"The current setup (June 2026) most rhymes with mid-2015 (Leg 1 trough into Leg 2 start): a growth-up quad with rising/sticky rates, dollar strength, a narrow tech-led tape starving defensives, and XLU sitting near multi-year relative lows vs SPY — yet with an underlying income-yield support floor and an emerging structural demand catalyst (2015: stretched-low yields after the selloff; 2026: AI power demand). In both periods the recovery was triggered not by an XLU-specific catalyst but by the tech/cyclical tape exhausting and yields rolling over, after which XLU delivered a multi-year catch-up rally.","analog_zh":"当前（2026年6月）形势与2015年中期最为相似（第1段底部→第2段启动）：增长向上象限下利率高企且具黏性、美元强势、狭窄科技引领的行情冷落防御股，XLU相对SPY处于多年相对低位——但有基本收益率支撑底部，并存在新兴结构性需求催化剂（2015年：抛售后收益率极低延伸；2026年：AI电力需求）。两个时期的反弹均非由XLU特定利好事件触发，而是在科技/周期行情趋于枯竭、收益率回落后，XLU上演了多年期的补涨行情。","bottom_signals":["10-year Treasury yield peaks and rolls over (inverse: rate peak = utility trough)","XLU dividend-yield spread vs Treasuries widens to historical highs (>1.5%)","VIX spike signals broad risk-off completed; defensives cheapened on a relative basis","Tech/growth melt-up exhausts and equal-weight breadth begins to broaden vs cap-weight"],"bottom_signals_zh":["10年期美债收益率见顶回落（反向信号：利率峰值=公用事业底部）","XLU股息率与美债利差扩大至历史高位（>1.5%）","VIX飙升标志风险规避结束，防御板块相对估值已便宜化","科技/成长逼空行情趋于枯竭，等权重广度开始超越市值加权"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["10-year Treasury yield direction (inverse relationship)","Fed rate cycle (hike=headwind, cut=tailwind)","risk-on vs risk-off sector rotation (starved vs bid)","dividend yield spread vs Treasuries (valuation anchor)","electricity demand growth — AI/datacenter structural layer","dollar strength (secondary headwind)"],"drivers_zh":["10年期美债收益率方向（反向关系）","美联储加息/降息周期","风险偏好转换（防御vs进攻轮动）","公用事业股息率与美债利差（估值锚）","电力需求增长（AI/数据中心结构性层次）","美元强弱（次级阻力）"],"median_cycle_months":26,"summary":"Utilities (XLU) cycles primarily as a duration-sensitive bond proxy: it rises when Treasury yields fall or stabilize (rate-relief bids, Fed pivots, growth scares, deflation episodes) and sells off sharply when yields surge (rate-hike cycles, inflation shocks, reflation quads). The secondary driver is sector starvation — in strong risk-on/melt-up regimes (tech/semis-led), capital is pulled from the sector even when fundamentals are intact, leaving XLU range-bound or drifting lower regardless of dividend-yield support. The 2023-2026 AI-datacenter super-cycle introduced a structural growth layer that partially overrides the pure bond-proxy framework, making future cycles more complex than historical rate-only models imply.","summary_zh":"公用事业（XLU）主要作为久期敏感的债券替代品循环：当美债收益率下行或企稳（利率缓和买盘、美联储转向、增长恐慌、通缩情景）时上涨，当收益率飙升（加息周期、通胀冲击、再通胀象限）时急跌。第二大驱动力是板块被冷落效应——在强劲的风险偏好/逼空行情（科技/半导体引领）中，即便基本面完好，资金也会流出该板块，使XLU在股息率支撑下仍区间震荡或缓慢回落。2023-2026年AI数据中心超级周期引入了结构性增长维度，部分覆盖了纯债券替代品框架，使未来XLU周期比历史纯利率模型所揭示的更为复杂。","top_signals":["TLT topping or 10-year yield bottoming — bond-rally exhaustion signals utility peak","XLU dividend-yield spread vs 10-year collapses near zero or inverts (overvaluation)","Risk-on rotation intensifies — high-beta outpaces low-vol by 10%+ over 3 months","Reflation/growth-up quad with rising oil and cyclicals sharply outpacing defensives"],"top_signals_zh":["TLT见顶或10年期收益率触底——债券牛市枯竭预示公用事业峰值","XLU股息率与10年期美债利差收窄至接近零或倒挂（高估信号）","风险偏好轮动强化——高贝塔在3个月内跑赢低波动超10%","再通胀/增长向上象限中油价上涨、周期股大幅跑赢防御股"]},"xlv":{"analog":"The current 2025-26 leg most rhymes with the 2015-09-28 leg: both followed a sharp policy-driven selloff (Clinton pricing tweet in September 2015 / MFN executive order in May 2025) that crushed biotech and managed care to multi-year lows, both launched in a macro environment where defensives were undervalued relative to cyclicals, and both saw falling yields provide the rerating catalyst as the macro quad transitioned. In 2015-18, XLV ran +56% and kept pace with SPY even as tech dominated; the current leg is tracking similarly with the added tailwind of GLP-1 and managed-care re-rating plus cleared drug-pricing headline risk once the MFN deals were signed.","analog_zh":"当前2025-26年的行情与2015年9月28日那段最为神似：两者均发生在政策驱动的急跌之后（2015年9月克林顿药价推文 / 2025年5月MFN行政令），将生物科技和管理式医疗打压至多年低位；启动时宏观环境中防御股相对周期股被低估；且均以利率下行作为重估催化剂，随宏观象限切换而发酵。2015-18年那段XLV累涨+56%，即便科技主导期间也与SPY同步；当前这段走势轨迹类似，且在MFN协议签署、药品定价头条风险消除后，还多了GLP-1/管理式医疗重估的额外顺风。","bottom_signals":["Policy fear peak: drug-pricing or Medicare-for-All rhetoric at maximum, sector valuations at historic lows relative to SPY","Biotech (XBI) at multi-year support with extreme negative sentiment; managed-care P/E troughs","VIX spikes above 30 and XLV outperforms SPY on the downside — defensive leadership confirms a trough is near","Rate regime inflects: real yields peak and TLT starts rallying, removing the duration headwind from biotech"],"bottom_signals_zh":["政策恐慌见顶：药品定价/全民医保言论达到高峰，板块估值相对SPY处于历史低位","生物科技（XBI）在多年支撑位附近且情绪极度悲观；管理式医疗市盈率触底","VIX飙升至30以上而XLV下行幅度优于SPY——防御性领先确认低点临近","利率体制转折：实际收益率见顶，TLT开始反弹，消除生物科技的久期阻力"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["drug pricing policy risk (MFN, Medicare negotiation, campaign season threats)","duration sensitivity — biotech de-rates on rising real rates","defensives-vs-cyclicals rotation (starved in risk-on tech melt-ups)","ACA and coverage expansion earnings tailwinds","GLP-1 and precision-medicine blockbuster drug cycle"],"drivers_zh":["药品定价政策风险（MFN、Medicare谈判、大选周期威胁）","久期敏感性——实际利率上升时生物科技遭杀估值","防御股与周期股轮动（风险偏好高涨的科技逼空行情中资金匮乏）","ACA/医保覆盖扩大带来的盈利顺风","GLP-1与精准医疗爆款药物周期"],"median_cycle_months":28,"summary":"Health Care (XLV) cycles on the intersection of three structural forces: policy risk (drug pricing, insurance coverage, Medicare/Medicaid reimbursement), duration sensitivity (biotech is a long-duration asset that de-rates when real rates rise), and the defensives-vs-cyclicals rotation cycle (XLV underperforms when risk appetite is high and mega-cap tech leads, and outperforms when policy uncertainty clears, rates fall, or growth decelerates). The sector's peak-to-peak cycle averages roughly 28 months but is dominated by the macro quad — it leads only in late-cycle slowdowns or when it carries an idiosyncratic policy catalyst (ACA passage, GLP-1 re-rating); otherwise it is starved by cyclical and tech leadership.","summary_zh":"医疗保健（XLV）的周期由三股结构性力量交汇驱动：政策风险（药品定价、医疗保险覆盖范围、Medicare/Medicaid报销机制）、久期敏感性（生物科技属长久期资产，实际利率上升时杀估值）以及防御股与周期股的轮动周期（风险偏好高涨、大市值科技主导时XLV跑输；政策不确定性消除、利率下行或经济增长减速时XLV跑赢）。该板块峰值间距平均约28个月，但主要受宏观象限主导——仅在周期后期放缓阶段或具备特异性政策催化剂（ACA立法、GLP-1重估）时才能领跑大市；否则往往被周期股和科技股夺走资金。","top_signals":["IBB/XBI biotech ratio near multi-year highs with momentum stretched","Policy cycle at peak: major drug-pricing legislation passed or executive orders signed, removing the speculative policy-relief premium","Cyclicals begin catching up from a prolonged lag — rotation out of defensives starts","VIX compressing and high-beta over low-vol turning strongly positive — flows rotate to risk assets"],"top_signals_zh":["IBB/XBI生物科技比率接近多年高位且动量过度拉伸","政策周期见顶：重大药品定价立法通过或行政令落地，消除投机性的政策利好溢价","周期股开始从长期落后中追赶——防御资金外流启动","VIX压缩且高贝塔减低波动转为强劲正值——资金轮动至风险资产"]},"xly":{"analog":"The current setup most closely rhymes with the 2023-07-19 leg: in both cases XLY is stuck near the bottom of the table (now #10) while real wage growth is being consumed by oil/rate-driven pressure, the dollar is firming, and the sector cannot participate in a tech-led risk-on rally because its two dominant names (Amazon, Tesla) face macro headwinds rather than an idiosyncratic earnings failure. Just as the July-October 2023 selloff ended when the 10-year topped and the Fed pivoted to cuts, the current bottoming phase requires durable oil relief (a stable Hormuz reopening) and a Fed pause/cut to unlock XLY's catch-up trade.","analog_zh":"当前格局与2023年7月19日的走势最为相似：两种情形下XLY都被困在排名靠后的位置（当前第10位），实际工资增长被油价/利率驱动的压力所吞噬，美元走强，板块无法参与科技引领的risk-on上涨，因为其两大主导股票（亚马逊、特斯拉）承受的是宏观逆风而非特有盈利问题。正如2023年7-10月的抛售在10年期美债收益率见顶且美联储转向降息后结束，当前的筑底阶段同样需要持久的油价纾解（霍尔木兹海峡稳定重启）和美联储暂停/降息来解锁XLY的追涨交易。","bottom_signals":["XLY ranked #10-11 of 11 for 4+ consecutive weeks with VIX elevated (30+) — exhaustion of the flight-to-safety sellers","Amazon and Tesla at or below 3-year trough P/E multiples on improving earnings outlooks","Oil/gasoline reversing sharply lower, restoring real consumer purchasing power","Fed pivot signal (pause, cut, or easing language) removing the duration headwind from Amazon/Tesla"],"bottom_signals_zh":["XLY连续4周以上排名第10-11位，VIX偏高（30+）——避险抛压耗尽","亚马逊和特斯拉市盈率在改善的盈利展望下处于或低于3年低谷倍数","油价/汽油价格急剧下跌，恢复消费者实际购买力","美联储转向信号（暂停、降息或宽松措辞）消除亚马逊/特斯拉的久期逆风"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["real consumer purchasing power (real wages minus inflation/gasoline)","Fed rate regime (mortgage rates / long-duration P/E)","Amazon and Tesla idiosyncratic earnings power","risk-on/risk-off rotation into/out of high-beta cyclicals","dollar strength (headwind for Amazon global, consumer import costs)","big-ticket demand cycle (autos, homebuilders, housing starts)"],"drivers_zh":["消费者实际购买力（实际工资减去通胀/汽油）","美联储利率体制（抵押贷款利率/长久期市盈率）","亚马逊和特斯拉的特有盈利能力","risk-on/risk-off轮动进出高贝塔周期股","美元强弱（亚马逊全球业务及消费进口成本的逆/顺风）","大额需求周期（汽车、房屋建筑商、新屋开工）"],"median_cycle_months":15,"summary":"XLY cycles as a leveraged proxy for the US consumer and mega-cap growth: it is structurally dominated by Amazon and Tesla (~33% combined), making it simultaneously a big-ticket consumer play and a long-duration tech trade. It leads in risk-on/goldilocks quads when real wages are rising, mortgage rates are falling and the dollar is stable-to-weak, and it collapses into flight-to-safety and stagflation regimes when inflation squeezes purchasing power, rising rates de-rate its high-PE mega-caps, or when idiosyncratic shocks hit its two dominant names (Musk share sales, DeepSeek, tariffs). The sector's peak signal is almost always consensus bullishness on the consumer, an expensive P/E for Amazon/Tesla, and a narrow, high-beta tape that leaves no margin of safety when the macro turns.","summary_zh":"XLY作为美国消费者和大型成长股的杠杆代理而循环：该板块在结构上被亚马逊和特斯拉主导（合计约33%），使其同时成为大额消费交易和长久期科技交易。在实际工资上升、抵押贷款利率下降、美元稳定偏弱时，它在risk-on/金发女孩象限中领涨；而当通胀挤压购买力、利率上升压低其高PE大型股估值，或当其两大主导股票遭受特有冲击（马斯克抛售、DeepSeek、关税）时，它在避险和滞胀体制中崩塌。板块见顶信号几乎总是消费者的市场共识乐观情绪、亚马逊/特斯拉昂贵的市盈率，以及一轮狭窄、高贝塔的行情——一旦宏观转向，几乎没有安全边际。","top_signals":["XLY ranked #1-2 of 11 for 2+ consecutive months in a narrow, mega-cap-led tape (high crowding, no margin of safety)","Amazon and/or Tesla at elevated forward P/E with decelerating revenue growth","VIX sub-15, high-beta beating low-vol by 15%+ over trailing 6 months","Fed hiking or hawkish pivot after an extended easing cycle"],"top_signals_zh":["在狭窄、大型股主导的行情中XLY连续2个月以上排名第1-2位（拥挤度高，无安全边际）","亚马逊和/或特斯拉远期市盈率偏高而营收增速放缓","VIX低于15，过去6个月高贝塔跑赢低波动15%以上","在长期宽松周期后美联储开始加息或转向鹰派"]},"b-ai_agents":{"analog":"Closest to the April 2025 trough setup: same high-beta snapback off a macro-panic low (the Hormuz ceasefire in 2026 rhymes with the tariff-pause bounce in April 2025), in both cases driven by a sudden removal of the tail-risk event that triggered the selloff, a semis-led tech rally in a goldilocks-leaning quad, narrow mega-cap breadth (RSP lagging SPY), and the basket amplifying SPY by 3x+. The key difference is that the April 2025 leg had a cleaner enterprise agentic-AI adoption tailwind underpinning it; the current June 2026 leg is earlier in the revenue-conversion cycle and faces a stronger dollar headwind (DXY +3.4% now vs DXY -3.3% in April 2025), suggesting the snapback may be shallower unless agent ARR inflects visibly in H2 2026 earnings.","analog_zh":"与2025年4月低谷的形态最为相近：同为宏观恐慌低点后的高贝塔急速反弹（2026年霍尔木兹停火与2025年4月关税暂停反弹高度吻合），两者均由触发抛售的尾部风险事件骤然消除驱动，芯片领涨科技在偏金发女孩象限，大盘股广度窄幅（RSP跑输SPY），篮子放大SPY 3倍以上。关键区别在于2025年4月那段拥有更清晰的企业级智能体AI采用顺风支撑；当前2026年6月这段收入转化周期尚早，且美元阻力更强（DXY现为+3.4% vs 2025年4月的-3.3%），表明除非智能体ARR在2026年下半年财报中出现明显拐点，本次反弹的高度可能偏浅。","bottom_signals":["VIX spike above 30-35 with defensives outperforming cyclicals by more than 10pp","High-beta crushed: SPHB-SPLV spread below -15pp signals capitulation in speculative growth","New credible AI platform catalyst: a datable announcement (ChatGPT, Agentforce launch, etc.)","Fed policy pivot or credible pivot signal: rate cuts or zero-rate extension narrative"],"bottom_signals_zh":["VIX飙升至30-35以上，防御股跑赢周期股超过10个百分点","高贝塔崩溃：SPHB-SPLV价差跌破-15pp标志投机性成长股投降","新可信AI平台催化剂：可定日期的重大公告（ChatGPT、Agentforce上线等）","美联储政策转向或可信转向信号：降息或维持零利率的叙事延伸"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["Fed discount-rate regime: zero/falling rates expand duration multiples; hiking cycles collapse them","AI platform monetization narrative: credible new layer (cloud SaaS, GenAI, Agentic) drives re-rating","Tech/semis risk-on cycle: SMH leads the basket; semis momentum is the leading indicator","Growth-value factor: basket is pure long-duration growth; value rotation is the primary exit signal","Macro quad: goldilocks/disinflation is the ideal quad; stagflation/slowdown is maximally hostile","VIX and high-beta factor: basket amplifies every risk-on/risk-off move by 3-5x vs SPY"],"drivers_zh":["美联储贴现率制度：零利率/降息扩张久期倍数，加息周期压缩倍数","AI平台变现叙事：可信新应用层（云SaaS、生成式AI、智能体）驱动重估","科技/芯片风险偏好周期：SMH领先篮子，芯片动能为先行指标","成长-价值因子：篮子为纯粹长久期成长，价值轮动是首要退出信号","宏观象限：金发女孩/反通缩最理想，滞胀/放缓最具破坏性","VIX与高贝塔因子：篮子对风险偏好/风险规避的放大倍数为SPY的3-5倍"],"median_cycle_months":8.4,"summary":"AI Agents and Applications cycles are driven by the intersection of Fed discount-rate regime and the platform-monetization narrative: the basket re-rates violently when zero or falling rates collide with a credible new AI monetization layer (cloud SaaS re-rating 2014-2015, ChatGPT 2022-2025), and de-rates just as violently when real yields surge or the AI application economics are questioned (2021-2022 rate cycle, 2025 DeepSeek scare). Because the basket consists almost entirely of zero-profit or thin-margin software names with multi-year revenue runways, it carries the longest duration in the tech complex and is structurally the highest-beta amplifier of the broader SPY/Tech cycle: on average it moves 3-5x the SPY in both directions. Peaks consistently coincide with narrow mega-cap breadth extremes (RSP lagging SPY by -10% to -32%), growth-value spread exhaustion, and slowing semis momentum, while troughs are marked by VIX spikes, defensive outperformance, and the emergence of a new credible AI platform catalyst.","summary_zh":"AI智能体与应用的周期由美联储贴现率制度与平台变现叙事的交叉驱动：当零利率或降息与可信的新AI变现层叠加时（2014-2015年云SaaS重估、2022-2025年ChatGPT），篮子发生剧烈上涨重估；而当实际收益率飙升或AI应用经济效益受质疑时（2021-2022年加息周期、2025年DeepSeek冲击），则同样剧烈下跌。由于篮子几乎全部由零盈利或薄利润、多年收入兑现周期的软件个股构成，其在科技板块中的久期最长，结构性上是更广泛SPY/科技周期的最高贝塔放大器：平均双向均以3-5倍放大SPY涨跌。峰值始终与窄幅大盘股广度极端（RSP跑输SPY -10%至-32%）、成长-价值价差耗尽及芯片动能放缓共现；低谷则由VIX飙升、防御股跑赢以及新可信AI平台催化剂的涌现标志。","top_signals":["Narrow breadth extreme: RSP lagging SPY by more than -10% signals mega-cap concentration peak","Growth-value exhaustion: growth outperformance above +15-20pp over 6 months signals crowding","VIX complacency: VIX sustained below 15 with semis extended above +30% from 52-week lows","AI narrative saturation: wave of enterprise pilot announcements with no revenue conversion yet reported"],"top_signals_zh":["广度极端收窄：RSP跑输SPY超过-10%标志大盘股集中度峰值","成长-价值耗尽：6个月内成长跑赢幅度超过15-20个百分点标志拥挤","VIX自满：VIX持续低于15且芯片较52周低点涨幅超+30%","AI叙事饱和：企业试点公告潮起但无收入转化数据落地"]},"b-ai_infra":{"analog":"Closest to the Jan-2025 peak analog: same narrow-melt-up-to-guidance-miss setup as the Feb-2020 topping leg. In both cases, a 50-90% run in 14-21 months off a major trough ended with a single catalyst cracking the leadership narrative (COVID spread in Feb 2020, Broadcom AI-chip miss in Jun 2026) just as the macro regime was shifting from supportive to tighter (DXY strengthening, Fed dot-plot turning hawkish). In both instances the basket was at extreme high-beta concentration (semis and mega-cap AI names accounting for the bulk of returns, RSP lagging SPY by 6-13%), making it acutely vulnerable to a cascade once the narrative wobbled. The key difference is that in 2020 the catalyst was a demand-destruction shock; here the risk is a capex-efficiency and valuation-compression story, which historically resolves with a 25-38% drawdown before the next re-entry.","analog_zh":"与2025年1月峰顶模拟最为接近：与2020年2月筑顶腿相同的窄幅熔涨-业绩指引失望组合。两次均是在重大低点后14-21个月50-90%的涨幅以单一催化剂打破领导叙事（2020年2月新冠蔓延、2026年6月Broadcom AI芯片指引失望），恰逢宏观体制从支持性转向更紧缩（DXY走强，美联储点阵图转鹰）。两次均处于极端高贝塔集中（半导体和大盘AI名称贡献大部分回报，RSP跑输SPY 6-13%），一旦叙事动摇便极易引发连锁。关键区别在于2020年催化剂是需求破坏冲击，而此次风险是资本开支效率与估值压缩故事，历史上通常以25-38%的回撤后再次入场告终。","bottom_signals":["VIX spike peak (28+ to 36-76 range) coinciding with defensives leading vs cyclicals by 10%+ — panic maximum","Fed pivot signal (language shift from 'hikes' to 'patience' or first rate cut)","hyperscaler capex guidance re-acceleration in quarterly earnings (AWS/Azure cloud revenue beat + raised outlook)","SMH / SOX bottoming before SPY with semis leading on 3-5% up days"],"bottom_signals_zh":["VIX尖峰见顶（28+至36-76区间）同时防御股相对周期股领先10%以上——最大恐慌","美联储转向信号（措辞从'加息'转向'耐心'或首次降息）","季度财报中超大规模云厂商资本开支指引再加速（AWS/Azure云收入超预期+上调展望）","SMH/SOX在SPY之前见底，半导体在3-5%上涨日中领涨"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["hyperscaler capex cycle (AWS/Azure/Google/Meta GPU and data-center spend)","Fed funds rate / long-duration multiple sensitivity (TLT inversely correlated)","semiconductor cycle (SMH as lead indicator)","risk-on/risk-off beta amplification (high-beta minus low-vol spread)","macro quad regime (reflation/goldilocks = tailwind; stagflation/slowdown = headwind)"],"drivers_zh":["超大规模云厂商资本开支周期（AWS/Azure/谷歌/Meta GPU与数据中心支出）","美联储利率/长久期估值敏感性（TLT负相关）","半导体周期（SMH为领先指标）","风险偏好/风险厌恶贝塔放大（高贝塔减低波动利差）","宏观象限体制（再通胀/金发女孩为顺风；滞胀/放缓为逆风）"],"median_cycle_months":17.3,"summary":"AI Infrastructure cycles as the highest-beta expression of the macro risk-on/risk-off regime: it amplifies SPY by 1.5x to 3x in both directions, with peaks reliably marked by rate-shock or guidance-miss inflection points after extended narrow mega-cap melt-ups, and troughs marked by peak-fear VIX spikes after defensive-led selloffs. Its structural driver is the hyperscaler capex cycle — the group rises when cloud giants are spending aggressively on GPU compute and networking and falls when either rate-shock compresses long-duration multiples or the capex thesis is challenged by efficiency breakthroughs or policy shocks. Unlike the 11 GICS sectors, AI Infra has no defensive earnings floor: it is a pure-play on the intersection of secular growth (compute demand) and financial-conditions sensitivity (long-duration multiples), making it the first to break when rates rise and the first to lead when the Fed pivots or capex commitments re-accelerate.","summary_zh":"AI基础设施是宏观风险偏好/风险厌恶体制的最高贝塔表达：在两个方向上对SPY的放大倍数达1.5x至3x，顶部可靠地由利率冲击或业绩指引失望在延长的窄幅大盘股熔涨后标志，底部则由防御股主导的抛售后VIX见顶恐慌尖峰标志。其结构性驱动力是超大规模云厂商资本开支周期——当云巨头积极投入GPU算力和网络时篮子上涨，当利率冲击压缩长久期估值或资本开支逻辑遭效率突破/政策冲击挑战时下跌。与11个GICS行业板块不同，AI基础设施没有防御性盈利底部：它是长期增长（算力需求）与金融条件敏感性（长久期估值）交叉处的纯粹押注，使其成为利率上升时首先破位、美联储转向或资本开支承诺再加速时首先领涨的篮子。","top_signals":["semis (SMH) failing to confirm new highs while basket continues to push — divergence precedes peak by 1-4 weeks","guidance miss by a leading hyperscaler or Nvidia after extended melt-up (e.g. Broadcom June 2026, Q4 2021 cloud deceleration)","DXY strengthening + TLT falling simultaneously (tighter financial conditions compressing long-duration multiples)","VIX below 14 + RSP lagging SPY by more than 5% — narrow melt-up exhaustion"],"top_signals_zh":["SMH未能确认新高而篮子续创高位——背离领先峰顶1-4周","延长熔涨后龙头超大规模云厂商或英伟达业绩指引失望（如2026年6月Broadcom、2021年四季度云增速放缓）","DXY走强同时TLT下跌（金融条件收紧压缩长久期估值）","VIX低于14且RSP跑输SPY超过5%——窄幅熔涨耗尽"]},"b-ai_neoclouds":{"analog":"The current setup most rhymes with the December 2024 peak rather than a clean July-2023-style top. As in late 2024, the basket sits richly extended after a violent melt-up with high-beta excess stretched (SPHB-SPLV +20.7%) and the dollar firming (DXY +3.4%) — both rate/dollar headwinds that have historically preceded sharp high-beta drawdowns. But unlike the classic narrow-top template, breadth is currently BROADENING (RSP beating SPY +2.9%), and the June 2026 Broadcom event was a beat-and-raise (record $10.8B AI quarter, ~$56B FY guide) that fell only on positioning, not a demand break. The bearish trigger to watch is the same three-variable combination that ended prior legs: extended valuation, a DXY/rate headwind that keeps biting, and a genuine AI-demand disappointment (not just an under-whelming raise). Absent the latter, the historical analog argues for elevated drawdown RISK but not a confirmed top.","analog_zh":"当前格局更像2024年12月的峰值，而非干净的2023年7月式顶部。如同2024年末，篮子在猛烈熔涨后估值高度延伸、高贝塔溢价偏高（SPHB-SPLV +20.7%）、美元走强（DXY +3.4%）——两者都是历史上曾先于高贝塔急剧回撤的利率/美元阻力。但与典型窄幅顶部模板不同，当前广度正在转宽（RSP跑赢SPY +2.9%），且2026年6月博通事件是超预期并上调（AI单季创纪录108亿、全年指引约560亿），仅因仓位而下跌，而非需求破裂。需警惕的看空触发是终结此前各段的同一三变量组合：估值过度延伸、持续咬合的美元/利率阻力，以及真正的AI需求落空（而非仅是上调幅度不及预期）。若无后者，历史类比指向回撤风险升高，但尚未确认顶部。","bottom_signals":["VIX spike to extreme (>40) with basket down >50% from peak","Fed pivot signal or rate peak confirmed (TLT turning higher)","AI-compute demand data point confirming scarcity (e.g. NVIDIA/Broadcom guide-up)","high-beta starting to outperform low-vol after multi-month underperformance"],"bottom_signals_zh":["VIX飙至极端(>40)，篮子自峰值下跌>50%","美联储转向信号或利率见顶确认(TLT向上转)","AI算力需求数据点确认稀缺性(如英伟达/博通上调指引)","高贝塔在数月跑输后开始跑赢低波动"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["macro risk-on/risk-off regime (primary driver pre- and post-AI)","Fed rate cycle / bond yields (TLT inverse relationship)","GPU/AI compute demand narrative (post-Nov 2022 structural shift)","semiconductor cycle (SMH as leading indicator / co-mover)","USD direction (DXY headwind for capital-intensive borrowers)","crypto cycle (pre-2023 mining origins still influence sentiment)"],"drivers_zh":["宏观风险偏好/规避机制(AI前后均为主要驱动)","美联储利率周期/债券收益率(与TLT逆向关系)","GPU/AI算力需求叙事(2022年11月后的结构性转变)","半导体周期(SMH为领先指标/同向联动)","美元方向(DXY对重资本借贷方的阻力)","加密货币周期(2023年前矿企起源仍影响情绪)"],"median_cycle_months":12,"summary":"AI Neoclouds and HPC Hosting is structurally the highest-beta amplifier in the equity market: it rallies 3-5x the SPY in melt-ups and falls 3-5x harder in risk-off regimes. The recurring causal engine is a two-switch system: (1) macro regime (risk-on/reflation favors it disproportionately; rate-shock or growth-scare wipes it out faster than any GICS sector), and (2) a secular AI-compute demand narrative that emerged definitively after ChatGPT (November 2022) and now makes every macro-driven selloff a potential entry for the GPU-scarcity thesis. Before 2022 the basket was a speculative small-cap infrastructure play amplifying QE/crypto cycles; after 2022 it became a thematic AI-infrastructure play that still amplifies macro cycles but with a structural demand floor from hyperscaler capex commitments.","summary_zh":"AI新云与高性能算力托管在结构上是股票市场中最高贝塔的放大器：在熔涨行情中涨幅为SPY的3-5倍，在风险规避机制中跌速也快3-5倍。其周期性因果引擎是双开关系统：(1)宏观机制（风险偏好/再通胀使其不成比例受益；利率冲击或增长恐慌比任何GICS板块跌得更快更深）；(2)2022年11月ChatGPT后明确形成的AI算力需求叙事，使每次宏观抛售都成为GPU稀缺逻辑的潜在买入机会。2022年前，该篮子是放大QE/加密周期的投机性小市值基础设施标的；2022年后转型为AI基础设施主题标的，仍放大宏观周期，但受超大规模资本支出承诺的结构性需求底部支撑。","top_signals":["semis (SMH) underperforming SPY for 4+ weeks after a melt-up","VIX rising above 20 from sub-15 with defensives leading","DXY surging >5% compounding with rate-shock (TLT -10%+ leg)","growth-minus-value spread collapsing / high-beta losing to low-vol"],"top_signals_zh":["半导体(SMH)在熔涨后持续4周以上跑输SPY","VIX从15以下升破20，防御股领涨","DXY飙升>5%叠加利率冲击(TLT -10%+)","成长/价值利差收窄/高贝塔跑输低波动"]},"b-ai_semiconductors":{"analog":"Closest to the July-2024 peak analog: same extreme-valuation-after-melt-up setup with a bellwether guidance miss triggering the rollover (Broadcom June 2026 matches Broadcom/Nvidia rotation warning of Jul 2024), breadth broadening away from AI semis (RSP beat SPY +6.6% in Jul 2024 vs +2.9% now), and a macro regime shift (slowdown-scare in Jul 2024, reflation-with-hawkish-Fed now). In both cases the initial drawdown was 25-30% before stabilization. The January-2025 analog is also relevant (DeepSeek/tariff severity was greater at -42%), suggesting if a macro policy shock is added to the current guidance-miss catalyst the drawdown could deepen beyond the base case.","analog_zh":"最接近2024年7月见顶的历史类比：同样是极端估值经历飙升后由龙头指引缺口触发回落（博通2026年6月与博通/英伟达2024年7月的轮动预警高度吻合），市场广度向外扩散（2024年7月RSP跑赢SPY +6.6%，当前+2.9%），以及宏观象限切换（2024年7月为放缓恐慌，当前为鹰派美联储叠加再通胀）。两次均经历25-30%的初始回撤后才企稳。2025年1月的类比同样相关（DeepSeek/关税冲击更为严峻达-42%），暗示若当前指引缺口催化剂叠加宏观政策冲击，跌幅可能超过基准情景。","bottom_signals":["VIX spike above 30-45 (panic flush: Aug 2015, Dec 2018, Mar 2020, Aug 2024, Apr 2025)","Fed policy pivot or tariff relief announcement (Jan 2019 dovish pivot, Apr 2025 tariff pause)","High-beta vs low-vol spread at extreme negative (SPHB-SPLV < -15)","Sector-wide 25-40% drawdown into a confirmed risk-off quad (slowdown/deflation)"],"bottom_signals_zh":["VIX飙升超30-45（恐慌抛售：2015年8月、2018年12月、2020年3月、2024年8月、2025年4月）","美联储政策转向或关税缓解公告（2019年1月鸽派转向、2025年4月关税暂停）","高贝塔 vs 低波动利差极端负值（SPHB-SPLV < -15）","在确认的避险象限（放缓/通缩）内板块性下跌25-40%"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["AI/compute platform inflection events (GPU launches, model releases)","hyperscaler AI capex cycles and guidance (Nvidia/Broadcom earnings)","Fed rate policy and real yields (long-duration asset)","US-China tech export controls and tariff risk on Taiwan supply chain","VIX and high-beta/low-vol spread as regime regime indicators"],"drivers_zh":["AI/计算平台拐点事件（GPU发布、模型上线）","云厂商AI资本开支周期及指引（英伟达/博通财报）","美联储利率政策与实际收益率（长久期资产）","中美科技出口管制及台湾供应链关税风险","VIX与高贝塔/低波动利差作为象限指示器"],"median_cycle_months":13.25,"summary":"AI Semiconductors cycles structurally on three interlocking forces: (1) AI/compute-platform inflection events (deep learning adoption, ChatGPT, next-gen GPU launches) that create demand step-changes dwarfing normal business cycles; (2) macro regime sensitivity as a long-duration, high-beta growth asset — rate shocks, dollar strength and VIX spikes all disproportionately compress AI-chip multiples vs SPY and the 11 GICS sectors; and (3) hyperscaler capex cycles, where cloud spending on AI infrastructure drives revenue visibility but also creates boom-bust inventory/guidance dynamics. The basket consistently leads the tape on the way up in tech-favoring regimes (VIX down, growth beats value, dollar weak-to-neutral) and leads down in risk-off events, amplifying SPY moves by 1.5-2x. Peak signals cluster around narrow breadth extremes (RSP lagging SPY by >20%), growth-value spreads above +50, and guidance misses from bellwethers (Nvidia, Broadcom); trough signals cluster around VIX spikes above 30 and policy pivots (Fed dovish turn, tariff pause).","summary_zh":"AI半导体的周期结构性地取决于三股相互交织的力量：（1）AI/计算平台拐点事件（深度学习普及、ChatGPT、新一代GPU发布），创造远超普通商业周期的需求跃升；（2）作为长久期高贝塔成长资产的宏观政策敏感性——利率冲击、美元走强和VIX飙升对AI芯片估值的压缩程度均显著高于SPY和11个GICS板块；（3）云厂商资本开支周期，AI基础设施的云端支出带来营收可预见性，但也制造了繁荣-萧条式的库存/指引动态。该篮子在科技友好象限（VIX下行、成长跑赢价值、美元弱至中性）中持续领涨，在避险事件中领跌，以1.5-2倍放大SPY的波动。见顶信号集中于广度极端收窄（RSP跑输SPY超过20%）、成长-价值利差超+50以及龙头股（英伟达、博通）的指引缺口；见底信号集中于VIX飙升超30以及政策转向（美联储鸽派转向、关税暂停）。","top_signals":["Breadth extreme: RSP lagging SPY by >20% (2024 Jul, 2022 Oct trough-to-peak)","Growth-value spread above +50 after extended bull run","Bellwether guidance miss or no-raise (Broadcom Jun 2026, Nvidia post-hype cycle)","VIX at 10-15 with DXY firming and TLT falling (late-cycle rate regime)"],"top_signals_zh":["广度极端收窄：RSP跑输SPY超20%（2024年7月、2022年10月低谷至高峰）","成长-价值利差超+50，延续牛市之后","龙头股指引缺口或未上调（博通2026年6月、英伟达后炒作周期）","VIX处于10-15，DXY走强且TLT下跌（周期末段利率象限）"]},"b-ai_software":{"analog":"Closest to the Aug-2022 peak analog: the Oct 2025 peak-to-trough selloff (oil shock + rate re-acceleration + AI capex/monetization doubt) rhymes with the Aug 2022 peak where the same trio — hawkish macro shock, growth-lags-value by a wide margin, and long-duration software de-rating while breadth broadened — compressed multiples into a multi-month trough. In both cases the basket fell ~30% while defensives held relatively and RSP beat SPY, and in both cases the trough was set by an external clearing event (ChatGPT/Microsoft-OpenAI Jan 2023 / Hormuz ceasefire Apr 2026). The current setup (post-Broadcom June 2026 selloff, reflation quad, growth-lags-value -15.2%) mirrors Aug-Dec 2022: the clearing event needed is a credible AI monetization re-acceleration or a rate inflection, not merely a sentiment bounce.","analog_zh":"最接近2022年8月峰值类比：2025年10月峰到谷回撤(石油冲击+利率重新加速+AI资本支出/变现存疑)与2022年8月峰值如出一辙——同样的三重组合：鹰派宏观冲击、成长大幅跑输价值、长久期软件去估值同时广度转宽——压缩了多月的估值。两种情况下篮子均回撤约30%，防御股相对守住、RSP跑赢SPY；两次低点均由外部清除事件触发(2023年1月ChatGPT/微软-OpenAI / 2026年4月霍尔木兹停火)。当前格局(2026年6月博通后回撤、再通胀象限、成长跑输价值-15.2%)与2022年8-12月如镜像：所需的清除事件是可信的AI变现再加速或利率拐点，而非单纯的情绪反弹。","bottom_signals":["VIX spike to 25-45+ concurrent with high-beta/growth maximum underperformance vs defensives (every trough — 2016, 2018, 2020, 2022, 2025 — came with VIX extremes)","Semis bottom and diverge UP before software recovers — SMH leads every recovery (confirmed 2016, 2019, 2020, 2023, 2026)","TLT makes a short-term high concurrent with software/tech at multi-month lows (a rate-peak signal at the rate-driven troughs of 2018, 2022, 2025)","Negative growth-minus-value spread begins to narrow (mean-reversion in the style factor is an early re-entry signal)"],"bottom_signals_zh":["VIX飙升至25-45+同时高贝塔/成长相对防御板块最大程度跑输(2016、2018、2020、2022、2025年每个低点均伴随VIX极端值)","半导体见底并向上背离先于软件复苏——SMH领先每一次复苏(2016、2019、2020、2023、2026年均已验证)","TLT短期见高与软件/科技处于多月低位同步出现(2018、2022、2025年利率驱动低点的利率见顶信号)","成长-价值负价差开始收窄(风格因子均值回归是早期再入场信号)"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["Interest rate / real yield level (TLT direction is the primary single-factor predictor)","Semis leadership (SMH as the leading indicator — tech rallies start with semis, not software)","AI/cloud monetization narrative maturity (re-rating when thresholds are hit, de-rating when doubted)","VIX regime (growth/high-beta crushed in VIX>30 environments; supercharged in VIX<18)","Dollar strength (DXY+/strong dollar headwind for multinational cloud revenue; DXY- tailwind)","Fed policy regime (ZIRP/QE = multiple expansion; hiking cycle = brutal de-rating for long-duration)"],"drivers_zh":["利率/实际收益率水平(TLT方向是首要单因子预测变量)","半导体领导力(SMH为领先指标——科技反弹始于半导体而非软件)","AI/云变现叙事成熟度(达到门槛时重定价上行，受质疑时向下去估值)","VIX体制(VIX>30时成长/高贝塔被重创；VIX<18时被放大)","美元强弱(美元走强压制跨国云收入；美元走弱为顺风)","美联储政策体制(零利率/量化宽松=倍数扩张；加息周期=长久期残酷去估值)"],"median_cycle_months":12,"summary":"AI Software & Platforms cycles on the interaction of three recurring forces: (1) the interest-rate duration penalty — as the longest-duration corner of XLK, it amplifies every rate-regime shift, rallying hardest when yields fall and selling off most violently when they surge; (2) the AI/cloud narrative monetization cycle — each leg is anchored to a specific technology adoption threshold (SaaS subscription re-rating 2014-15, cloud enterprise mainstream 2016-18, ChatGPT/Copilot 2023-25) that justifies elevated multiples until the narrative faces a 'show me the money' test; and (3) macro risk-on/risk-off beta — as a high-beta, growth-oriented basket it amplifies every SPY move by 1.5-2x, with selloffs consistently worst when defensives lead (stagflation/deflation quads) and rallies strongest when semis lead in goldilocks or reflation quads. The SPY comparison across every leg confirms this basket either outruns or underperforms the index by a wide margin — it is never a moderate performer.","summary_zh":"AI软件与平台的周期由三股周期性力量交织驱动：(1)利率久期惩罚——作为XLK中久期最长的品类，它放大每一次利率格局切换，在收益率下行时涨幅最大，在收益率飙升时跌幅最深；(2)AI/云变现叙事周期——每个腿均锚定特定技术采用门槛(2014-15年SaaS订阅重定价、2016-18年企业云主流化、2023-25年ChatGPT/Copilot)，由此支撑高估值倍数，直到叙事面临'拿结果来说话'的考验；(3)宏观风险偏好/厌恶贝塔——作为高贝塔成长型篮子，它以1.5-2倍幅度放大每一次标普500波动，在防御股领先的滞胀/通缩象限中跌幅最深，在半导体领先的金发女孩或再通胀象限中涨幅最强。每个腿的标普500对比均印证该篮子与指数表现大幅背离——从不是中庸的表现者。","top_signals":["AI monetization narrative hits a 'show me earnings' inflection — guidance cycles or capex-ceiling signals (Broadcom Jun 2026, Oct-2021 taper) — the most consistent peak marker","Growth-minus-value spread turns sharply negative while breadth broadens (RSP beats SPY): the 2021-11, 2022-08, 2025-10 and 2026-06 peaks all rotated this way","VIX at multi-year lows with the basket far above its 200-day after a 1.5-2x SPY run (the 2021-11 and 2025-02 peaks both fit this stretched-multiple template)","Long-duration software diverging DOWN from semis — software/Tech de-rates while SMH still holds (2025-10 and 2026-06 both saw semis hold up while software led the laggards)"],"top_signals_zh":["AI变现叙事触及'拿业绩说话'拐点——业绩指引周期或资本支出天花板信号(2026年6月博通、2021年10月Taper)——最一致的见顶标志","成长-价值价差急剧转负同时广度转宽(RSP跑赢SPY)：2021年11月、2022年8月、2025年10月与2026年6月峰值均如此轮动","VIX处于多年低位且篮子在1.5-2倍标普涨幅后远高于200日均线(2021年11月与2025年2月峰值均符合此估值偏高模板)","长久期软件相对半导体向下背离——软件/科技去估值而SMH仍守住(2025年10月与2026年6月均见半导体守住而软件领跌)"]},"b-big_pharma":{"analog":"Closest to the Aug-2016 selloff peak (Leg 2016-08-02): same idiosyncratic policy-overhang selloff in a rising, cyclical-led tape where pharma fell while the broad market held — the August 2016 episode was driven by Clinton's drug-pricing tweets in a reflation/election-risk tape, and today's downturn is driven by MFN/RFK in a reflation/growth-up tape. Both share: pharma underperforming SPY by 20+ points while cyclicals led, a policy catalyst rather than a fundamental earnings problem, and a setup where a political resolution (2016: Trump election; 2026: MFN legal outcome or Fed risk-off) would be the trigger for the next recovery leg.","analog_zh":"与2016年8月2日见顶腿（Leg 2016-08-02）最为相似：同样是在上涨的周期股主导行情中，大型药企遭遇个体化的政策压制抛售，大市维持而药企下跌——2016年8月的行情由克林顿药价推文在反通胀/大选风险的背景下驱动，而当前的下行由MFN/RFK在反通胀/增长向上的背景下驱动。两者共同点：药企跑输标普500逾20个百分点，同时周期股领涨；驱动是政策催化剂而非基本面盈利问题；解局触发点同为政治层面的解决（2016年：特朗普胜选；2026年：MFN法律结果或美联储引发的风险厌恶轮动）。","bottom_signals":["Drug-pricing political catalyst loses force (election result clears overhang, court blocks executive order)","Macro regime shifts to slowdown/deflation-scare: defensives begin outperforming cyclicals; TLT rallies","Valuation compression to 10%+ discount to long-term P/E average with sector at bottom-quartile RS rank","M&A announcement fills near-term pipeline void and signals management confidence in cash flows"],"bottom_signals_zh":["药品定价政治催化剂失效（大选结果消除悬念，法院阻止行政令执行）","宏观环境切换至放缓/通缩恐慌：防御股开始跑赢周期股；TLT上涨","估值压缩至长期市盈率均值10%以上的折价，板块强弱排名处于末位四分之一","并购公告填补近期管线空缺，传递管理层对现金流的信心"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["Drug-pricing policy: election outcomes and executive orders are the primary amplitude lever","Macro quad rotation: defensives-vs-cyclicals regime (slowdown/deflation bid vs reflation crowded out)","Rate sensitivity as bond proxy: TLT direction drives relative performance versus SPY","Patent cliff and M&A cycle: pipeline gaps reset every 5-7 years, require deals to maintain multiples","Dollar: strong DXY compresses multinational earnings; weak dollar tailwind for revenue reporting","VIX/flight-to-safety: acute risk-off spikes bring relative defensive bids"],"drivers_zh":["药品定价政策：大选结果与行政令是振幅的主要杠杆","宏观象限轮动：防御vs周期的政策环境（放缓/通缩时被买入，反通胀时被边缘化）","作为债券替代品的利率敏感性：TLT方向驱动相对标普500的表现","专利悬崖与并购周期：管线缺口每5-7年重置，需要并购来维持估值倍数","美元：美元走强压缩跨国盈利；美元走弱为收入换算提供顺风","VIX/避险：急性风险厌恶飙升带来相对防御性买盘"],"median_cycle_months":17,"summary":"Big Pharma cycles on a recurring three-force engine: (1) drug-pricing policy risk — the dominant amplitude driver, toggling between political overhang (Clinton 2015-16, IRA 2022, MFN 2025) and relief (Trump 2016 win, American Patients First 2018 non-enforcement); (2) macro quad rotation — as a low-beta, high-yield defensive sector, pharma gets bid hard in deflation/slowdown quads and flight-to-safety episodes (2014-15, 2018-20) but is abandoned in reflation/growth-up tapes where cyclicals and Tech dominate; and (3) rate-sensitivity — being a de facto bond proxy, pharma rallies when yields fall (TLT up) and is punished when yields surge (2018, 2022, 2024). These forces interact with a structural patent-cliff/M&A backdrop that resets revenue expectations every 5-7 years, requiring M&A to fill pipeline voids (AbbVie/Allergan 2019, BMS/Celgene 2019). Against the 11 GICS sectors, pharma leads only when defensives beat cyclicals and is structurally crowded out of risk-on/reflation/AI-led tapes.","summary_zh":"大型药企的循环由三股反复出现的力量驱动：（1）药品定价政策风险——振幅主导因素，在政治压制（克林顿2015-16年、IRA 2022年、MFN 2025年）与利好释放（特朗普2016年胜选、2018年「美国患者优先」非强制执行）之间切换；（2）宏观象限轮动——作为低贝塔、高股息的防御板块，药企在通缩/放缓象限和避险行情中获得强力买盘（2014-15年、2018-20年），但在反通胀/增长向上的行情中被抛弃，因为周期股和科技股主导；（3）利率敏感性——作为事实上的债券替代品，利率下行时药企上涨（TLT上升），利率飙升时受压（2018年、2022年、2024年）。这些力量与结构性专利悬崖/并购背景相互作用，每5-7年重置一次收入预期，需要并购来填补管线空缺（艾伯维/艾尔建2019年、百时美/新基2019年）。相对于11个GICS板块，药企只在防御股跑赢周期股时领涨，在风险偏好/反通胀/AI主导的行情中结构性处于弱势。","top_signals":["Drug-pricing political overhang peaks (Clinton/IRA/MFN): sustained narrative pushes sector-specific discount to extremes","Transition to reflation/growth-up quad with cyclicals leading; pharma RS rank drops to bottom quartile","Yield surge (TLT falling): bond-proxy multiple compression removes defensive premium","Patent cliff disclosure without pipeline replacement triggers multiple de-rating"],"top_signals_zh":["药品定价政治压制达到顶峰（克林顿/IRA/MFN）：持续叙事将板块特异性折价推至极端","切换至反通胀/增长向上象限，周期股领涨；药企强弱排名跌至末位四分之一","收益率飙升（TLT下跌）：债券替代品估值压缩消除防御溢价","专利悬崖披露但缺乏管线替代，触发估值倍数去评级"]},"b-critical_minerals":{"analog":"Closest to the Jan-2026 peak / March-2026 trough analog: the Sep-2016 peak at the top of the +92% reflation rally, followed by the -30.1% selloff into Nov-2016 on a regime-flip (TLT -11.7%, DXY +6.2%) that did NOT break the long-run bull. Both episodes share: a violent multi-month rally running out of policy catalyst (2016: reflation priced; 2026 Jan: US-China de-escalation), a stagflation-ish macro regime turn (rising dollar and rate shock in 2016, rising dollar and stagflation in 2026), and a -30% de-rate that set up the next major leg. The key difference is that today's policy backstop (DoD equity stake, price floor) is far more institutionalized than 2016's, suggesting the next leg up from the current trough could be as powerful as the Nov-2016 to Sep-2018 +228% run, provided a fresh China escalation catalyst arrives.","analog_zh":"与2026年1月高点/3月低点最接近的历史类比为2016年9月高点：在+92%反通胀反弹顶部，随后因regime翻转（TLT -11.7%，DXY +6.2%）进入-30.1%的回调至2016年11月，但未打破长期牛市。两段行情共同点：多月剧烈上涨耗尽政策催化剂（2016年：反通胀已被计入；2026年1月：中美降级），类滞胀宏观regime转向（2016年美元上升和利率冲击；2026年美元上升和滞胀），以及为下一段主升波奠基的-30%去估值。关键区别在于当今政策后盾（DoD股权投资、价格下限）远比2016年更加制度化，暗示从当前低谷开始的下一段上升浪——若有新一轮中国升级催化剂——可能与2016年11月至2018年9月的+228%一样强劲。","bottom_signals":["Fresh China rare earth export control escalation or new element additions to control list","US government announces direct equity stake, price floor, or multi-year offtake in sector leaders","Basket at historical range floor (pos <5) with defensives-led selloff rather than sector-specific collapse","Commodity reflation signal: copper-gold turning positive and DXY weakening together"],"bottom_signals_zh":["中国新一轮稀土出口管制升级或向管控清单新增元素","美国政府宣布对板块龙头直接股权投资、价格下限或多年包销","篮子处于历史区间底部（pos <5），抛售由防御引领而非板块特定崩溃","大宗反通胀信号：铜金比转正同时DXY走弱"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["China rare earth export control policy: weaponization vs relaxation is the primary cycle driver","US/allied government supply-chain backstops (DoD equity stakes, price floors, offtake agreements)","EV and green-energy demand cycle: battery metals (lithium, cobalt) amplify the rare earth thesis","Dollar regime: DXY strength is a direct structural headwind; DXY weakness is a tailwind","Commodity macro regime: reflation/growth-up quad amplifies upside; stagflation-ish quad compresses multiples","High-beta amplification: basket delivers 3-6x the index move in both directions"],"drivers_zh":["中国稀土出口管制政策：武器化对放松是主要周期驱动力","美国/盟友政府供应链后盾（DoD股权投资、价格下限、包销协议）","EV和绿色能源需求周期：电池金属（锂、钴）放大稀土逻辑","美元regime：DXY走强是直接结构性逆风；DXY走弱是顺风","大宗商品宏观regime：反通胀/增长向上quad放大上行；类滞胀quad压缩估值倍数","高贝塔放大：篮子在上下两个方向均交出指数3-6倍涨跌幅"],"median_cycle_months":13,"summary":"Critical Minerals & Rare Earths is the most policy-driven, most violent basket in the US thematic universe. Its cycles are NOT primarily driven by the macro regime (though the regime amplifies or dampens moves by 2-4x) but by a single binary: China's willingness to weaponize or relax its monopoly over rare earth processing (90%+ of global refining). Every major top has been marked by de-escalation signals or 'priced-in' policy that removes the scarcity premium; every major bottom has been marked by fresh escalation that makes ex-China supply a strategic imperative. The structural cycle is: China tightens → Western supply chain panic → US/allied government backstops emerge → names re-rate parabolically → partial de-escalation or policy 'priced in' → violent de-rating. The basket then oscillates between 'commodity play' (cyclical beta to the commodity/EV demand cycle) and 'national security option' (binary call on US-China geopolitical tension), with the latter regime delivering moves of +92%, +228%, +687%, +715%, +80%, and +61% while the former delivers -30% to -57% corrections.","summary_zh":"关键矿产与稀土是美国主题篮子中政策驱动最强、波动最剧烈的标的。其周期并非主要由宏观regime驱动（尽管regime能将涨跌幅放大或压缩2-4倍），而是由单一二元变量决定：中国是否愿意将其对稀土加工（占全球精炼90%以上）的垄断地位武器化或放松。每次重大顶部都以降级信号或'已被计入'的政策（移除稀缺溢价）为标志；每次重大底部都以新一轮升级（使去中国化供应成为战略迫切需求）为标志。结构性周期为：中国收紧→西方供应链恐慌→美国/盟友政府后盾出现→标的抛物线重估→部分降级或政策'已被计入'→剧烈去估值。篮子随后在'大宗商品投资'（对大宗/EV需求周期的周期贝塔）与'国家安全期权'（对中美地缘政治紧张的二元看涨期权）之间震荡，后者regime交出+92%、+228%、+687%、+715%、+80%和+61%的涨幅，而前者则交出-30%至-57%的回调。","top_signals":["China/US diplomatic de-escalation or partial suspension of export controls removes scarcity premium","Parabolic extension: basket 6x+ the index over 12-18 months (as in 2020-21 and 2024-25)","DXY turning sharply stronger (3%+ in a window) signals macro headwind arriving","Stagflation-ish quad flip: defensives bid with rising VIX — kills high-beta materials multiples"],"top_signals_zh":["中美外交降级或出口管制部分暂停，稀缺溢价被移除","抛物线延伸：篮子在12-18个月内涨幅达指数6倍以上（如2020-21年和2024-25年）","DXY急剧转强（窗口期3%以上）预示宏观逆风到来","类滞胀quad翻转：防御受追捧伴随VIX上升——摧毁高贝塔材料估值倍数"]},"b-crypto":{"analog":"Closest to the Apr-2018 to Apr-2019 bear-bounce setup: same high-beta rebound off a policy-fear trough (rate shock into risk-off), same narrow tape with semis leading (SMH +20.3% then vs +59.5% now), same dollar headwind (DXY +8.4% then vs +3.4% now), and the same question of whether structural institutional catalysts (Bakkt/ETF hopes then, spot-ETF maturation/post-halving supply now) can sustain the rally or whether it fades into the next trough. The key difference: today's macro floor is structurally higher because of the approved spot-ETF ecosystem and corporate treasury adoption -- making the 2018 analog a useful caution rather than a direct repeat.","analog_zh":"最接近2018年4月至2019年4月的熊市反弹形态：同样是政策恐慌谷底后的高贝塔反弹（利率冲击引发避险），同样是以半导体领涨的狭窄市场（当时SMH+20.3% vs 今日+59.5%），同样是美元阻力（当时DXY+8.4% vs 今日+3.4%），以及同样的问题——结构性机构催化剂（当时Bakkt/ETF预期，今日现货ETF成熟/减半后供给）能否维持涨势还是将走向下一个谷底。关键差异：今日因获批的现货ETF生态系统与企业储备采用，宏观底部在结构上更高——使2018年类比成为有益警示而非直接重演。","bottom_signals":["VIX spike above 40-50 with SPY drawdown of 15%+ and crypto falling 2-3x deeper than SPY","Crypto-specific exchange/custodial failure destroying counterparty trust","Fed emergency rate cut or QE announcement resets the liquidity baseline","Dollar at a multi-year high then reversing sharply lower (DXY rolling over)"],"bottom_signals_zh":["VIX飙升至40-50以上，SPY回撤逾15%且加密跌幅较SPY深2-3倍","加密自身交易所/托管爆雷摧毁交易对手信任","美联储紧急降息或QE宣布重置流动性基准","美元处于多年高位后急剧逆转走低（DXY见顶回落）"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["Federal Reserve rate cycle: easing = rocket fuel, tightening = first casualty","US dollar strength (DXY): weak dollar amplifies crypto, strong dollar is headwind","Bitcoin halving supply shock every ~4 years compresses sell pressure","Risk-on/risk-off macro regime (VIX, SPHB-SPLV, tech/semis leadership)","Crypto-native exchange/custodial failures create panic troughs","Regulatory catalysts (ETF approvals, bans, policy shifts) drive structural re-rating"],"drivers_zh":["美联储利率周期：宽松=火箭燃料，收紧=首当其冲","美元强弱（DXY）：弱美元放大加密，强美元是阻力","比特币约每4年一次的减半供给冲击压缩抛压","风险偏好/避险宏观机制（VIX、SPHB-SPLV、科技/半导体领涨）","加密自身交易所/托管爆雷制造恐慌谷底","监管催化剂（ETF获批、禁令、政策转变）驱动结构性重估"],"median_cycle_months":13,"summary":"Crypto & Digital Assets is structurally the highest-beta, most liquidity-sensitive basket on the board -- it cycles as a leveraged amplifier of the macro risk-on/risk-off regime, not as a standalone GICS sector. Its recurring engine: when the Fed is easing or the dollar is weakening, crypto outperforms every SPDR sector by a factor of 3-10x; when the Fed tightens or VIX spikes, it is the first asset liquidated and falls 2-4x deeper than SPY. Overlaid on this macro beta is a crypto-native supply cycle driven by Bitcoin halvings (every ~4 years: 2016, 2020, 2024) that structurally reduce sell-side supply and tend to coincide with the most explosive bull legs. Exchange/custodial blow-ups (Mt.Gox 2014, FTX 2022) and regulatory shocks (China bans 2017 and 2021, SEC actions) have historically created the deepest panic troughs -- ideal accumulation entry points for the next halving-driven cycle. Note the pre-2020 basket legs are a thin proxy reconstruction (no live constituents), so for the early history the macro ctx is the reliable read, not the proxy price path.","summary_zh":"加密与数字资产是全场结构性最高贝塔、对流动性最敏感的篮子——它作为宏观风险偏好/避险机制的杠杆放大器循环运转，而非独立的GICS板块。其循环引擎：当美联储宽松或美元走弱时，加密以3-10倍跑赢所有SPDR板块；当美联储收紧或VIX飙升时，它是最先被平仓的资产，跌幅较SPY深2-4倍。叠加在这一宏观贝塔之上的是由比特币减半（约每4年一次：2016、2020、2024年）驱动的加密自身供给周期，结构性削减抛售端供给，并倾向于与最爆炸性的牛市腿同期出现。交易所/托管爆雷（Mt.Gox 2014、FTX 2022）与监管冲击（2017与2021年中国禁令、SEC行动）历史上制造了最深的恐慌谷底——即为下一个减半驱动周期的理想积累入场点。需注意2020年前的篮子腿是薄弱的代理重构（无真实成分），故早期历史以宏观ctx为可靠判读，而非代理价格路径。","top_signals":["VIX compressed to multi-year lows while crypto leads SPY by 3x+ over 6 months (blow-off exhaustion)","Bitcoin halving occurred 6-18 months prior and the cycle is 18-24 months old from the trough","Retail sentiment at extreme (search volumes, funding rates, leverage ratios at peaks)","Narrow mega-cap tape (RSP lagging SPY by 20%+) with crypto outperforming by 5-10x"],"top_signals_zh":["VIX压至多年低点，同期加密过去6个月跑赢SPY达3倍以上（吹顶衰竭）","比特币减半已在6-18个月前发生且周期自谷底起已历时18-24个月","散户情绪极端（搜索量、资金费率、杠杆比率触峰）","狭窄大盘股市场（RSP跑输SPY逾20%）且加密跑赢5-10倍"]},"b-cybersecurity":{"analog":"Closest to the Aug-2022 peak and subsequent hawkish-reset selloff (leg starting 2022-08-15): same narrow-breadth melt-up topping (RSP lagged SPY -7.5% now vs -1.1% then, but the melt-up structure is identical), same early growth-to-value rotation signal (growth-value spread now -15.2 vs -14.2 at the 2022-08 peak), same DXY firming into the top (+1.5% now vs +2.6% then), and same reflation/growth-up quad in transition. In 2022, the Jackson Hole hawkish-reset was the pin that popped the stretched growth trade and drove a -30% selloff in cyber; the current analog pin is a potential DXY-driven financial-conditions tightening or a Fed higher-for-longer signal. The key differentiator: the 2022 selloff had a fundamental leg (SaaS sales-cycle elongation confirmed across multiple earners); a pure macro regime shift without fundamental deterioration would argue for a shallower correction of 15-20% rather than 30%.","analog_zh":"与2022年8月高点及随后鹰派重设跌幅（2022-08-15起节）最为相似：同样是狭幅飞升见顶（RSP落后SPY -7.5%，2022年8月时为-1.1%，但飞升结构相同）、成长-价值差早期收窄信号（当前-15.2 vs 2022-08时-14.2）、美元走强进入顶部（当前+1.5% vs 当时+2.6%），以及同处再通胀/增长向上象限向收紧转化阶段。2022年的触发器是杰克逊霍尔鹰派重设，导致网络安全-30%跌幅；当前类似触发器为美元居强下的金融条件收紧或美联储长期高利率信号。关键差异：2022年有多家SaaS企业财报确认销售周期拉长作为基本面验证；若仅是宏观格局转变而无基本面恶化，则修正幅度可能较浅，约15-20%而非30%。","bottom_signals":["VIX spike above 25 combined with TLT rising (rates falling) and defensives leading cyclicals by more than 10%","Growth-to-value spread at cycle trough (deeply negative) with breadth broadening (RSP beating SPY by more than +3%)","Consecutive quarterly earnings seasons revealing SaaS sales-cycle elongation just as rates peak or real yields turn positive"],"bottom_signals_zh":["VIX飙升至25以上、TLT上涨（利率下行）且防御板块领跑周期板块超过10%","成长对价值差处于周期谷底（严重负值）、广度扩散（RSP跑赢SPY超+3%）","连续数季财报显示SaaS销售周期拉长，恰逢利率见顶或实际收益率转正"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["real yield level and direction (primary de-rater of long-duration growth multiples)","macro risk-appetite regime (VIX, high-beta vs low-vol spread, growth vs value)","breach-demand supercycle (compliance, zero-trust adoption, AI-threat escalation)","tech/semis leadership breadth (narrow melt-up amplifier vs broadening rotation headwind)","dollar strength (secondary headwind for multinational software revenue)"],"drivers_zh":["实际收益率水平及方向（长久期成长估值首要拖累项）","宏观风险偏好格局（VIX、高贝塔对低波动差、成长对价值）","泄露需求超周期（合规、零信任普及、AI威胁升级）","科技/半导体领跑广度（狭幅飞升放大器 vs 扩散轮动逆风）","美元强弱（跨国软件营收次要逆风）"],"median_cycle_months":9,"summary":"Cybersecurity is a structurally high-beta, long-duration growth-software basket that cycles primarily on two forces: (1) the macro rate/risk-appetite regime -- rising real yields and risk-off rotations de-rate its 15-30x revenue multiples faster than the index, while falling yields and tech-led risk-on environments amplify it to the upside; and (2) a secular breach-demand floor that keeps CISOs spending through most slowdowns, providing a baseline that outperforms defensives in mild risk-off but cannot offset acute macro regime shifts. Its peaks are defined by extreme growth-over-value stretches in a narrow-breadth melt-up; its troughs are set when the macro regime snaps back, forcing multiple compression that overshoots the broad-index decline before the breach/policy cycle re-bids the sector.","summary_zh":"网络安全是高贝塔、长久期成长软件篮子，其周期主要由两股力量驱动：（1）宏观利率/风险偏好格局——实际收益率上升和避险轮动对其估值（15-30x营收）的冲击大于指数，而降息和科技领涨风险偏好环境则倍数放大收益；（2）年度安全需求底线——CISO必须投入、泄露周期和法规调整使安全预算具备周期下行韧性，提供基准估值支撑。其估值顶部由狭幅成长胜价值的极致拉伸定义；谷底则由宏观格局急剧破位、多重压缩超越指数跌幅所设，随后泄露/政策周期重新激活买盘。","top_signals":["Extreme growth-over-value spread (>+25) in a narrow-breadth melt-up (RSP lagging SPY by more than -10%)","VIX at cycle lows (below 15) with SMH at multi-year highs and cyber at top-quintile relative strength","High-beta vs low-vol spread at peak positive (+50 or above) in a reflation or goldilocks quad"],"top_signals_zh":["成长大幅胜价值（>+25）、广度狭窄（RSP落后SPY超-10%）的狭幅飞升","VIX位于周期低位（低于15）、SMH创多年高、网络安全相对强度处于顶五分位","再通胀或金发女童象限下高贝塔对低波动差处于峰值正区间（+50以上）"]},"b-data_center_power":{"analog":"Closest to the Nov-2021 to Jul-2022 peak-to-trough arc: the basket ran +196% in the COVID recovery leg into a stretched valuation at a cycle peak (similar to the +287% run ending June 2026), then suffered a -28% drawdown as the macro regime shifted from semis-led risk-on to a rate-shock selloff where defensives led and equal-weight briefly caught up. Both setups share the same fingerprint: a near-vertical prior rally ending with narrow mega-cap breadth, followed by a regime broadening where the exact leadership complex that drove the rally dissipates. In 2021-2022 it was the Fed taper/hike triggering the unwind; today it is the reflation broadening (Energy and Industrials joining a still-Tech-led tape) plus dollar strength that is eroding the AI-power-as-only-leadership narrative. The key distinction: the structural AI capex thesis is far more confirmed today — Vertiv backlog at $15B, GE Vernova backlog at $163B with book-to-bill of 2.9x — suggesting a shallower eventual trough, more analogous to the Aug-2024 yen-carry flush (-20.5%) than the 2021-2022 full bear (-28%).","analog_zh":"最接近2021年11月至2022年7月的见顶回落弧线：该篮子在新冠复苏腿中上涨196%后在周期峰值达到拉伸估值（类似2026年6月结束的+287%涨势），随后随宏观象限从半导体领涨风险偏好切换为利率冲击抛售而下跌28%，防御股领涨、等权短暂赶上。两个情形具有相同特征：近乎垂直的前期上涨腿以窄幅巨头主导广度结束，随后象限广泛化，驱动上涨的领涨复合体消散。2021-2022年是美联储缩减/加息触发平仓；当今则是反通胀广泛化（能源和工业加入仍由科技领涨的市场）叠加美元走强，侵蚀\"AI电力唯一领涨\"叙事。关键区别：当前AI资本开支结构性主线远比2021年更为确立——维谛积压150亿美元、GE Vernova积压1630亿美元且订单出货比2.9倍——暗示最终调整幅度更浅，更类似2024年8月日元套利清洗（-20.5%）而非2021-2022年完整熊市（-28%）。","bottom_signals":["VIX spike above 25 with SMH down 20%+ from peak marks high-beta washout and optimal re-entry","Hyperscaler earnings delivering upside capex guidance surprise after a period of investor skepticism","Fed dovish pivot or first rate cut signal re-opens long-duration capex valuation multiples","Equal-weight beginning to outperform cap-weight after a prolonged mega-cap correction signals breadth recovery"],"bottom_signals_zh":["VIX飙升超25且SMH从峰值下跌超20%，标志高贝塔洗盘完成、最佳再入场时机","超大规模厂商季报在投资者质疑期后上调资本开支指引（需求冲击催化剂）","美联储鸽派转向或首次降息信号重新打开长久期资本开支估值倍数","等权在持续巨头回调后开始跑赢市值权，标志广度复苏"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["AI/cloud hyperscaler capex cycle (primary driver post-2022, ChatGPT to $600B+ buildout)","Semiconductor leadership regime (SMH vs SPY direction is the single best real-time signal)","Fed rate and dollar regime (higher-for-longer compresses long-duration capex multiples)","Oil and reflation cycle (energy prices signal industrial macro health and physical buildout costs)","Macro risk regime (VIX spikes and flight-to-safety rotations punish high-beta capex names)"],"drivers_zh":["AI/云计算超大规模厂商资本开支周期（2022年后主驱动，ChatGPT至6000亿美元+建设规模）","半导体领涨象限（SMH vs SPY方向是最佳实时信号）","美联储利率和美元象限（长期高利率压制长久期资本开支估值倍数）","油价与反通胀周期（能源价格是工业宏观健康与实体建设成本的信号）","宏观风险象限（VIX飙升和避险轮动惩罚高贝塔资本开支标的）"],"median_cycle_months":19.1,"summary":"Data-Center Power and Cooling is a high-beta amplifier of the AI and cloud infrastructure capex cycle: it outperforms SPY and beats the Technology (XLK), Industrials (XLI), and Utilities (XLU) sectors during semis-led risk-on regimes and megacap tech melt-ups, but underperforms violently in risk-off episodes because its valuation is underwritten by multi-year capex commitments that get repriced the moment macro uncertainty rises. The structural causal engine is the hyperscaler electricity demand curve: every dollar of AI compute deployed creates derivative demand for power management (UPS, switchgear, PDUs), thermal management (air and liquid cooling), and grid-edge generation, making the basket a leveraged proxy on AI capex growth. Cycles are driven by the interplay of three forces: (1) macro risk regime (semis-led vs flight-to-safety), (2) hyperscaler capex cycle (acceleration vs pause), and (3) rate and dollar regime (higher-for-longer penalizes long-duration capex multiples). The basket trades like a high-beta Tech/Industrials hybrid amplifying up-legs when growth is reflationary and semis lead, then suffering sharper drawdowns than the broad market in risk-off events.","summary_zh":"数据中心电力与散热是AI和云计算基础设施资本开支周期的高贝塔放大器：在半导体领涨风险偏好和巨型科技暴涨期间，它跑赢SPY及科技（XLK）、工业（XLI）和公用事业（XLU）板块；但在避险情绪期间则剧烈跑输，因为其估值依托于多年期资本开支承诺，一旦宏观不确定性上升便会被重新定价。结构性驱动引擎是超大规模厂商的电力需求曲线：每部署一美元的AI算力，就会为电力管理（UPS、开关设备、PDU）、热管理（风冷和液冷）及电网边缘发电创造衍生需求，使该篮子成为AI资本开支增长的杠杆代理。周期由三股力量相互作用驱动：（1）宏观风险象限（半导体领涨 vs 避险）；（2）超大规模厂商资本开支周期（加速 vs 暂停）；（3）利率和美元象限（长期高利率压制长久期资本开支估值倍数）。该篮子交易特征类似高贝塔科技/工业混合体，在反通胀增长且半导体领涨时放大上涨，在避险时比大盘跌幅更深。","top_signals":["SMH euphoria plus equal-weight lagging cap-weight by 15%+ signals mega-cap exhaustion and pending rotation","Hyperscaler capex growth rate decelerating or guidance cuts in quarterly earnings (demand-destruction signal)","VIX at multi-year lows with high-beta AI positioning extremely crowded and book-to-bill ratios peaking","Dollar strengthening sharply (DXY +5%+) as market breadth broadens and leadership rotates from Tech to Energy and Industrials"],"top_signals_zh":["SMH极度亢奋+等权跑输市值权超15%，标志巨头动能耗尽、轮动在即","超大规模厂商资本开支增速放缓或季报下调指引（需求毁灭信号）","VIX处于多年低位且高贝塔AI持仓极度拥挤、订单出货比触顶","美元大幅走强（DXY +5%+）且市场广泛化，领涨从科技轮向能源和工业"]},"b-defense":{"analog":"Closest to the Feb-2016 trough entry: same policy-uncertainty-cleared + deeply-oversold-at-cycle-low setup. In Feb-2016, the Murray-Ryan budget deal had resolved sequester uncertainty and defense had sold off 21% from its mid-2015 peak; the basket then ran +172.5% over 31 months once the budget floor was confirmed and Trump's election provided the next catalyst. Today (June-2026), defense has sold off ~18% from its January-2026 peak after DOGE/Hegseth budget noise cleared extreme valuations, sits at pos 9.0 with a BUY signal, and awaits a comparable catalyst — a NATO emergency supplemental, a confirmed program-cut reversal, or a regime broadening away from narrow AI/semis that would allow the primes' order-book fundamentals to drive re-rating.","analog_zh":"最接近 2016 年 2 月低点入场：同样是政策不确定性消除 + 深度超卖于周期低点的格局。2016 年 2 月，莫里-瑞安预算协议化解了自动减支不确定性，国防自 2015 年中高点已下跌 21%；一旦预算底部确认、特朗普当选提供下一个催化剂，篮子随后 31 个月涨 +172.5%。如今（2026 年 6 月），国防自 2026 年 1 月高点回调约 18%，DOGE/赫格塞斯预算噪音清除了极端估值，位置 9.0 携带 BUY 信号，等待类似催化剂——北约紧急补充拨款、确认的项目削减反转，或远离狭窄 AI/半导体的 regime 走阔，使主承包商订单簿基本面驱动重估。","bottom_signals":["BUY signal at pos <15 with RS rank in bottom third of sectors","Budget ceiling resolved (new NDAA signed or BCA caps raised) — removes program uncertainty","Geopolitical escalation spike (new conflict or NATO emergency) re-ignites procurement bid","High-beta/semis selloff with VIX >30 — defense outperforms on rotation toward quality cyclical-defensive"],"bottom_signals_zh":["BUY 信号于位置 <15、相对强度排名处于板块后三分之一","预算上限解决（新 NDAA 签署或 BCA 上限提升）——消除项目不确定性","地缘政治升级突发（新冲突或北约紧急情况）重新点燃采购买盘","高贝塔/半导体抛售且 VIX >30——国防因向优质周期-防御轮动而跑赢"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["Federal budget cycle: NDAA caps, sequester relief/return, OCO supplementals","Geopolitical conflict bid: active wars, NATO rearmament, procurement surges","Fed/rates regime: rate-shock bear compresses multiples; pivot/pause unlocks re-rating","Dollar cycle: strong DXY headwind for multinational exporters (RTX, LMT, GD)","Risk-on/off regime: defense underperforms vs pure defensives in risk-off but overperforms industrials when geopolitical bid is live","Boeing commercial aviation drag: ITA/basket composition amplifies selloffs vs pure defense primes"],"drivers_zh":["联邦预算周期：NDAA 上限、自动减支缓解/回归、OCO 补充拨款","地缘政治冲突买盘：活跃战争、北约重整军备、采购激增","美联储/利率 regime：加息熊市压缩估值倍数；转向/暂停解锁重估","美元周期：强势 DXY 对跨国出口商（RTX、LMT、GD）构成逆风","风险偏好/规避 regime：避险中国防跑输纯防御，但当地缘买盘活跃时跑赢工业","波音商业航空拖累：ITA/篮子构成放大下跌，超过纯国防主承包商"],"median_cycle_months":28,"summary":"Defense & Aerospace cycles on the intersection of two independent forces: the US federal budget cycle (NDAA caps, sequester on/off, supplemental OCO spending) and the geopolitical premium (conflict escalation/de-escalation bids on the primes). When both align — budget clarity AND a live conflict — defense runs its longest, highest-conviction legs (2016–2018, 2022–2025). When they diverge — war without budget, or budget without regime support — the basket treads water or corrects. Overlaid on this is its hybrid industrial-defensive character: defense falls harder than pure defensives in risk-off selloffs (because of its industrial adjacency and Boeing commercial drag), yet rallies harder than pure industrials in reflation recoveries when geopolitical demand is present. The basket's structural vulnerability is to narrow, mega-cap-tech-led regimes: when SPY is pulled by AI/semis (SMH outperforming >50%), flows abandon the steady-yield primes, and defense consistently ranks in the bottom third of sectors for relative strength.","summary_zh":"国防与航空航天的周期运行在两股独立力量的交叉点：美国联邦预算周期（NDAA 上限、自动减支开/关、补充 OCO 开支）与地缘政治溢价（冲突升级/降级对主承包商的买卖）。当两者共振——预算明确且有活跃冲突——国防运行其最长、最高信念的腿段（2016-2018、2022-2025）。当它们背离——有战争无预算，或有预算无 regime 支持——篮子踟蹰或回调。叠加在此之上的是其工业-防御混合属性：国防在避险抛售中跌得比纯防御更重（因工业相邻性与波音商业拖累），但在再通胀复苏中当地缘需求存在时涨得比纯工业更猛。篮子的结构性弱点是狭窄的大市值科技引领 regime：当 SPY 被 AI/半导体拉动（SMH 跑赢 >50%）时，资金抛弃稳定收益的主承包商，国防持续排在板块相对强度后三分之一。","top_signals":["VIX collapsing to <15 with defense up >100% off prior trough — parabolic extension","Budget-cut / program-rationalization rhetoric emerges from the Pentagon or OMB","Narrow, semis-led melt-up (SMH outperforming >80%) pulling flows away from steady-yield primes","Dollar surging (DXY +4%+ over a quarter) — headwind for exporting primes signals peak"],"top_signals_zh":["VIX 骤降至 15 以下且国防自前低已涨逾 100%——抛物线延伸","五角大楼或 OMB 出现预算削减/项目合理化言论","狭窄、半导体引领融涨（SMH 跑赢 >80%）将资金从稳定收益主承包商抽离","美元飙升（单季 DXY +4% 以上）——对出口主承包商逆风，信号见顶"]},"b-defensives":{"analog":"Closest analog to today is the May-October 2023 leg (start 2023-05-01): same reflation/growth-up quad with tech/semis dominating (SMH +22% then vs +68% now), a stronger-dollar headwind (DXY +4.3% then vs +3.4% now), and defensives grinding positive in absolute terms while falling sharply in relative terms versus cyclicals. Two differences in 2026 sharpen the read: first, the AI-power-demand structural tailwind for utilities did not exist in 2023, which partially offsets the rotation headwind and argues for a shallower drawdown than 2023's -14.9%; second, the current reflation is value-led (growth-minus-value -15.2%) and oil-driven rather than the pure growth-stock melt-up of 2023, so the headwind is more about cyclical-value rotation than a bond-proxy yield spike (TLT roughly flat at +1.1% now vs -15.3% then). The risk scenario that breaks the analog is a VIX spike above 30 (Hormuz supply shock or credit event), which would rapidly flip defensives into relative outperformers as occurred in March 2020.","analog_zh":"与今日最接近的历史类比是2023年5月至10月（起点2023-05-01）：同样的再通胀/增长向上象限，科技/半导体主导（彼时SMH+22%，今日+68%），强势美元逆风（彼时DXY+4.3%，今日+3.4%），防御股绝对值小幅正收益但相对周期股大幅落后。2026年有两点差异令判断更清晰：其一，AI电力需求为公用事业提供了2023年时尚不存在的结构性顺风，部分抵消轮动逆风，意味着本轮回调可能浅于2023年的-14.9%；其二，当前再通胀由价值主导（成长相对价值-15.2%）、油价驱动，而非2023年纯成长股融涨，故逆风更多来自周期-价值轮动而非债券代理收益率飙升（当前TLT大致持平+1.1%，彼时为-15.3%）。打破类比的风险情景是VIX飙破30（霍尔木兹供应冲击或信用事件），届时防御股将迅速转为相对跑赢，正如2020年3月所演示的那样。","bottom_signals":["10-year yield peaking near multi-year highs (Oct 2018 ~3.2%, Oct 2022 ~4.0%, Oct 2023 ~5.0%): utility leg capitulation marks the trough","VIX spiking above 25-30 on acute risk-off event triggering flight-to-safety bid","Fed signal shift from hike to pause or cut (Powell pivot language or rate-cut dot-plot revision)","Cyclicals rolling over: Energy/Financials leadership fading while defensives stabilize on relative basis"],"bottom_signals_zh":["10年期收益率接近多年高位见顶（2018年10月约3.2%、2022年10月约4.0%、2023年10月约5.0%）：公用事业腿底部投降标志谷值","VIX在急性风险规避事件中飙升至25-30上方：避险买盘涌现","美联储信号从加息转为暂停或降息（鲍威尔转向措辞或降息点阵图修订）","周期股见顶回落：能源/金融领涨消退，防御股在相对基础上趋稳"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["Fed rate-cycle direction (cuts=tailwind; hikes=headwind for utility leg)","Long-end yields (TLT proxy; inversely correlated to XLU)","Macro regime quad (slowdown/deflation-scare = outperform vs SPY; reflation/growth-up = underperform)","Dollar direction (weak USD = tailwind for staples multinationals)","Risk-off VIX spikes (acute flight-to-safety bid lifts relative performance)","AI data center power demand (structural post-2023 utilities growth tailwind)"],"drivers_zh":["美联储利率周期方向（降息=顺风；加息=公用事业腿逆风）","长端收益率（TLT代理；与XLU负相关）","宏观象限体制（放缓/通缩恐慌=跑赢SPY；再通胀/增长向上=跑输）","美元方向（弱美元=必需品跨国企业顺风）","风险规避VIX飙升（急性避险买盘提升相对表现）","AI数据中心电力需求（2023年后公用事业结构性成长顺风）"],"median_cycle_months":25.4,"summary":"Defensives (XLP+XLU hybrid basket) cycle structurally as a mirror image of the macro risk-regime: they outperform in slowdown/deflation-scare quads where yields fall and risk appetite collapses, and they underperform in reflation/growth-up quads where cyclicals and semis lead. The basket has two internal engines that behave differently: the staples leg (XLP) responds primarily to recession probability and dollar direction (multinationals need a weak USD), while the utility leg (XLU) is a rate-derivative — falling yields are a direct tailwind regardless of growth. The recurring causal engine is the Fed cycle: defensive peaks tend to precede or coincide with Fed easing signals (yields already pricing cuts), while defensive troughs tend to coincide with yield peaks (when the rate-hike cycle exhausts) or acute risk-off catalysts. Since October 2023, utilities have added a structural AI-power-demand growth component that partially decouples them from the pure bond-proxy dynamic, compressing the sharpness of the next rate-driven cycle turn.","summary_zh":"防御篮子（XLP+XLU混合）在结构上是宏观风险体制的镜像：在放缓/通缩恐慌象限（收益率下行、风险偏好崩溃）中跑赢，在再通胀/增长向上象限（周期股与半导体领涨）中落后。篮子内两条腿行为迥异：必需品腿（XLP）主要响应衰退概率与美元方向（跨国巨头需要弱美元），而公用事业腿（XLU）是利率衍生品——无论增长如何，收益率下行均为直接顺风。周期性的核心驱动逻辑是美联储周期：防御股峰值倾向于领先或伴随美联储宽松信号（收益率已提前定价降息），而防御股谷值倾向于与收益率峰值（加息周期力竭时）或急性风险规避催化剂重合。2023年10月以来，公用事业增加了AI电力需求的结构性成长成分，使其部分脱离纯债券代理动态，压缩了下一次利率驱动周期转折的尖锐程度。","top_signals":["VIX compressing back below 15-17 after a fear spike: the safety premium dissipates rapidly","10-year yield troughing and market pricing peak number of Fed cuts: utility bond-proxy fully valued","Cyclicals (Energy, Industrials, Financials) accelerating leadership with high-beta outperforming low-vol by >10%","Reflation/growth-up quad confirmed (cyclicals beating defensives, oil and copper-gold rising)"],"top_signals_zh":["VIX在恐慌飙升后回落至15-17以下：安全溢价迅速消散","10年期收益率见底、市场定价降息顶点：公用事业债券代理估值充分","周期股（能源、工业、金融）加速领涨，高贝塔跑赢低波动超过10%","再通胀/增长向上象限确认（周期股跑赢防御，油价与铜金比上行）"]},"b-energy_complex":{"analog":"Closest to the Jun-2022 peak + Jul-2022 trough sequence (2022-06-07 / 2022-07-14): both share a sharp geopolitical-supply-premium unwind followed by a rapid trough and then a protracted +78% fundamental-driven grind under a tech-led macro regime. Today's setup (war premium peaking → ceasefire → dollar headwind + OPEC+ supply risk) rhymes precisely with the Jun-2022 sequence where the Russia-Ukraine premium rolled off and a brief trough led into a 2.4-year value-factor slog. The risk is that the next leg is long and slow if crude settles in a $70-90 range, not a supply-shock re-acceleration.","analog_zh":"与2022年6月峰值+7月谷底序列最为相似（2022-06-07 / 2022-07-14）：两者均呈现地缘政治供应溢价急速逆转后的快速触底，随后在科技领涨的宏观体制下展开漫长+78%的基本面驱动磨底式上涨。当前格局（战争溢价见顶→停火→美元逆风+OPEC+供应风险）与2022年6月俄乌溢价消退后的序列高度吻合——彼时经历短暂触底后进入长达2.4年的价值因子缓慢攀升。若原油在70-90美元区间企稳而非再次供应冲击提速，下一段将是漫长而缓慢的。","bottom_signals":["Oil at multi-year lows with energy sector at historic low weight in S&P 500 (~2-3%)","OPEC+ credibility crisis or major production-freeze/cut agreement (the announcement itself marks the low)","Rash of E&P Chapter 11 filings — sector capitulation signal","VIX spike to 28+ coinciding with energy being worst or second-worst S&P 500 sector"],"bottom_signals_zh":["原油处于多年低位，能源板块在标普500权重降至历史低点（约2-3%）","OPEC+公信力危机或主要冻产/减产协议（公告本身标志底部）","E&P公司破产潮——板块投降信号","VIX飙至28+同时能源为标普500最差或次差板块"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["crude oil price (OPEC+ supply discipline vs shale growth)","macro Quad regime (reflation vs slowdown/deflation-scare)","US dollar direction (DXY — mechanical inverse for commodity producers)","credit conditions (HY energy spreads, shale E&P leverage)","geopolitical supply-disruption risk premium (Middle East, Russia)"],"drivers_zh":["原油价格（OPEC+供给纪律vs页岩增长）","宏观象限（再通胀vs放缓/通缩惊魂）","美元方向（DXY——大宗商品生产商的机械性反向驱动）","信用环境（高收益能源利差、页岩E&P杠杆）","地缘政治供应中断风险溢价（中东、俄罗斯）"],"median_cycle_months":22.1,"summary":"The US Energy Complex is structurally a near-pure oil-price-beta vehicle: its cycles are driven first and foremost by crude oil supply/demand balance, then amplified or capped by the macro growth regime (Quad), the dollar's direction, and credit conditions in the high-yield energy space. Peaks arrive when oil is at multi-year highs and the commodity/reflation trade is consensus crowded (OPEC+ discipline visible, geopolitical premium embedded, energy stocks near decade-highs vs SPY). Troughs arrive when supply overhangs prove structural, demand expectations collapse (China/recession fear), or a policy shock (Fed hiking aggressively, dollar surging) destroys the carry for levered E&P. The sector consistently underperforms SPY in goldilocks tech-led regimes (2022-2024) and outperforms brutally in supply-shock reflation (2016-2022, 2025-2026). Cycles are irregular — ranging from 7-month whipsaws to 32-month super-cycles — with a median peak-to-peak full cycle of roughly 22 months (trough-to-trough closer to 18).","summary_zh":"美国能源综合在结构上近乎纯粹的油价贝塔工具：其周期首先由原油供需平衡驱动，再被宏观增长体制（象限）、美元方向及高收益能源信用环境放大或压制。峰值出现在油价处于多年高位、大宗商品/再通胀交易拥挤（OPEC+纪律可见、地缘溢价已被定价、能源股相对SPY处于十年高位）之时。谷底则在供应过剩被证明具有结构性、需求预期崩溃（中国/衰退恐慌）或政策冲击（美联储激进加息、美元飙升）摧毁高杠杆E&P的套利之际出现。该板块在金发女郎、科技领涨的体制中（2022-2024年）持续跑输SPY，而在供应冲击再通胀中（2016-2022年、2025-2026年）则大幅跑赢。周期不规则——从7个月的急剧波动到32个月的超级周期不等——峰到峰完整周期中位数约22个月（谷到谷约18个月）。","top_signals":["WTI/Brent at multi-year highs with OPEC+ discipline widely cited as consensus — over-owned narrative","Energy as top sector in S&P 500 for 2+ consecutive months, RS rank top decile","Geopolitical risk premium embedded (war/sanctions widely discussed as a buying catalyst — contrarian late signal)","HY energy credit spreads at cycle lows, shale capex guidance raised — supply response beginning"],"top_signals_zh":["WTI/布伦特处于多年高位、OPEC+纪律被广泛引用为共识——叙事过度拥挤","能源在标普500连续2+个月领涨、相对强度排名前十分位","地缘政治风险溢价已被定价（战争/制裁被广泛讨论为买入催化剂——逆向滞后信号）","高收益能源信用利差处于周期低点、页岩资本开支指引上调——供应响应开始"]},"b-housing":{"analog":"Closest to the Oct-2023 trough analog: same structure of a sharp oil/inflation shock driving a peak (Hormuz 2026 mirrors the 2022-23 rate shock), then a ceasefire/disinflation event unlocking a rate-relief bounce off an oversold low. The Oct-2023 leg began with 10Y near 5% and 30yr mortgage near 8%, then a Fed pivot triggered a 90% rally; the May-2026 leg begins with similar positioning after an oil-shock that pushed mortgages higher, and the ceasefire has only partially unwound the damage. The critical difference: in Oct 2023 the Fed explicitly pivoted (December 2023 dot plot), whereas the current setup has no confirmed pivot -- only tactical relief on oil. This makes the current bounce more analogous to the June-2022 bear-market rally (which gave 26% before rolling over on Jackson Hole), suggesting the risk is a partial recovery followed by another rate test if CPI re-accelerates.","analog_zh":"最接近2023年10月低点的类比：相同的结构——油价/通胀冲击驱动一个高点（2026年霍尔木兹冲击镜像2022-23年利率冲击），随后停火/去通胀事件在超卖低点解锁利率减压反弹。2023年10月的腿从10年期接近5%、30年期抵押贷款接近8%开始，随后美联储转向触发90%的反弹；2026年5月的腿在类似定位下开始，在油价冲击推高抵押贷款利率后停火仅部分解除损害。关键差异：2023年10月美联储明确转向（2023年12月点阵图），而当前形态没有确认的转向——仅有油价的战术性减压。这使当前反弹更类似于2022年6月的熊市反弹（上涨26%后在杰克逊霍尔回落），表明风险是部分复苏后若CPI重新加速则迎来另一轮利率测试。","bottom_signals":["30yr mortgage rate turning lower after a spike of more than 150bp: direct affordability unlock","Fed pivot or insurance-cut language (Jan 2019, Dec 2023 pattern): front-run trigger","VIX peak and reversal above 35 then falling plus TLT bottoming: macro risk-off exhaustion","Homebuilder RS rank reaching bottom decile with breadth divergence (RSP outperforming SPY): oversold reflex setup"],"bottom_signals_zh":["30年期抵押贷款利率在飙升超150bp后开始下行：直接解锁负担能力","美联储转向或预防性降息信号（2019年1月、2023年12月模式）：抢跑触发器","VIX见顶回落（超35后下行）加TLT触底：宏观避险情绪耗尽","建筑商RS排名触底十分位同时市场广度背离（RSP跑赢SPY）：超卖反射形态"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["30-year mortgage rate direction (not level): the single dominant driver","Fed rate policy: hike cycles crush the basket, pivot/cuts ignite it","Oil/CPI shock: raises inflation expectations, backs up mortgage rates indirectly","Risk-on/off macro regime: high-beta basket amplifies broad VIX moves","Structural supply: existing-home lock-in effect channels demand to new builds","Dollar regime: weaker DXY supports the risk-on reflationary tapes that lift housing"],"drivers_zh":["30年期抵押贷款利率方向（而非绝对水平）：单一主导驱动","美联储利率政策：加息周期摧毁板块，转向/降息点燃它","油价/CPI冲击：推高通胀预期，间接推升抵押贷款利率","风险偏好/厌恶宏观制度：高贝塔板块放大大盘VIX波动","结构性供给：二手房锁定效应将需求导向新建房","美元制度：美元走弱支持提振住房的风险偏好再通胀行情"],"median_cycle_months":15.8,"summary":"The Housing Chain is the most rate-sensitive large cyclical basket in the US equity universe: the 30-year mortgage rate is its single binding constraint, and the basket's cycle is almost entirely determined by where mortgage rates are going (not where they are). Every major rally began when the rate direction turned lower (Feb 2016, Dec 2018, Oct 2022, Oct 2023) and every major selloff began when mortgage rates surged (Jan 2018, Dec 2021, Aug 2022, Aug 2023, Oct 2024, Feb 2026). The basket amplifies the broad market's rate regime because it compounds the sensitivity: it is a consumer-cyclical that pays out through housing demand, which moves with the affordability math. A structural lock-in effect since 2022 (existing sellers frozen into sub-3% mortgages) has added a second layer: even at 7-8% mortgages, new-build demand has been stickier than prior cycles because the resale market is frozen, channeling all buyers to DHI, LEN, NVR and Home Depot.","summary_zh":"住房产业链是美国股票市场中利率最敏感的大型周期板块：30年期抵押贷款利率是其唯一的绑定约束，板块周期几乎完全取决于抵押贷款利率的方向（而非绝对水平）。每一次主要反弹都始于利率方向转为下行（2016年2月、2018年12月、2022年10月、2023年10月），每一次主要下跌都始于抵押贷款利率飙升（2018年1月、2021年12月、2022年8月、2023年8月、2024年10月、2026年2月）。该板块放大了大盘的利率制度，因为它叠加了敏感性：它是一个通过住房需求实现的消费周期板块，随负担能力数学而波动。2022年以来的结构性锁定效应（现有卖家被锁定在3%以下的低息抵押贷款中）增加了第二层：即便在7-8%的抵押贷款利率下，新建房需求也比以往周期更具粘性，因为二手房市场冻结，所有买家被导向DHI、LEN、NVR和家得宝。","top_signals":["30yr mortgage rate surging above 6.5% while VIX spikes: classic housing peak setup","Defensives outperforming cyclicals for 2+ weeks alongside DXY strength: rate-shock risk-off forming","TLT selling off sharply (greater than 10% in 3 months) with oil/CPI running hot: inflation-driven rate-regime shift","Housing RS rank rolling over from a high while VIX rises: counter-trend top signal"],"top_signals_zh":["30年期抵押贷款利率飙升至6.5%以上同时VIX飙升：典型住房见顶形态","防御板块连续2周以上跑赢周期股叠加DXY走强：利率冲击避险正在形成","TLT急跌（3个月超10%）同时油价/CPI走热：通胀驱动的利率制度转变","住房RS排名从高位回落同时VIX上升：逆势顶部信号"]},"b-industrial_distribution":{"analog":"Closest to the 2022-09-26 goldilocks melt-up entry: same reflation/growth-up regime with cyclicals leading defensives by ~31pp, semis leading the tape, dollar weakening, and a Fed-easing/trade-deal catalyst as the macro reset. The Sep-2022 entry followed a violent risk-off dislocation (VIX 32) into a CPI-cooler catalyst — analogous to today's VIX-52 Liberation Day trough followed by the tariff pause catalyst. The Sep-2022 leg ran 26 months and +100% before peaking; the current leg (Apr-2025 start) shows the same structural fingerprint at month 14 and +58%, suggesting the compounder is roughly mid-leg if the AI/electrification demand thesis holds and the Fed does not re-tighten aggressively.","analog_zh":"最近似2022年9月26日Goldilocks融涨入场点：同为再通胀/增长上行regime，周期股领先防御约31个百分点，半导体引领行情，美元走弱，美联储宽松/贸易协议作为宏观重置催化剂。2022年9月入场点紧随剧烈避险错位（VIX 32）后的CPI低于预期催化剂——类似于当前VIX 52解放日低点后的关税暂停催化剂。2022年9月那段腿段历时26个月、涨幅+100%后见顶；当前腿段（2025年4月启动）在第14个月+58%处呈现相同的结构指纹，若AI/电气化需求逻辑成立且美联储不再激进收紧，该复利品种或处于腿段中途。","bottom_signals":["Oil price finding a floor and commodity-sector capex plans revised upward after major crash (oil rebounding 30%+ from lows)","Fed pivot signal — rate-hike pause language or actual cut: triggers multiple re-rating before earnings recover","VIX above 30 with high-beta SPHB-SPLV spread at multi-year wides: oversold cyclical entry","ISM Manufacturing below 48 for 3+ consecutive months with RSP-SPY breadth at -5% or worse — washout not further deterioration"],"bottom_signals_zh":["大幅崩盘后油价企稳，商品行业资本开支计划上修（油价较低点反弹30%+）","美联储转向信号——暂停加息措辞或实际降息：在盈利复苏前触发估值倍数重新定价","VIX高于30且高贝塔SPHB-SPLV利差处于多年最宽：超卖周期股入场信号","ISM制造业连续3个月以上低于48且RSP-SPY广度恶化至-5%或更差——已是洗盘而非继续下跌"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["ISM Manufacturing and U.S. capex cycle: MRO orders track PMI above 50 and corporate investment expansions","Oil and commodity regime: energy/materials customers are marginal demand; oil crashes translate directly to MRO revenue hits","Fed rate and dollar regime: rate surges de-rate multiples; a strong DXY hits multinational distributor revenues","Fiscal and infrastructure policy: TCJA bonus depreciation, CARES/ARP stimulus, CHIPS/IRA reshoring each triggered measurable MRO demand surges","Risk-on/risk-off macro: lower beta than pure cyclicals cushions selloffs but caps upside in speculative melt-ups"],"drivers_zh":["ISM制造业/美国资本开支周期：PMI高于50且企业投资扩张时MRO订单同步增长","油价与商品regime：能源/材料客户是边际需求；油价崩盘直接转化为MRO收入冲击","美联储利率与美元regime：收益率飙升压缩估值倍数；强势DXY冲击跨国分销商收入","财政与基础设施政策：TCJA加速折旧、《关爱法案》/《美国救援计划》刺激、《芯片法案》/《通胀削减法案》回流——每项均触发可量化的MRO需求浪潮","风险偏好/避险宏观：低于纯周期股的贝塔在抛售中提供缓冲，但在投机性融涨中压制上行空间"],"median_cycle_months":20.6,"summary":"Industrial Distribution & Capital Goods (Grainger, Fastenal, Wesco, MRC Global-type MRO/short-cycle) cycles on the interaction of three recurring forces: (1) the macro growth and capex cycle — when ISM Manufacturing is above 50 and corporate capex is expanding, distributors see volume and pricing tailwinds directly; (2) commodity and oil regimes — energy and materials-sector customers are the marginal demand driver, so oil collapses (-75% in 2014-16, -62% in 2020) trigger simultaneous revenue and sentiment hits; (3) the rate and dollar regime — as lower-beta cyclicals, they de-rate on rate surges (TLT -22% in 2021-22) and re-rate on Fed pivots, while a strong dollar (DXY +22% in 2014-16) hurts multinational distributor revenues directly. The basket reliably lags high-beta cyclicals in blow-off rallies but cushions better in risk-off episodes — making it the boring-but-effective late-cycle quality compounder within XLI. Median peak-to-peak cycle is approximately 21 months.","summary_zh":"工业分销与资本品（格雷杰、法士特、Wesco、MRC Global型MRO/短周期）的周期由三大反复出现的力量交织驱动：（1）宏观增长与资本开支周期——当ISM制造业指数高于50且企业资本开支扩张时，分销商直接获得量价顺风；（2）商品与油价regime——能源和材料行业客户是边际需求驱动力，油价崩盘（2014-16年-75%，2020年-62%）会同时冲击收入和市场情绪；（3）利率与美元regime——作为低贝塔周期股，收益率飙升时估值去化（2021-22年TLT -22%），美联储转向时重新估值，而强势美元（2014-16年DXY +22%）直接冲击跨国分销商收入。该篮子在高贝塔周期股吹顶行情中可靠地落后，但在避险行情中提供更好缓冲——使其成为XLI中枯燥但有效的后周期优质复利品种。峰值至峰值的中位周期约为21个月。","top_signals":["ISM Manufacturing approaches or exceeds 60 with oil prices extended — distributor volume peaks tend to lag the PMI peak by 1-2 quarters","Fed hiking cycle entering final innings with DXY at multi-year highs above 105: rate-shock de-rate incoming","Semis and tech leading a narrow tape (RSP-SPY < -5%) at stretched valuations: late-cycle melt-up nearing exhaustion","Earnings guidance cuts from major industrial customers in energy and materials foreshadow MRO demand rollover"],"top_signals_zh":["ISM制造业接近或超过60且油价延伸——分销商成交量峰值通常滞后PMI峰值1-2个季度","美联储加息周期进入尾声且DXY处于105以上多年高位：利率冲击去估值来临","半导体/科技引领狭幅行情（RSP-SPY < -5%）且估值偏高：后周期融涨接近耗竭","主要工业客户（能源、材料）盈利指引下调预示MRO需求拐点"]},"b-insurance":{"analog":"Closest to the Dec-2018 trough recovery leg (2018-12-24 to 2020-02-11): the same setup of a Fed-driven inflection point where rates peaked and policy turned more accommodative, P&C hard market pricing was accelerating, and the sector was recovering from an indiscriminate financial-sector selloff. In both cases insurance emerged from a macro shock with clean underwriting fundamentals intact and rode a 12-18 month recovery -- the current 2026 position (mid-expansion, low-drama, Financials lagging) mirrors the mid-2019 phase of that prior leg where the sector compounded quietly while tech led the headline gains.","analog_zh":"最接近2018年12月24日低点复苏腿（2018-12-24至2020-02-11）：同样是美联储驱动的拐点，利率见顶、政策趋向宽松，P&C硬市场定价加速，行业从无差别金融板块抛售中恢复。两种情况下，保险均从宏观冲击中走出，承保基本面完好无损，乘复苏行情持续12-18个月——当前2026年的定位（扩张中段、低波动、金融板块落后）与彼时2019年中期阶段相符，该阶段保险静静复利而科技股占据头条。","bottom_signals":["VIX spikes above 30 and financials sell off indiscriminately (insurance dragged to trough regardless of fundamentals)","10-year yield bottoms or troughs (float income set to improve on reinvestment)","P&C catastrophe loss season ends with capital impairment -- seeds next hard market","Sector RS rank collapses to bottom-quartile while P&C underwriting begins improving"],"bottom_signals_zh":["VIX升破30，金融股无差别抛售（无视基本面将保险拖至低谷）","10年期国债收益率触底（浮存金再投资收益前景改善）","P&C巨灾季资本损耗后结束——为下一轮硬市场埋下伏笔","行业相对强弱跌入末位四分位，而P&C承保同时开始改善"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["P&C underwriting cycle: cat losses drive hard/soft premium pricing","Interest rate level: float investment income is a major EPS lever","Broad equity risk regime: low-beta drags in crashes, cushioned in selloffs","Regulatory/policy catalysts: ACA enrollment, deregulation, capital rules","Broker fee revenue: GDP-linked, cycle-agnostic compounder"],"drivers_zh":["P&C承保周期：巨灾损失驱动硬/软市场保费定价","利率水平：浮存金投资收益是重要的EPS杠杆","大盘风险体制：低贝塔在崩盘中随市受拖，在回调中有缓冲","监管/政策催化剂：ACA入保、去监管、资本规则","经纪商手续费收入：与GDP挂钩、与周期无关的复利器"],"median_cycle_months":40,"summary":"Insurance & Brokers cycles on three interlocking forces: the P&C underwriting cycle (hard-to-soft pricing swing driven by cumulative catastrophe losses and capital flows into the sector), the interest rate cycle (float investment income is a major P&L lever -- shifts in the 10-year materially move sector EPS), and the broad equity risk regime (as a low-beta financial sub-sector, it gets dragged in extreme selloffs but cushioned in mild ones, and lags in high-beta melt-ups). The basket tends to outperform when rates rise and the macro regime broadens (reflation/Quad 2), and it compresses when growth scares hit financials indiscriminately. Brokers add a cycle-agnostic fee compounder that makes the basket structurally smoother than pure P&C plays.","summary_zh":"保险与经纪的周期由三大互锁力量驱动：P&C承保周期（由累积巨灾损失与资本流入主导的硬市场/软市场定价轮动）、利率周期（浮存金投资收益是重要的利润杠杆——10年期利率变动显著影响行业EPS）、以及大盘风险偏好体制（作为低贝塔金融子行业，极端抛售中随市大跌但跌幅较浅，温和回调中有缓冲，高贝塔融涨中落后）。当利率上升且宏观环境普涨（反通胀/Quad 2）时，篮子倾向于跑赢；当增长恐慌无差别打击金融板块时，篮子则承压。经纪商提供了与周期无关的手续费复利，使篮子在结构上比纯P&C标的更为平滑。","top_signals":["P&C pricing cycle turns soft (combined ratios benign for several quarters, capital flooding back in)","10-year yield peaks and reverses sharply (float income outlook deteriorates)","Broad financial sector (XLF) rolls over with VIX spiking above 25 (financials dragged indiscriminately)","Sector RS rank deteriorates from top-quartile to mid-field in a risk-on tape"],"top_signals_zh":["P&C定价周期转软（综合成本率连续数季度温和，资本大举回流）","10年期国债收益率见顶急速反转（浮存金收益前景恶化）","大金融板块（XLF）随VIX升破25回落（金融股被无差别拖累）","行业相对强弱从前四分位滑落至中游，且处于风险偏好行情中"]},"b-mag7":{"analog":"Closest to the Oct-2018 peak (same setup): a narrow mega-cap melt-up has just ended, breadth is broadening (RSP now beating SPY as it did in late 2018 when value/cyclicals outperformed), real yields are biased higher (the 2026 Fed hiking bias mirrors Powell's 'long way from neutral' posture), growth is lagging value (-15.2 now vs -5.0 in Q4 2018), and the AI-capex narrative faces its first sustained credibility test (DeepSeek + ROI skepticism mirrors the 2018 trade-war overhang on tech supply chains). The key difference: in 2018 the bottom catalyst was a clean Fed pivot (Jan 4, 2019 Powell 'patient'); in 2026 no such catalyst is yet visible - the next analog leg (the Dec 2018->May 2019 +33% recovery) would require either an explicit Fed dovish turn or a resolution of the Hormuz/oil/stagflation regime.","analog_zh":"与2018年10月峰值最为相似（相同格局）：窄幅大盘股熔涨刚刚结束，广度转宽（RSP正跑赢SPY，如2018年末价值/周期股跑赢时），实际收益率偏向上行（2026年美联储加息倾向与鲍威尔\"距中性还远\"姿态相呼应），成长跑输价值（当前-15.2 vs 2018年四季度-5.0），AI资本开支叙事面临首次持续性可信度考验（DeepSeek+ROI怀疑论对应2018年贸易战对科技供应链的拖累）。关键差异：2018年底部催化剂是明确的美联储转向（2019年1月4日鲍威尔\"耐心\"声明）；2026年目前尚无此类催化剂——下一个类比腿（2018年12月至2019年5月+33%修复）需要明确的美联储鸽派转向或霍尔木兹/油价/类滞胀机制的化解。","bottom_signals":["RSP reverts to lagging SPY (breadth narrowing = mega-cap re-accumulation signal)","VIX spike above 30-50 followed by rapid collapse (fear capitulation)","Growth-minus-value spread widens sharply after a compression trough","AI/tech earnings catalysts reassert forward revenue guidance (e.g. hyperscaler capex commitments)"],"bottom_signals_zh":["RSP回落至跑输SPY（广度收窄=大盘股重新积累信号）","VIX飙升超30-50后迅速崩塌（恐慌性出清）","成长-价值利差在压缩低谷后大幅走扩","AI/科技盈利催化剂重新确立前瞻营收指引（如超级云厂商资本开支承诺）"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["AI/cloud/platform secular earnings compounding (NVDA/MSFT/AMZN/GOOGL/META/AAPL/TSLA)","Fed rate cycle and real-yield regime (falling yields -> duration bid; rising yields -> multiple compression)","Breadth/concentration dynamic (RSP vs SPY spread is the single most reliable regime indicator)","Dollar (a sustained DXY surge creates a multinational revenue headwind for the overseas-revenue-heavy cohort)","AI-capex thesis integrity (monetization milestones vs ROI skepticism events like DeepSeek)"],"drivers_zh":["AI/云计算/平台世俗盈利复利(英伟达/微软/亚马逊/谷歌/Meta/苹果/特斯拉)","美联储利率周期与实际收益率机制(收益率下行->久期买盘；收益率上行->估值压缩)","广度/集中度动态(RSP vs SPY利差是最可靠的单一机制指标)","美元汇率(美元持续飙升对海外营收占比高的群体形成收入逆风)","AI资本开支逻辑完整性(变现里程碑 vs ROI怀疑论事件如DeepSeek)"],"median_cycle_months":8,"summary":"The Magnificent Seven cycle on a single recurring engine: concentration of equity flows into narrow AI/cloud/platform mega-cap leadership during risk-on, low-volatility, growth-beats-value, falling-yield regimes - and violent unwinds whenever that concentration is disrupted by rate shocks, external macro dislocations (oil, China, tariffs), or when breadth broadens (RSP beats SPY). The structural bull case is secular earnings power (cloud monetization, advertising duopoly, AI-capex compounding) that consistently re-attracts flows after drawdowns; the structural bear trigger is any macro shift that makes long-duration high-multiple assets vulnerable (rising real yields, dollar surges, stagflation quads) or that disrupts the AI-capex monetization thesis itself (DeepSeek, ROI skepticism). The cohort has compounded a remarkable total return over the window (ret_win ~+3,733% absolute) precisely because it compounds secular growth through every cycle - but each drawdown is severe (typically -25% to -35%) because the same concentration that drives the melt-ups creates violent unwinds.","summary_zh":"七巨头的周期驱动由单一反复出现的引擎主导：在风险偏好开启、低波动率、成长跑赢价值、收益率下行的环境中，股权资金集中流入窄幅AI/云计算/平台大盘股领导行情——一旦这种集中被利率冲击、外部宏观错位（油价、中国、关税）打破，或广度转宽（RSP跑赢SPY），则发生剧烈平仓。结构性多头逻辑是世俗盈利能力（云计算变现、广告双寡头、AI资本开支复利）在每次回撤后持续重新吸引资金；结构性熊头触发是任何令长久期高估值资产承压的宏观转变（实际收益率上行、美元强势、类滞胀象限）或动摇AI资本开支变现逻辑的事件（DeepSeek、ROI怀疑论）。该群体在整个窗口录得惊人的累计总回报（绝对回报约+3733%），正是因为其在每个周期中复利世俗增长——但每次回撤均严酷（通常-25%至-35%），因为驱动熔涨的集中效应同样制造剧烈平仓。","top_signals":["RSP begins to outperform SPY (breadth broadening = concentration unwind signal)","Growth-minus-value spread narrows to zero or turns negative after an extended positive run","DXY breaks into a sustained uptrend (multinational revenue headwind)","Oil/commodities surge into a stagflation-ish quad (Energy/Materials leading while Tech lags)"],"top_signals_zh":["RSP开始跑赢SPY（广度转宽=集中度平仓信号）","成长-价值利差从长期正区间收窄至零或转负","美元指数进入持续上行趋势（跨国公司营收逆风）","油价/大宗商品飙升进入类滞胀象限（能源/材料领涨而科技滞后）"]},"b-managed_care":{"analog":"Closest to the June-2015 peak: same 'full-thesis-priced + wrong-side-leadership' setup — in 2015, managed care had just completed a 97% bull run on the ACA enrollment boom, sat at a record RS rank, and was leading in a defensive-led tape before the China shock and ACA exchange-loss disclosures ended the cycle. Today (June 2026), the basket has completed a +73% recovery run, sits at pos 99.7 with RS #4, and is leading from the defensive side in a reflation/growth-up tape where Tech and high-beta lead — the same wrong-side leadership that marked the June-2015 peak. The key difference: in 2015 the crash was triggered by an external macro shock (China devaluation) plus a company-level policy revelation (UNH ACA losses); today the MCR crisis is already in the rearview and the next trigger would be CMS rate risk or GLP-1 cost acceleration rather than a repeat of the same fundamental shock.","analog_zh":"与2015年6月高点最为相似：相同的'论点完全定价+错边领导'格局——2015年，管理式医疗刚刚完成ACA参保热带来的97%牛市，RS排名创历史新高，在防御股领涨的行情中领跑，随后中国冲击与ACA交易所亏损披露终结了该周期。当前（2026年6月），篮子完成了+73%的复苏行情，pos 99.7、RS第4，在科技与高贝塔领跑的再通胀/增长向上行情中从防御侧领跑——与2015年6月高点相同的错边领导。关键区别：2015年的崩盘由外部宏观冲击（中国贬值）加公司层面政策披露（UNH ACA亏损）触发；当前MCR危机已成过去，下一个触发点将是CMS费率风险或GLP-1成本加速，而非同一基本面冲击的重演。","bottom_signals":["Idiosyncratic selloff while SPY rises (managed care down >15% vs flat/rising SPY) → MCO-specific capitulation; historically bottoms within 3-6 months (2019 Apr, 2023 Mar, 2025 Aug)","MCR disclosed at cycle peak (>85%) + CMS preliminary rate near-flat or negative → sector-wide repricing needed; marks the start of the bottom-finding process, not an immediate buy","High-profile name (UNH/HUM) cutting full-year EPS guidance + sector-wide MLR disclosure → forced-seller capitulation; the deepest single-leg bottom signal","Flight-to-safety macro (VIX spike, defensives leading) while managed care is simultaneously selling off → macro-specific trough; recovery tends to be faster (2016 Feb, 2018 Dec)"],"bottom_signals_zh":["在SPY上涨时的个体化抛售（管理式医疗跌>15% 而SPY平/升）→MCO特异投降；历史上3-6个月内见底（2019年4月、2023年3月、2025年8月）","MCR披露达周期峰值（>85%）+CMS初步费率接近持平或负值→需要全行业重定价；标志着筑底过程开始，而非即时买点","知名公司（UNH/HUM）下调全年EPS指引+全行业MCR披露→强制卖家投降；最深的单段底部信号","宏观避险（VIX飙升、防御股领跑）同时管理式医疗下跌→宏观特异低点；复苏往往更快（2016年2月、2018年12月）"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["Medicare Advantage rate (CMS annual proposal) — most powerful single-year catalyst","Medical loss ratio (MLR) cycle — premium-vs-claims spread determines sector earnings quality","Defensive rotation bid: contractual revenues make MCOs safe-haven in macro risk-off","ACA / Medicaid policy architecture changes — enrollment booms and exchange-loss shocks","GLP-1/novel drug utilization cycles — structural cost wildcards that can blow the MLR","Political risk (Medicare for All, drug pricing reform) — election-cycle idiosyncratic selloff risk"],"drivers_zh":["Medicare Advantage费率（CMS年度提案）——单年最强催化剂","医疗损失率（MLR）周期——保费与理赔价差决定板块盈利质量","防御性轮动买盘：合约性营收使MCO在宏观避险时成为避风港","ACA/医疗补助政策架构变化——参保潮与交易所亏损冲击","GLP-1/新型药物利用率周期——可令MLR失控的结构性成本通配符","政治风险（全民医保、药价改革）——选举周期个体化抛售风险"],"median_cycle_months":8.5,"summary":"Managed Care & Insurers cycles on three recurring engines. (1) Policy/regulatory risk is the dominant cycle driver — Medicare Advantage rate proposals (CMS), ACA architecture changes, and 'Medicare for All' political risk have caused the largest idiosyncratic moves, both rallies (Trump-era MA deregulation, 2026 CMS favorable rates) and crashes (2015 ACA exchange losses, 2019 M4A fear, 2024-25 MCR blowout). (2) The medical-loss ratio (MLR) cycle — the spread between premiums collected and claims paid — is the sector's fundamental heartbeat: periods of MLR improvement (post-COVID utilization trough, pricing resets) coincide with bull legs, while MLR blowouts (pent-up demand surges, novel cost categories like GLP-1s) define the selloffs. (3) The defensive-rotation bid — when VIX spikes and the macro turns flight-to-safety, managed care attracts a relative inflow because its contractual premium revenues are counter-cyclical, making it a source-of-funds trade in risk-on environments and a safe-haven trade in risk-off environments; this defensive character means the sector is always a relative outperformer in selloffs unless the problem is MCO-specific (as in 2019, 2024-25).","summary_zh":"管理式医疗与保险的循环由三个反复出现的引擎驱动。(1) 政策/监管风险是最主要的周期驱动因素——CMS的Medicare Advantage费率提案、ACA架构变化及'全民医保'政治风险制造了最大的个体化波动，包括上涨（特朗普时代MA去管制、2026年CMS有利费率）和崩盘（2015年ACA交易所亏损、2019年M4A恐惧、2024-25年MCR失控）。(2) 医疗损失率（MLR）周期——已收保费与已付理赔之间的价差——是该行业的基本面心跳：MLR改善期（疫情后利用率低谷、定价重置）对应牛市行情，而MLR失控（压抑需求激增、GLP-1等新型成本类别）定义了下跌段。(3) 防御性轮动买盘——当VIX飙升、宏观转向避险时，管理式医疗因其合约保费收入的逆周期特性而吸引相对资金流入，在风险偏好环境中成为资金来源，在避险环境中成为避风港；这一防御属性意味着，除非问题是MCO特异的（如2019、2024-25年），该板块在下跌中始终具有相对超额表现。","top_signals":["Pos >95 + RS #1-4 with MCR at cycle-lows → full earnings-repricing trade done; watch for CMS next-year rate proposal as the exit trigger","Defensive group leading in a reflation/growth-up tape (wrong-side leadership) → idiosyncratic blow-off; historically marks within 3-6 months of a major turn","Political risk resurfacing: M4A bill introductions, Democratic primary cycle, or CMS preliminary rate proposals near-flat to negative → peak-risk window","Strong earnings beats + MA enrollment guidance raises after a sustained bull run → crowded consensus; prior peaks at 2015-06-25, 2018-01-29, 2024-09-13 all followed 2+ years of EPS beats"],"top_signals_zh":["pos >95 + RS #1-4且MCR处于周期低位→完整盈利重估交易已完成；关注CMS下一年度费率提案作为退出触发","在再通胀/增长向上行情中防御组别领跑（错边领导）→个体化喷发；历史上标志着3-6个月内出现重大转折","政治风险重燃：M4A法案提交、民主党初选周期，或CMS初步费率提案接近持平至负值→高峰风险窗口","持续牛市后的强劲EPS超预期+MA参保指引上调→共识过于拥挤；前期高点2015-06-25、2018-01-29、2024-09-13均在2年以上EPS超预期后出现"]},"b-memory_storage":{"analog":"Closest to the Dec-2014 peak: the same supply-discipline-built oligopoly pricing peak, followed by a 13-15 month topping-then-collapse as the demand driver (then mobile DRAM, now AI HBM) risks saturation and capex ramp-up lag catches up. The current cycle has seen SMH extend to comparable extremes (+271% vs +121% in 2016-2018), breadth has collapsed (RSP lagged SPY -13% now vs -4.5% then), and the basket sits at the 95th percentile with a SELL signal — precisely the positioning that preceded the Dec-2014→Jan-2016 -59% collapse. The difference is the AI structural demand floor (HBM content per accelerator keeps rising) which may limit the eventual down-cycle versus prior commodity-only busts.","analog_zh":"与2014年12月峰值最为相似：同样是供给纪律下寡占定价周期见顶，随后13-15个月筑顶后崩跌——当年需求驱动力为移动DRAM，如今为AI HBM，均面临饱和风险与资本开支滞后追赶的威胁。本周期SMH已延伸至类似极端（+271%对2016-2018年+121%），广度已崩塌（RSP跑输SPY -13%对当年-4.5%），篮子处于95百分位且触发卖出信号——与2014年12月→2016年1月-59%崩跌前的仓位结构如出一辙。区别在于AI结构性需求底板（每台加速器HBM内存用量持续提升）可能限制最终下行周期的深度，使其不如以往纯商品驱动周期那般惨烈。","bottom_signals":["Memory makers announce 5%+ output/capex cuts (Micron, Samsung, SK Hynix press releases)","DRAM/NAND channel inventory normalization reports from major PC/smartphone OEMs","High-beta collapse: SPHB-SPLV spread exceeds -20 with VIX >30 — forced deleveraging climax","Basket RSI below 25 with SMH diverging positively from memory stocks — sector-specific oversold"],"bottom_signals_zh":["内存厂商宣布产量/资本开支削减5%以上（美光、三星、SK海力士新闻稿）","主要PC/智能手机OEM报告DRAM/NAND渠道库存正常化","高贝塔崩塌：SPHB-SPLV价差超-20且VIX>30——强制去杠杆高潮","篮子RSI低于25且SMH对内存股出现正背离——板块专属超卖"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["DRAM/NAND ASP cycle (oligopoly capex decisions lag 12-18 months)","End-market demand shocks (PC/mobile/cloud/AI successive waves)","Fed rate regime and risk-on/off macro multiplier","Supply concentration (3-player oligopoly — Micron/Samsung/SK Hynix)","Emerging technology demand step-change (3D NAND 2016, HBM 2023-)"],"drivers_zh":["DRAM/NAND ASP周期（寡头资本开支滞后12-18个月）","终端需求冲击（PC/移动/云计算/AI历次浪潮）","美联储利率政策与风险偏好/规避宏观乘数","供给集中度（美光/三星/SK海力士三强寡占）","新兴技术需求阶跃（2016年3D NAND、2023年后HBM）"],"median_cycle_months":15,"summary":"Memory, HBM & Storage is the most cyclically violent sub-sector in semiconductors: it produces commodity-like DRAM and NAND at scale, where bit supply growth and ASP are functions of the 3-to-5 three-player oligopoly's capex decisions, lagging demand signals by 12-18 months. Every cycle is structurally the same — an end-market demand surge (PC, mobile, cloud, AI) tightens supply, ASPs spike, producers ramp capex, oversupply builds 4-6 quarters later, ASPs collapse, the basket falls 40-60%, makers slash capex, the cycle resets. The basket amplifies the broader semiconductor cycle 2-3x, because it has the highest earnings leverage to ASP: a 10% DRAM price move can flip operating margin 20-30 percentage points. Macro acts as a multiplier: rate shocks and risk-off regimes deepen the down-cycles, while Fed pivots and risk-on reflation accelerate recoveries far beyond what fundamentals alone would justify.","summary_zh":"内存、HBM与存储是半导体子行业中周期波动最为剧烈的板块：以规模化生产DRAM和NAND为核心，位供给增长与ASP均由三大寡头资本开支决策决定，比需求信号滞后12-18个月。每个周期结构如出一辙——终端需求激增（PC、移动、云计算、AI）收紧供给，ASP飙升，厂商加大资本开支，4-6个季度后供过于求累积，ASP崩跌，篮子下跌40-60%，厂商削减资本开支，周期重启。篮子放大整体半导体周期2-3倍，因为其盈利对ASP杠杆最高：DRAM价格每变动10%可使营业利润率翻转20-30个百分点。宏观起乘数作用：利率冲击与避险政策加深下行周期，而美联储转鸽与风险偏好再通胀则使复苏远超基本面所能支撑的幅度。","top_signals":["SMH (semis ETF) exceeds +100% gain in the rally leg — extreme extension signals capex ramp-up lag is ending","DRAM/NAND ASP deceleration reported in TrendForce/DRAMeXchange monthly data after 2+ quarters of acceleration","Narrow breadth extremes: RSP lagging SPY by more than 20% over the rally — signals mega-cap-led exhaustion","VIX persistently below 14 with high-beta premium (SPHB-SPLV >15) — complacency/leverage peak"],"top_signals_zh":["SMH（半导体ETF）涨幅超+100%——极端拉伸信号资本开支滞后效应趋于结束","TrendForce/DRAMeXchange月度数据显示DRAM/NAND ASP在连续2个季度加速后开始减速","广度极端狭窄：RSP跑输SPY超20%——信号大盘股领涨行情趋于衰竭","VIX持续低于14且高贝塔溢价（SPHB-SPLV>15）——自满/杠杆达峰"]},"b-non_ai_software":{"analog":"Closest to the 2024-12-06 peak analog: the current setup (June 2026 trough off a major rally peak) most rhymes with the Aug-10 2022 peak that preceded the Jackson Hole rate-shock leg -- same pattern of a strong relief rally peaking into hawkish Fed repricing, with the basket then suffering a -37% drawdown before CPI-peak data turned the tape. Today's Warsh hiking-bias is the Jackson Hole of the current cycle: if June CPI or the July jobs print surprises hot, the basket risks a deeper leg down; if data softens and the second hike is priced out, the May 2026 rally resumes and the basket re-rates sharply as the longest-duration asset in the market.","analog_zh":"与2022年8月10日触顶走势最为相似：当前行情（2026年6月从一次大型反弹顶部触底）与2022年8月10日高点引发杰克逊霍尔利率冲击腿的模式如出一辙——强劲缓解反弹触顶后遭遇美联储鹰派重新定价，篮子随后经历-37%回撤，直至CPI见顶数据扭转行情。当前Warsh加息倾向是本轮周期的杰克逊霍尔时刻：若6月CPI或7月就业数据意外偏热，篮子面临更深一跌的风险；若数据走软且第二次加息被定价排除，2026年5月反弹将重启，篮子作为市场中久期最长资产将大幅重估。","bottom_signals":["VIX spike >35 with defensives leading cyclicals by >10pp -- panic-driven indiscriminate selloff","TLT rallying >5% alongside basket selloff (yields falling as stocks drop = deflation fear bottom)","Growth vs value spread at -10 or worse (value winning hard = reflation/oil rotation peak hostility)","SaaS valuation multiples (EV/Revenue) compressing to near-SPY-level or below (as in mid-2026 when IGV P/E dipped below S&P 500)"],"bottom_signals_zh":["VIX飙升>35同时防御股领先周期股超10个百分点——恐慌驱动的无差别抛售","TLT在篮子抛售同期上涨>5%（股票下跌时收益率下行=通缩恐慌底部）","成长对价值利差达-10或更低（价值强势获胜=再通胀/石油轮动峰值敌意）","SaaS估值乘数（EV/营收）压缩至接近或低于S&P 500水平（如2026年中IGV市盈率跌破标普500）"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["discount-rate cycle (falling yields re-rate, rising yields de-rate)","enterprise IT budget cycle","AI disruption / cannibalization overhang post-2025","risk-on/off growth vs defensive rotation","dollar strength headwind for global SaaS multiples"],"drivers_zh":["贴现率周期（收益率下行重估，上行下杀）","企业IT预算周期","2025年后AI颠覆/蚕食阴影","风险偏好/回避成长对防御轮动","美元强势对全球SaaS估值的逆风"],"median_cycle_months":10,"summary":"Non-AI Software cycles structurally as the market's longest-duration asset: its primary causal engine is the discount-rate cycle. When rates fall (or are expected to fall), the present value of distant SaaS cash flows rises mechanically and multiples expand; when rates rise or plateau, the same mechanism compresses multiples faster than nearly any other sector. Within that framework, three additional forces modulate amplitude: (1) enterprise software-budget cycles (IT spend accelerates in expansion, tightens in slowdown -- acting as a fundamental layer atop the rate signal); (2) the AI disruption overhang (post-2025, AI-capex cannibalization competes with and partially overrides the rate mechanism, widening the non-AI vs AI divergence); and (3) sector-rotation dynamics where in risk-off/stagflation regimes capital flees into defensives or real assets, while in risk-on/growth-up regimes narrowing breadth amplifies software's outperformance relative to SPY.","summary_zh":"非AI软件在结构上以市场中久期最长的资产身份循环波动：其核心驱动引擎是贴现率周期。当利率下行（或预期下行）时，遥远的SaaS现金流现值机械性上升，估值乘数扩张；当利率上升或高位持续时，同样的机制以几乎比其他任何板块都更快的速度压缩估值。在此框架内，另有三股力量调节振幅：(1) 企业软件预算周期（IT支出在扩张期加速，在放缓期收紧，作为叠加在利率信号之上的基本面层）；(2) AI颠覆阴影（2025年后，AI资本开支蚕食效应与利率机制竞争并部分凌驾其上，拉大非AI与AI的分化）；(3) 板块轮动动态——在避险/滞胀行情中资金撤往防御股或实物资产，而在风险偏好/增长向上行情中，偏窄的市场广度放大了软件相对于SPY的超额收益。","top_signals":["VIX compression with breadth narrowing (RSP lags SPY) -- narrow mega-cap melt-up historically marks soft peaks","Growth-vs-value spread hitting extremes (>40 in 2021, >57 in 2016-2020 cycle) with TLT falling alongside","SaaS valuation multiples (EV/Revenue) at prior-peak levels (18x in 2021, 6x in 2015)","Post-crisis relief rally exhaustion: basket outperforms SPY by >30pp in <6 months"],"top_signals_zh":["VIX压缩同时市场广度收窄（RSP跑输SPY）——偏窄大盘飙升历史上标志软顶","成长对价值利差触极值（2021年>40，2016-2020周期>57），同时TLT下行","SaaS估值乘数（EV/营收）触及前期峰值水平（2021年18x，2015年6x）","危机后缓解反弹枯竭：篮子在不到6个月内跑赢SPY超30个百分点"]},"b-non_ai_tech":{"analog":"Closest to the Oct-2018 peak/trough setup: in both cases the basket had just completed a multi-year melt-up driven by cheap money combined with a hardware demand cycle (Trump tax-cut capex cycle 2016-2018 versus AI capex spillover 2025-2026), with a strengthening dollar, a Fed rate overhang (Oct-2018 Powell hawkish shock versus June-2026 Fed on hold at 3.5-3.75%), and semiconductor inventory warnings beginning to surface. The structural difference is that the current top is accompanied by growth already underperforming value by -15.2%, which in Oct-2018 only confirmed mid-selloff rather than at the pre-selloff top, suggesting the current topping process is further along. The July-2024 peak is a partial analog for the breadth-broadening and carry-unwind dynamic, but Oct-2018 better captures the rate, dollar, and inventory triple headwind that now faces the basket.","analog_zh":"最接近2018年10月见顶/触底格局：两个时期该篮子均刚完成由廉价货币结合硬件需求周期驱动的多年飙升（2016至2018年特朗普减税资本开支周期对比2025至2026年AI资本开支外溢），叠加美元走强、美联储利率高悬（2018年10月鲍威尔鹰派冲击对比2026年6月美联储按兵不动于3.5至3.75%），以及半导体库存预警开始浮现。结构性差异在于：当前顶部已伴随成长跑输价值-15.2%，而2018年10月这一现象仅在跌势中途才得到确认而非跌前顶部，暗示当前顶部形成进程更为靠后。2024年7月高点也是广度扩散和套息平仓动态的参照，但2018年10月更能捕捉目前该篮子面临的利率、美元、库存三重逆风。","bottom_signals":["VIX capitulation spike to 36 or above followed by mean-reversion with cyclicals re-leading defensives","Commodity and oil trough — rising oil and copper-gold confirming a reflation/growth-up quad re-entry","Fed pivot catalyst — explicit pause signal or first rate cut — coinciding with inventory destocking completion","Semis (SMH) diverging to the upside versus the basket after a prolonged synchronized selloff, as semis historically bottom first"],"bottom_signals_zh":["VIX恐慌性飙升至36以上后均值回归，周期板块重新领涨防御板块","大宗商品/油价触底——油价和铜金比上涨确认再通胀/增长向上象限重入","美联储转向催化剂——明确暂停信号或首次降息——与库存去化完成同时出现","在长期同步下跌后半导体（SMH）相对篮子率先向上偏离，因为半导体历史上总是先于篮子见底"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["Fed rate cycle — cuts/hikes directly move multiples via real-rate channel","Semiconductor capex/inventory cycle — demand super-cycles vs glut corrections","Dollar direction — multinational revenue headwind/tailwind","Global growth and China demand — hardware end-market cyclicality","Macro risk regime and VIX — high-beta amplification of risk-on/risk-off rotations","AI capex spillover — secondary indirect driver in 2022-2026 regime"],"drivers_zh":["美联储利率周期——降息/加息通过实际利率渠道直接影响估值倍数","半导体资本开支/库存周期——需求超级周期对库存积压调整","美元方向——跨国收入逆风/顺风","全球增长与中国需求——硬件终端市场周期性","宏观风险环境与VIX——风险偏好/避险轮动的高贝塔放大器","AI资本开支外溢——2022至2026年体制下的次级间接驱动力"],"median_cycle_months":19,"summary":"Non-AI Tech and Hardware cycles are structurally driven by the intersection of Fed rate policy, the semiconductor capex/inventory cycle, and macro-risk regimes. The basket rallies explosively when monetary easing or even its expectation coincides with a new hardware demand driver — whether a 5G cycle, a PC refresh, or an AI capex spillover — and it sells off sharply in rate-shock or demand-destruction episodes because its high beta versus SPY amplifies both the multiple compression from rising real rates and the earnings destruction from inventory corrections. The dollar is a persistent secondary lever: a weak dollar is a tailwind for these multinational hardware and networking names, while a strong dollar is a headwind. Within the GICS tech sector landscape, the basket acts as a leveraged proxy for XLK but consistently underperforms the AI-levered pure plays during true AI-capex regimes because it lacks direct AI chip exposure, and it holds up better during pure flight-to-safety selloffs than the highest-beta AI semis.","summary_zh":"非AI科技与硬件的周期结构上受美联储利率政策、半导体资本开支/库存周期与宏观风险环境的共同驱动。当宽松货币或其预期与新的硬件需求驱动力同时出现时——无论是5G周期、PC换代还是AI资本开支外溢——该篮子爆发式上涨；在利率冲击或需求破坏期间，由于其相对SPY的高贝塔同时放大了实际利率上升引发的估值压缩和库存调整带来的盈利破坏，篮子急剧下跌。美元是持续的二级杠杆：弱美元是这些跨国硬件和网络名字的顺风，强美元是逆风。在GICS科技板块格局中，该篮子充当XLK的杠杆代理，但在真正的AI资本开支行情中持续跑输AI杠杆纯玩家（因为缺乏直接AI芯片敞口），而在纯避险抛售中比最高贝塔的AI半导体更具抗跌性。","top_signals":["Dollar strengthening into the peak after a sustained rally (DXY plus 3% or more, headwind for multinationals)","Growth massively underperforming value — growth-value spread turning sharply negative after an extended growth run","Breadth broadening — RSP outperforming SPY — after a narrow mega-cap-led tape, signaling late-cycle rotation","Fed hawkish surprise or rate hike resumption meeting a semiconductor inventory correction or forward demand warning"],"top_signals_zh":["持续上涨后美元走强见顶（DXY涨+3%以上，为跨国公司逆风）","成长大幅跑输价值——在长期成长领涨后成长-价值利差急剧转负","广度扩散——RSP跑赢SPY——在窄幅大盘股主导行情之后，显示周期晚期轮动","美联储鹰派意外或加息重启遭遇半导体库存调整或远期需求预警"]},"b-nuclear_power":{"analog":"Closest to the November 2016 trough (leg start 2016-11-02): same structural setup — a washout low following a -25% yield-unwind selloff, with a fresh policy legitimacy catalyst (Trump 1.0 nuclear narrative + Illinois ZEC then; Trump 2.0 May-2025 nuclear executive orders + contractually-locked AI-baseload PPAs now), uranium in a supply-discipline tightening phase, and the broad macro in a reflation/growth-up quad with cyclicals leading. The 2016 trough preceded a +153% two-year run; the current prime-entry setup has a comparable — arguably stronger — demand-side anchor (hyperscaler PPAs are now contractually locked vs merely promised in 2016), suggesting the recovery magnitude could be at least comparable, though the speculative froth already witnessed in 2024-2025 means the path will be more volatile.","analog_zh":"与2016年11月低点（腿起始日2016-11-02）最为相近：同样的结构性形态——经历-25%股息代理平仓抛售后的超跌低点，叠加新的政策合法性催化剂（彼时为特朗普1.0核电叙事+伊利诺伊州ZEC，当前为特朗普2.0于2025年5月的核能行政令+已合同锁定的AI基荷购电协议），铀处于供应纪律收紧阶段，宏观大象限为再通胀/增长向上、周期股领涨。2016年那次低点之后带来+153%的两年大涨；当前优选入场形态有着堪比、甚至更强的需求侧锚定（超大厂商购电协议已合同锁定，而非2016年时仅为承诺），暗示复苏幅度可能至少相当，但2024-2025年已经历的投机泡沫意味着路径将更加波动。","bottom_signals":["VIX spike above 35 + basket down >30% from peak with defensives leading the broad tape","Uranium spot price below $25/lb (near marginal cost of most producers)","Policy/regulatory setback (plant closure announcement, permitting freeze) with no offsetting catalyst","Equal-weight breadth strongly beats cap-weight (+4%+) while basket lags — broadening rotation draining speculative flows"],"bottom_signals_zh":["VIX飙升超35 + 篮子从高点下跌超30%，大盘由防御板块领涨","铀现货价跌至25美元/磅以下（接近大多数生产商边际成本）","政策/监管挫折（核电厂关闭公告、许可证冻结）且无对冲催化剂","等权广度强势跑赢市值权（+4%以上），篮子跑输——广度扩散耗尽投机性资金流"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["Uranium commodity price cycle (Kazatomprom/Cameco supply decisions, Sprott financial buying)","Policy legitimacy waves (state ZECs, IRA tax credits, executive orders)","AI/tech baseload power demand narrative","Risk appetite cycle (amplifies SPY 2-4x as high-beta proxy)","Rate environment (utilities as bond-proxy; SMR developers as long-duration growth)"],"drivers_zh":["铀大宗商品价格周期（哈萨克斯坦原子能/Cameco供应决策、Sprott金融买盘）","政策合法性浪潮（州级零排放信用、IRA税收抵免、行政令）","AI/科技基荷电力需求叙事","风险偏好周期（作为高贝塔代理放大SPY 2-4倍）","利率环境（公用事业为债券代理；SMR开发商为长久期成长股）"],"median_cycle_months":7,"summary":"Nuclear & SMR Power is an extreme-beta, narrative-regime basket whose cycles are driven by the interplay of three recurring engines: (1) uranium commodity price cycles (supply gluts vs squeezes driven by Kazatomprom/Cameco production decisions, geopolitical disruption, and financial buyers like Sprott); (2) policy legitimacy waves — each major nuclear re-rate has been triggered by a new government imprimatur (Illinois ZEC 2016, Biden IRA 45U 2022, Trump nuclear EOs May 2025) that shifts the existential risk premium; and (3) adjacent technology demand — currently AI data center baseload, historically industrial/utility electrification. The group amplifies broad market risk-on/off cycles with a beta of roughly 2-4x SPY, peaking when speculative narratives peak and troughing in full risk-off capitulations. Sector context: the basket most strongly correlates with Energy (oil/commodity cycles) and Technology (risk appetite / AI capex) while being anti-correlated with the rate environment (a rate-sensitive duration trade for utility operators, and a long-duration growth bet for SMR developers).","summary_zh":"核电与SMR是一个极端高贝塔、叙事象限驱动的篮子，其周期由三大循环引擎交织驱动：（1）铀大宗商品价格周期（由哈萨克斯坦原子能/Cameco生产决策、地缘政治扰动及Sprott等金融买家推动的供给过剩与挤压）；（2）政策合法性浪潮——每轮重大核电重估均由新政府背书触发（2016年伊利诺伊州ZEC、2022年拜登IRA 45U、2025年5月特朗普核能行政令），从根本上改变存亡风险溢价；（3）相邻技术需求——当前为AI数据中心基荷，历史上为工业/公用事业电气化。该组别以约2-4倍SPY贝塔放大广泛市场的风险偏好/规避周期，在投机叙事顶点见顶，在彻底的避险投降中见底。板块维度：该篮子与能源（油价/大宗商品周期）和科技（风险偏好/AI资本开支）最强正相关，与利率环境负相关（对公用事业运营商而言为利率敏感型久期交易，对SMR开发商而言为长久期成长股）。","top_signals":["Semis (SMH) diverge/stall while basket keeps surging — leadership narrowing into a final blow-off","VIX below 14 + basket up >100% in 12 months + equal-weight breadth lagging cap-weight by >10%","Uranium spot price spike >50% YoY with financing/SPAC activity surging in pre-revenue developers","Major hyperscaler nuclear PPAs fully priced in with no incremental deal flow"],"top_signals_zh":["半导体（SMH）背离/滞涨而篮子持续冲高——领涨面收窄进入最终喷发","VIX低于14 + 篮子12个月内涨幅超100% + 等权广度落后市值权超10%","铀现货价年比涨幅超50%，尚无营收开发商融资/SPAC活动激增","主要超大厂商核电购电协议完全定价，无增量协议流"]},"b-obesity_glp1":{"analog":"Closest analog to the current setup is the Nov-2016 to Sep-2018 leg (+121.9%): same post-shock V-bounce recovery (then post-election reflation, now post-tariff), same risk-on regime with tech/semis leading and growth crushing value, and both legs featured a major pipeline catalyst (Ozempic Dec-2017 then, oral Wegovy/orforglipron now) arriving mid-leg to extend the move. The key difference is the 2025-26 leg is competing in a broader-breadth tape (RSP beat SPY +2.9% now vs RSP lagged -6.3% then), which historically caps the concentration premium that made the 2016-2018 run so violent. The analog suggests the current leg is in mid-cycle, not late-cycle, but the pricing reset risk — absent in 2016-2018 — is the structural modifier that could compress the upside versus the prior analog.","analog_zh":"与当前最接近的历史类比是2016年11月至2018年9月的行情（+121.9%）：同为冲击后V型反弹复苏（当时是大选后再通胀，现在是关税后），同为科技/半导体领涨、成长碾压价值的风险偏好环境，两段行情均在中途出现重大管线催化剂（当时是2017年12月Ozempic，现在是口服Wegovy/orforglipron）延续涨势。关键区别在于2025-26年的行情处于更广泛的市场参与度背景（RSP跑赢SPY +2.9%，而彼时落后-6.3%），历史上这会限制使2016-2018年行情如此猛烈的资金集中溢价。该类比表明当前行情处于中期而非后期，但2016-2018年时不存在的定价重置风险是可能压缩相对于历史类比上行空间的结构性修正因素。","bottom_signals":["Major FDA approval or clinical data readout while basket is down 20%+ from peak (Mounjaro May-2022, Zepbound Nov-2023)","Broad market capitulation (VIX 30+) completing a macro-driven flush with no thesis-specific damage","Rate/policy pivot (Fed ease or hawkish retreat) restoring long-duration growth multiples","Pipeline re-set clearing the bar: next-gen data prints above prior efficacy benchmarks after a miss"],"bottom_signals_zh":["重大FDA批准或临床数据读出，而篮子距峰值已跌20%以上（2022年5月Mounjaro、2023年11月Zepbound）","宏观驱动冲洗完成的广义市场投降（VIX 30+），无论点特定损害","利率/政策转向（美联储放松或鹰派退却）恢复长久期成长倍数","管线重置后重新超越此前疗效基准的下一代数据，清空预期"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["High-beta growth amplifier: magnifies SPY risk-on/risk-off swings vs XLV","FDA label milestones: each approval expands TAM and justifies multiple re-rating","Macro rate/dollar regime: long-duration profile punished in rate-shock selloffs","Pipeline data cadence: clinical readouts act as recurring positive and negative catalysts","Pricing/policy risk: drug-pricing political events (Clinton 2015, MFN 2024-25) compress multiples","Supply-demand dynamic: manufacturing shortages and demand-volume ramps drive earnings beats/misses"],"drivers_zh":["高贝塔成长放大器：放大SPY风险偏好/风险规避波动幅度，强于XLV","FDA标签里程碑：每次批准扩大潜在市场并支持倍数重估","宏观利率/美元环境：长久期特征在利率冲击抛售中受罚","管线数据节奏：临床读出作为周期性正面和负面催化剂","定价/政策风险：药价政治事件（2015年克林顿、2024-25年MFN）压缩倍数","供需动态：制造业短缺与需求-销量爬坡驱动盈利超预期/不及预期"],"median_cycle_months":17.7,"summary":"GLP-1 & Obesity cycles on two interlocking engines: (1) a macro/risk-appetite driver — as a high-beta, high-multiple secular growth stock cluster, the basket amplifies SPY and the growth-vs-value spread in both directions, outrunning tech-led melt-ups and underperforming defensively in rate-shock selloffs more than XLV; and (2) a recurring pipeline-catalyst ratchet — the basket has a history of explosive re-rating legs tied to specific FDA approvals and clinical data readouts (Saxenda Dec-2014, Ozempic Dec-2017, Wegovy Jun-2021, Mounjaro May-2022, Zepbound Nov-2023, oral Wegovy Dec-2025), each one expanding the addressable market and justifying a higher earnings multiple. The structural tension is that each new label milestone raises expectations for the next, making the basket uniquely vulnerable to pipeline disappointments (CagriSema Dec-2024) at valuations that can only be sustained by perpetual outperformance on efficacy and market size.","summary_zh":"GLP-1与减肥药的周期由两台相互咬合的引擎驱动：（1）宏观/风险偏好引擎——作为高贝塔、高倍数长期成长股集群，篮子在两个方向上都放大SPY和成长-价值利差，在科技主导的融涨中跑赢大盘，在利率冲击抛售中比XLV更脆弱；（2）循环管线催化剂棘轮——该篮子有着与特定FDA批准和临床数据读出相关的爆发性重估行情历史（2014年12月Saxenda、2017年12月Ozempic、2021年6月Wegovy、2022年5月Mounjaro、2023年11月Zepbound、2025年12月口服Wegovy），每次都扩大了可及市场并支持更高的盈利倍数。结构性张力在于每一个新标签里程碑都提升了对下一个的预期，使篮子在只能靠疗效和市场规模持续超预期才能维持的估值下，对管线失利（2024年12月CagriSema）极其脆弱。","top_signals":["Blow-off valuation (forward P/E 50x+) after a major label approval with VIX compressed and growth-value spread extended","Pipeline disappointment at peak expectations: next-gen trial misses own consensus targets (e.g., CagriSema Dec-2024)","Rate/dollar regime shift: Fed hawkish pivot + DXY surge compress long-duration multiples at high valuations","Political drug-pricing catalyst at premium valuation: Clinton-style tweet or MFN executive action at peak"],"top_signals_zh":["重大标签批准后泡沫式估值（前瞻市盈率50倍以上），VIX低位压缩且成长-价值利差拉伸","峰值预期下管线失利：下一代试验未达自身共识目标（如2024年12月CagriSema）","利率/美元环境转变：美联储鹰派转向+DXY飙升在高估值时压缩长久期倍数","高估值时的政治药价催化剂：克林顿式推文或MFN行政命令在峰值时触发"]},"b-payments_fintech":{"analog":"Closest to the Nov-2022 post-rate-peak trough (Nov-9, 2022): the same stagflation-then-cease setup where a violent commodity/rate shock drove a prolonged Financials-specific drawdown, the basket washed to the pos ~15-20 range, and the turn came only when the rate catalyst visibly broke (Oct-2022 CPI miss; now the Hormuz ceasefire). In both cases the recovery was front-loaded by the toll-road V/MA core before the high-beta tail followed, and the first bounce underperformed SPY slightly, with institutional rotation confirming only in the second leg. If the ceasefire holds and oil stays contained with the Fed on hold, the current setup could replicate the Nov-2022 to Feb-2023 +32% first recovery leg.","analog_zh":"与2022年11月加息周期后低点（2022年11月9日）最为相似：同样是猛烈的大宗商品/利率冲击驱动长时间金融特定回撤、篮子洗盘至位置约15-20区间、转折点仅在利率催化剂明显破位后出现（2022年10月CPI意外低于预期；当前为霍尔木兹停火）。两种情况下复苏均由过路收费V/MA核心先行，高贝塔尾部随后跟进，首次反弹略落后于SPY，机构轮动在第二波行情中才得到确认。若停火持续、油价受控且美联储按兵不动，当前布局有望复制2022年11月至2023年2月+32%的首段复苏行情。","bottom_signals":["VIX spike above 30 concurrent with Financials sector lagging SPY by -10% or more in the leg","High-beta fintech (-40%+ drawdown) with basket position below 20 and breadth broadening into a washout (RSP beating SPY)","TLT stabilizing or rallying (10Y peak/plateau) after a violent rate-shock leg","Catalyst resolution: oil-price reversal, Fed pivot signal, or idiosyncratic crisis resolution (SVB/First Republic, ceasefire, tariff truce)"],"bottom_signals_zh":["VIX飙升超过30且金融板块在该段落后SPY -10%或以上","高贝塔金融科技（-40%以上回撤），篮子位置低于20且广度在洗盘中扩散（RSP跑赢SPY）","在猛烈利率冲击段后TLT企稳或反弹（10年期见顶/平台期）","催化剂解除：油价逆转、美联储转向信号或个体化危机解除（SVB/第一共和、停火、关税休战）"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["Fed rate/discount-rate regime: the single most powerful driver — every hike cycle crushes the high-duration tail; every pivot ignites it","Consumer spend volume: transaction throughput for V/MA/PayPal is directly tied to employment, real wages, and ecommerce penetration","Ecommerce secular penetration: digital share of retail rose structurally over the period, lifting V/MA volumes","Risk-on/off regime (VIX, growth-value spread, semis): high-beta basket amplifies SPY 1.5-2.5x; semis lead the basket in both directions","Regulatory/deregulation cycle: TCJA 2017, SVB scare, and Nov-2024 election deregulation all created identifiable step-changes in basket re-rating","Oil/commodity shock: indirectly crushes via consumer squeeze + inflation/Fed hawkishness (2022, 2025-26 oil-shock legs)"],"drivers_zh":["美联储利率/贴现率环境：最强单一驱动——每次加息周期摧毁高久期尾部；每次转向点燃它","消费支出量：V/MA/PayPal的交易量通量直接与就业、实际工资和电商渗透率挂钩","电商长期渗透：数字零售份额在此期间结构性上升，提升V/MA交易量","风险偏好/厌恶环境（VIX、成长-价值利差、半导体）：高贝塔篮子双向放大SPY 1.5-2.5倍；半导体在两个方向上均领先篮子","监管/放松监管周期：2017年TCJA、SVB恐慌、2024年11月大选放松监管均产生可识别的篮子重估阶跃变化","油价/大宗商品冲击：间接通过消费挤压+通胀/美联储鹰派（2022年、2025-26年油价冲击段）打压篮子"],"median_cycle_months":6.4,"summary":"Payments & Fintech cycles on two interlocking engines: (1) the macro rate/discount-rate regime, which re-prices the long-duration, growth-priced half of the basket (PayPal, Block, Affirm, BNPL) — every rate-shock leg produces outsized -20% to -45% drawdowns and every pivot/cut leg produces outsized +30% to +140% surges; and (2) the secular volume throughput of the toll-road core (Visa, Mastercard), which compounds steadily on ecommerce/cross-border spend and only stalls in genuine recession or travel-collapse (COVID, tariff-consumer-squeeze). Bull legs are reliably ignited by the combination of a falling-rate/pivot signal + tech-semis risk-on melt-up + resilient consumer. Bear legs are triggered by rate-shock (10Y ripping, TLT falling hard), growth scares (recession odds rising, VIX spiking), or idiosyncratic sector de-risk (SVB, Financials panic). The basket systematically amplifies SPY moves by 1.5-2.5x in both directions, making it one of the highest-beta proxies in the Financials universe.","summary_zh":"支付与金融科技在两个相互锁定的引擎上循环：（1）宏观利率/贴现率环境，对篮子中长久期、成长定价的半段（PayPal、Block、Affirm、BNPL）重新定价——每次利率冲击都产生-20%至-45%的超额回撤，每次转向/降息都产生+30%至+140%的超额上涨；（2）过路收费核心（Visa、Mastercard）的长期交易量通量，靠电商/跨境消费稳定复利，只在真正衰退或旅行崩塌（新冠、关税消费挤压）时停滞。牛市行情可靠地由利率下行/转向信号+科技/半导体风险偏好融涨+坚韧消费者三重组合点燃。熊市行情由利率冲击（10Y飙升、TLT大跌）、增长恐慌（衰退概率上升、VIX飙升）或个体化板块去风险（SVB、金融恐慌）触发。篮子双向系统性放大SPY波动1.5-2.5倍，是金融板块系中贝塔最高的代理之一。","top_signals":["10Y yield surging AND TLT falling hard (-10% or more in the leg) — the most reliable peak precursor","VIX compressed below 15 with growth-value spread extended beyond +20 points — euphoria/duration-bubble sign","High-beta fintech disruptors (PYPL, SQ, AFRM) at extreme multiples concurrent with weak/negative free cash flow","Broad market breadth narrowing sharply (RSP lagging SPY by -6% or more) while basket surges — narrow leadership warning"],"top_signals_zh":["10年期收益率飙升且TLT大幅下跌（-10%或以上）——最可靠的见顶前兆","VIX压缩至15以下且成长-价值利差扩张超过+20点——欣快/久期泡沫信号","高贝塔金融科技颠覆者（PYPL、SQ、AFRM）在自由现金流疲弱/为负同时估值极端","大盘广度大幅收窄（RSP落后SPY -6%或以上）而篮子飙升——窄幅领涨警告"]},"b-power_grid":{"analog":"Closest analog to the current bottoming phase is the Jan-2016 trough: peak-rate-fear exhaustion after a deep prior drawdown (-31%), a commodity cycle beginning to reflate (oil off its lows), and a policy/demand narrative (Trump infra then; confirmed AI-load acceleration plus potential infrastructure renewal now) supplying the next re-rating catalyst. The 2016-2018 leg that followed ran +95% over ~32 months as OPEC's cut plus the Trump election catalyzed the reflation trade. Today's bottoming at pos=9 with intact multi-year backlogs and a reflation quad rhymes, with one key difference: the group enters at far higher absolute multiples after the 2022-2025 supercycle, so the re-rating magnitude is likely smaller even if the direction matches.","analog_zh":"与当前筑底阶段最接近的历史类比为2016年1月低点：在深度回撤（-31%）后的利率恐慌耗尽、大宗商品周期开始再通胀（油价从低点回升），以及提供下一轮重估催化剂的政策/需求叙事（当时为特朗普基建；现在为确认的AI负荷加速加潜在基础设施支出更新）。随后的2016-2018年行情腿在约32个月内涨幅+95%，以欧佩克减产加特朗普当选催化再通胀交易。当前在位置9筑底、多年期积压完整、再通胀象限相呼应，但有一关键区别：经历2022-2025年超级周期后，该组别以远高于历史水平的绝对估值入场，故即便方向相同，重估幅度也可能更小。","bottom_signals":["Fed dovish pivot or pause with rate expectations collapsing (Jan-2019, Oct-2022 style)","Oil/commodity cycle trough with OPEC supply cut or China restimulus confirming reflation","VIX capitulation spike (>36) followed by central-bank emergency intervention","Policy catalyst — major infrastructure/clean-energy legislation extending the capex runway"],"bottom_signals_zh":["美联储转鸽或暂停，利率预期大幅下修（2019年1月、2022年10月风格）","油价/大宗商品周期见底，欧佩克减产或中国再刺激确认再通胀","VIX投降性飙升（>36）后央行紧急干预","政策催化剂——重大基础设施/清洁能源立法延伸资本开支跑道"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["yield/rate regime — basket trades as long-duration bond proxy","commodity/oil cycle — reflation lifts E&C capex budgets and industrial customers","infrastructure legislation & policy mandates (IIJA, IRA, clean-energy standards)","disruptive demand shocks — AI datacenter load, EV electrification, aging-grid replacement","macro quad regime — reflation/growth-up is structural tailwind; deflation-scare is headwind","dollar cycle — weak dollar aids multinational industrial earnings; strong dollar headwind"],"drivers_zh":["收益率/利率机制——篮子作为长久期债券替代品交易","大宗商品/油价周期——再通胀提振工程承包资本开支预算与工业客户","基础设施立法与政策使命（IIJA、IRA、清洁能源标准）","颠覆性需求冲击——AI数据中心负荷、电动汽车电气化、老化电网更换","宏观象限机制——再通胀/增长向上为结构性顺风；通缩惊魂为逆风","美元周期——弱美元助益跨国工业盈利；强美元为逆风"],"median_cycle_months":22,"summary":"Power & Grid Buildout cycles on two overlapping engines: (1) a rate/yield sensitivity engine — the basket's utility-adjacent cash flows are discounted like long-duration bonds, so falling yields drive re-rating and rising yields drive de-rating independent of earnings; and (2) a capex-mandate engine tied to macro and policy cycles — commodity reflation (oil/copper recovery expanding E&C budgets), infrastructure legislation (IIJA, IRA), and disruptive demand shocks (AI datacenter load, electrification) drive multi-year secular rallies that can decouple from the rate cycle. Peaks coincide with peak-hawkish Fed policy, demand-doubt catalysts (DeepSeek, China slowdown), or dollar surges that crimp industrial earnings. Troughs form at maximum rate fear (Oct-2022, Dec-2018, Jan-2016) or acute risk-off events (Mar-2020) that exhaust sellers while the capex backlog accumulates. Major up-legs run 2-3 years, but counting all turns the median peak-to-peak interval is roughly 22 months, skewed shorter by the choppy 2025-26 range.","summary_zh":"电力与电网板块的周期依托两个交叠引擎：(1)利率/收益率敏感引擎——篮子中准公用事业现金流被当作长久期债券折现，收益率下行驱动重估上行、上行驱动下杀，独立于盈利；(2)宏观与政策周期驱动的资本开支使命引擎——大宗商品再通胀（油价/铜价回升扩大工程承包预算）、基础设施立法（IIJA、IRA）与破坏性需求冲击（AI数据中心负荷、电气化）推动多年期长期行情，可与利率周期脱钩。峰值往往与美联储鹰派见顶、需求疑虑催化剂（DeepSeek、中国放缓）或压缩工业盈利的美元激增吻合。低谷形成于最大利率恐慌（2022年10月、2018年12月、2016年1月）或急性避险事件（2020年3月）——此时卖方力竭而资本开支积压持续累积。主要上行腿持续2-3年，但计入所有转折，中位数峰-峰间隔约22个月，受2025-26年震荡区间拖累而偏短。","top_signals":["Peak-hawkish Fed pricing with back-to-back 75bp+ hikes and a flat/inverted yield curve","Dollar surge (>15% DXY, 2014-15 style) compressing industrial earnings and commodity demand","Demand-doubt catalyst (AI efficiency shock like DeepSeek, China slowdown) questioning the load-growth thesis","Extreme narrow breadth (equal-weight lagging cap-weight >25%) signaling fragile melt-up exhaustion"],"top_signals_zh":["美联储鹰派见顶定价：连续75bp以上加息叠加收益率曲线走平/倒挂","美元飙升（超15% DXY，2014-15式）压缩工业盈利与大宗商品需求","需求疑虑催化剂（DeepSeek式AI效率冲击、中国放缓）质疑负荷增长主线","极端窄广度（等权跑输市值权超25%）信号脆弱暴涨耗尽"]},"b-quantum_computing":{"analog":"Closest analog is the March 2023 ChatGPT-trough re-entry (Leg 3 start): the current setup rhymes with the early weeks of that leg — a washout trough resolved by an ignition headline (then genAI; now the May 2026 government funding), goldilocks/reflation quad, semis leading, and the basket carrying fresh government imprimatur rather than pure retail narrative. The key difference and risk: unlike the narrow mega-cap-led 2023-25 melt-up, breadth is now broadening (RSP beat SPY +2.9%), and the current move is a Leg 3 post-peak recovery rather than a fresh full cycle — so it could truncate faster if rates re-shock or a milestone disappointment (e.g., Majorana 1 replication failure, delayed commercialization timelines) triggers a repeat of an Oct-2025-scale correction.","analog_zh":"最近的类比是2023年3月ChatGPT低谷重新入场（第三腿起点）：当前格局与该腿初期高度相似——洗盘低谷由点火头条（彼时为生成式AI，现为2026年5月政府拨款）化解，金发姑娘/再通胀象限，半导体领涨，篮子携带新的政府背书而非纯粹散户叙事。关键区别与风险在于：与2023-25年狭窄大盘股主导的飙升不同，当前市场广度正在扩张（RSP跑赢SPY +2.9%），且此轮为第三腿峰值后的修复而非全新完整周期——若遭遇利率再冲击，或里程碑令人失望（如Majorana 1复现失败、商业化时间表延迟），可能比新周期更快截断，重演2025年10月规模的回调。","bottom_signals":["Final SPAC-era seller exits: last de-SPAC name delisted or restructured","TLT bottoming / real yields peaking and beginning to compress","New milestone headline after prolonged silence (AI adjacency reframe, error-correction breakthrough)","Basket holding above prior trough after a 50%+ drawdown with VIX compressing from elevated levels"],"bottom_signals_zh":["SPAC时代最后卖家离场：最后一只de-SPAC标的退市或重组","TLT见底/实际收益率见顶开始压缩","长期沉寂后新里程碑头条出现（AI邻接重构、纠错突破）","50%以上回撤后篮子守住前低、VIX从高位压缩"],"confidence":"low","drivers":["real interest rate regime (long-duration discount rate)","AI-adjacency narrative momentum and frontier-tech milestones","SPY/SMH risk-on beta amplification","SPAC/secondary supply cycles vs retail FOMO demand","government funding and policy mandates (CHIPS Act, DoD quantum programs)"],"drivers_zh":["实际利率环境（长久期贴现率）","AI邻接叙事动能与前沿科技里程碑","SPY/SMH风险偏好贝塔放大","SPAC/增发供给周期与散户FOMO需求","政府拨款与政策授权（芯片法案、国防部量子计划）"],"median_cycle_months":47,"summary":"Quantum computing is structurally a two-speed cycle machine: a long accumulation leg powered by falling yields, ZIRP-era duration multiples, and breakthrough milestone headlines (Google supremacy, IBM roadmaps, SPAC listings), followed by a violent truncation whenever the rate regime reverses and zero-revenue multiples reset. The recurring causal engine is threefold: (1) the real interest rate regime, which determines what discount rate the market applies to science-project earnings 15+ years away; (2) AI-adjacency narrative momentum, which converts frontier-tech milestones into retail FOMO flows regardless of near-term commercialization; and (3) the broader SPY/semis risk-on/risk-off cycle, which the basket amplifies violently given its extreme beta. Peaks arrive when speculative supply (SPAC listings, secondary offerings) saturates demand precisely as the rate or narrative catalyst exhausts; troughs form when the last forced seller exits and a new ignition headline appears.","summary_zh":"量子计算在结构上是一台双速循环机器：由利率下行、零利率时代久期溢价和突破性里程碑头条（谷歌量子霸权、IBM路线图、SPAC上市）驱动的漫长积累腿，在利率环境逆转、零营收估值重置之时遭遇猛烈截断。其反复出现的因果引擎由三部分构成：（1）实际利率环境，决定市场对15年以上科学项目收益所适用的贴现率；（2）AI邻接叙事动能，将前沿科技里程碑转化为散户FOMO资金流，与近期商业化进展无关；（3）更广泛的SPY/半导体风险偏好周期，鉴于其极端贝塔，篮子对此周期的放大幅度极为剧烈。顶部往往在投机性供给（SPAC上市、增发）在利率或叙事催化剂耗尽之际饱和需求时出现；底部则在最后一批被迫卖家离场且新点火头条出现时形成。","top_signals":["SPAC or secondary offering wave into elevated prices (new supply saturating momentum demand)","Rate-regime inflection: Fed pivoting hawkish / TLT rolling over sharply","Prominent milestone headline that draws peak retail volume (Google Willow-style event followed by parabolic final blow-off)","RS rank at top decile concurrent with VIX compression and narrow breadth (RSP lagging SPY by 30%+)"],"top_signals_zh":["SPAC或增发潮涌现于高位（新供给饱和动能需求）","利率环境拐点：美联储转鹰/TLT急速下跌","标志性里程碑头条吸引散户成交量达峰（谷歌Willow式事件后的抛物线末段出货）","RS排名顶十分位叠加VIX压缩与市场广度狭窄（RSP跑输SPY 30%以上）"]},"b-regional_banks":{"analog":"Closest to the mid-2022 to February-2023 pre-SVB setup: a +20% goldilocks relief rally from a trough that preceded a major idiosyncratic risk event. Today's Financials sector lag (-2.7%) in a reflation regime — despite the broad market and cyclicals doing well — rhymes with mid-2022's NIM sweet-spot relief bounce that was quietly stalked by balance-sheet risk. The 2026 CRE maturity wall plays the role of the 2022 unrealized bond losses: a latent liability not yet visible in earnings but capable of repricing the group sharply. Position 56 and RS rank 16 both echo the mid-cycle, participate-but-watch setup of that October-2022 to January-2023 window.","analog_zh":"与2022年中至2023年2月SVB危机前的设置最为相近：一波+20%的黄金时代宽慰反弹，发生在重大个体化风险事件之前。当前金融板块在再通胀行情中落后（-2.7%）——尽管大盘和周期股表现良好——与2022年中NIM甜蜜期宽慰反弹的节奏相似，当时资产负债表风险在悄然积聚。2026年商业地产到期墙扮演了2022年未实现债券损失的角色：一笔尚未反映在盈利中、但足以使整组迅速重新定价的潜在负债。仓位56和RS排名16均呼应了2022年10月至2023年1月窗口的中周期\"参与但观察\"态势。","bottom_signals":["VIX spike to 30+ coinciding with Financials as worst GICS sector (cyclical de-risk trough)","TLT rallying sharply while HYG-LQD collapses — flight-to-safety credit panic trough","Curve steep again post-Fed pivot + deposit stabilization confirmed in earnings","High-beta minus low-vol factor at -20% or worse — oversold cyclical washout"],"bottom_signals_zh":["VIX飙升至30+同时金融板块为最差GICS板块（周期去风险触底）","TLT急升同时HYG-LQD崩溃——避险信用恐慌触底","美联储转向后曲线重新趋陡+存款企稳在财报中得到确认","高贝塔减低波因子-20%或更低——超卖周期股洗盘"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["Yield curve slope — NIM expansion/compression is the primary P&L lever","Credit cycle: loan-loss provisions spike in recessions, devastate EPS","Regulatory/political cycle: deregulation re-rates, Dodd-Frank/Basel weigh","High-beta cyclical: amplifies growth/risk-off regime rotations vs SPY","Commercial real estate concentration: idiosyncratic credit bomb","Fed policy rate path: deposit cost lag creates both NIM sweet spots and traps"],"drivers_zh":["收益率曲线斜率——NIM扩张/压缩是主要损益杠杆","信用周期：贷款损失拨备在衰退中飙升，重创每股收益","监管/政治周期：放松监管重估，多德-弗兰克/巴塞尔压制","高贝塔周期股：放大增长/避险行情轮换相对SPY","商业地产集中敞口：个体化信用炸弹","美联储政策利率路径：存款成本滞后创造NIM甜蜜期和陷阱"],"median_cycle_months":19.1,"summary":"Regional banks (KRE) cycle on three interlocking structural gears: (1) the yield curve — banks borrow short and lend long, so every period of curve steepening powers a NIM-expansion bull run while inversion or flat-to-zero rates crush margins; (2) credit-cycle risk — as the highest-beta cyclical within Financials, KRE amplifies macro growth/recession swings through loan-loss provisioning and credit-line utilization, making it one of the most sensitive recession barometers in the GICS universe; and (3) the regulatory-political cycle — Trump 1.0 (2016-2018) and Trump 2.0 (2024-2026) both delivered deregulation/M&A tailwinds that structurally re-rated the group, while post-GFC Dodd-Frank and post-SVB BTFP/Basel III debates set the regulatory floor. The recurring pattern: deep selloffs happen when credit fears and/or flat/inverted yield curves converge; the sharpest rallies happen when a reflation/growth-up regime meets a steepening curve and pro-deregulation policy — a trifecta that fired in 2016-2018 and 2023-2024. Commercial real estate concentration and unhedged bond-duration risk are the perennial idiosyncratic hazards that can detonate independently of the macro cycle, as 2023 proved.","summary_zh":"区域银行（KRE）围绕三个相互联锁的结构性齿轮运转：（1）收益率曲线——银行借短贷长，曲线每次趋陡都驱动NIM扩张牛市，而倒挂或零利率则压垮利差；（2）信用周期风险——作为金融板块中贝塔最高的周期股，KRE通过贷款损失拨备和信用额度利用率放大宏观增长/衰退波动，是GICS体系中最敏感的衰退晴雨表之一；（3）监管-政治周期——特朗普1.0（2016-2018）和2.0（2024-2026）均带来放松监管/并购顺风，结构性重估整个组别，而大危机后多德-弗兰克及SVB危机后BTFP/巴塞尔III辩论设定了监管底线。周期性规律：信用恐惧和/或平坦/倒挂收益率曲线叠加时发生深度抛售；再通胀/增长向上行情叠加曲线趋陡及亲放松监管政策时出现最剧烈的反弹——这三重奏在2016-2018年和2023-2024年双双引爆。商业地产集中敞口及未对冲债券久期风险是可独立于宏观周期引爆的长期个体化隐患，2023年即为明证。","top_signals":["Yield curve inversion (2Y > 10Y) signals NIM compression ahead — historically precedes peaks","High-beta minus low-vol factor spread at cycle extremes (+60%+) marks exhaustion","CRE loan concentration + rising vacancy/cap-rate compression = latent credit peak signal","Regulatory peak optimism: Dodd-Frank/Basel rollback enacted, M&A wave already priced"],"top_signals_zh":["收益率曲线倒挂（2年期>10年期）预示NIM压缩在即——历史上先于峰值出现","高贝塔减低波因子利差在周期极端水平（+60%以上）标志耗竭","商业地产贷款集中+空置率上升/资本化率压缩=潜在信用峰值信号","监管乐观情绪顶点：多德-弗兰克/巴塞尔松绑落地，并购浪潮已被充分定价"]},"b-reshoring":{"analog":"Closest to the Oct-2014 to Jan-2016 peak-to-trough setup (Nov-2014 start, -27.6%): the basket is at a structurally elevated valuation following a +100% leg, the dollar is now strengthening (DXY +3.4%), and the macro leadership is beginning to narrow — just as it did in late 2014 when utilities beat cyclicals. The key difference is that today's setup has active policy underpinning (CHIPS/IRA still disbursing, AI capex at record levels) that was absent in 2014-16, making an equally deep and prolonged selloff less likely — but a 15-25% drawdown on a dollar-surge or growth-scare remains the historical precedent to watch.","analog_zh":"与2014年10月至2016年1月的峰值到谷值走势最为相近（2014年11月开始，-27.6%）：篮子在完成+100%的涨幅后估值结构性偏高，美元目前走强（DXY+3.4%），宏观领导力开始收窄——正如2014年底公用事业跑赢周期时的情形。关键区别在于，今天的格局有活跃的政策支撑（CHIPS/IRA仍在拨款，AI资本开支处于历史高位），而2014-16年不存在，因此同等深度和持续时间的抛售可能性较小——但在美元飙升或增长恐慌下15-25%的回撤仍是值得关注的历史先例。","bottom_signals":["Oil and copper trough with subsequent reversal: commodity capex orders recover, sector PMIs turn up","Dollar peaks and reverses: multinational earnings headwind removed, foreign-demand recovery priced in","VIX spikes to 25-35+ then collapses back below 20: capitulation complete, cyclical re-entry confirmed","New discrete policy catalyst: tariff reduction/deal, new infrastructure legislation, or Fed pivot announcement"],"bottom_signals_zh":["油价和铜价触底随后逆转：大宗商品资本开支订单复苏，行业PMI上升","美元见顶逆转：跨国企业盈利逆风消除，海外需求复苏被定价","VIX飙升至25-35+后骤降至20以下：投降完成，周期股再进入得到确认","新的离散政策催化剂：关税减免/协议、新基础设施立法或美联储转向公告"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["Global macro quad: reflation/growth-up regime (oil, copper, cyclicals leading) is the 'on' switch","Dollar cycle: DXY weakness amplifies rallies; DXY strength amplifies selloffs via multinational earnings headwind","Industrial/trade policy: CHIPS/IRA/IIJA, tariff regimes, Trump elections create step-change structural re-ratings","Commodity capex cycle: oil/copper drives energy-sector and broader industrial capex orders","Rate/credit cycle: rising yields and dollar tightening compress valuation multiples; Fed pivots ignite recovery"],"drivers_zh":["全球宏观象限：再通胀/增长上行象限（油价、铜价、周期领涨）是'启动'开关","美元周期：美元走弱通过跨国企业盈利放大反弹；美元走强放大抛售","工业/贸易政策：CHIPS/IRA/IIJA、关税体制、特朗普当选带来阶跃式结构性重新评级","大宗商品资本开支周期：油价/铜价驱动能源板块及更广泛工业资本支出订单","利率/信用周期：收益率上升和美元收紧压缩估值倍数；美联储转向点燃复苏"],"median_cycle_months":26,"summary":"Reshoring & Industrial Capex cycles on the intersection of three recurrent forces: (1) the global macro regime quad — it is a pure reflation/growth-up basket that surges when oil, copper, and cyclicals lead while defensives lag, and gets crushed in any flight-to-safety or stagflation episode; (2) the dollar cycle — a strong dollar consistently amplifies selloffs (industrial multinationals lose margin) while dollar weakness consistently amplifies rallies; and (3) policy catalysts — the basket is hypersensitive to discrete trade/industrial-policy events (Trump elections, tariff escalations, CHIPS/IRA legislation) that structurally reprice the capex investment cycle. Each major leg is explained almost entirely by changes in these three forces rather than company-specific fundamentals.","summary_zh":"回流与工业资本开支的周期取决于三股反复出现的力量的交汇：（1）全球宏观象限——该篮子是纯粹的再通胀/增长上行篮子，在油价、铜价和周期股领涨、防御滞后时飙升，在任何避险或类滞胀中遭受重创；（2）美元周期——美元走强始终放大抛售（工业跨国企业利润受损），美元走弱始终放大反弹；（3）政策催化剂——该篮子对离散的贸易/产业政策事件（特朗普当选、关税升级、CHIPS/IRA立法）极度敏感，这些事件从结构上重新定价资本开支投资周期。每个重大腿段几乎完全可以用这三种力量的变化来解释，而非公司特定基本面。","top_signals":["Quad flips from reflation to stagflation-ish or slowdown: defensives begin to outperform cyclicals","Dollar surges above 2-3% in short period (DXY +5%+): multinational earnings headwind hits the basket disproportionately","VIX spike from low base (sub-15) above 25: cyclical rotation out of industrials accelerates","Policy-catalyst exhaustion: major legislation (CHIPS, IRA) fully priced in, no new catalysts visible"],"top_signals_zh":["宏观象限从再通胀翻转为类滞胀或放缓：防御开始跑赢周期","美元短期飙升超过2-3%（DXY+5%以上）：跨国企业盈利逆风不成比例地冲击篮子","VIX从低基数（15以下）飙升超过25：工业股周期轮动加速","政策催化剂耗尽：重大立法（CHIPS、IRA）充分定价，无新催化剂可见"]},"b-retail":{"analog":"Closest to the May 2022 trough-entry setup: same reflation/cyclical-up tilt (oil up, dollar elevated), same tariff-overhang narrative creating margin uncertainty, and same consumer-resilience-beats-fear dynamic as the June 2022-April 2023 grind higher. The 2022 trough followed the Walmart/Target margin shock and inventory bloat; today's trough follows the 2025 Liberation Day tariff shock and the 2026 oil-CPI squeeze. In both cases the consumer held up better than feared and the basket recovered 40%+ once the macro headwind peaked. The key difference is that the current setup has broadening breadth (RSP beat SPY +2.9%) and a cleaner reflation quad, which was absent in mid-2022 (stagflation); this makes the analog more bullish for a sustained recovery.","analog_zh":"最接近2022年5月底部入场形态：相同的再通胀/周期上行倾向（油价上行、美元偏强），相同的关税悬念叙事制造利润率不确定性，以及相同的“消费者韧性好于预期”动态——如同2022年6月至2023年4月的艰难爬升。2022年底部紧随沃尔玛/塔吉特利润率冲击与库存膨胀；本次底部紧随2025年“解放日”关税冲击与2026年油价-CPI挤压。两种情形下消费者均比担忧更坚挺，一旦宏观逆风见顶，篮子均反弹逾40%。关键区别在于当前市场广度扩张（RSP跑赢SPY+2.9%）且象限更纯粹地处于再通胀，而2022年中为滞胀；这使当前类比对持续复苏更为看多。","bottom_signals":["VIX spike above 30 with retail down >20% and defensives outperforming cyclicals","Inventory-to-sales ratio declining (destocking complete) with freight rates falling","Fed pivot signal (pause or cut cycle beginning) restoring consumer credit conditions","Dollar DXY rolling over from multi-year high, easing import-cost pressure on goods retailers"],"bottom_signals_zh":["VIX飙破30、零售跌逾20%且防御跑赢周期","库销比下降（去库存完成）叠加运费下跌","美联储转向信号（暂停或开启降息周期）恢复消费信贷条件","美元DXY从多年高位回落，缓解商品零售商进口成本压力"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["Consumer employment-income flywheel (unemployment, real wages, confidence)","Rate-regime and dollar pass-through to retail multiples and import costs","Inventory-margin sine wave: systemic overshoot/undershoot cycle","Fiscal impulse and stimulus-driven goods spending surge","Tariff and trade-war cost-structure shock"],"drivers_zh":["消费者就业-收入飞轮（失业率、实际工资、信心）","利率制度与美元对零售估值和进口成本的传导","库存-利润率正弦波：系统性过剩/不足周期","财政脉冲与刺激驱动的商品消费激增","关税与贸易战成本结构冲击"],"median_cycle_months":17,"summary":"Retail is a leveraged proxy on the US consumer cycle, amplified by three recurring structural forces: (1) the employment-income flywheel — when unemployment falls and real wages rise, discretionary spend inflects sharply higher; (2) the rate-and-dollar squeeze — rising rates lift borrowing costs and compress high-multiple retail names, while a strong dollar raises landed import costs for goods-heavy merchants; and (3) the inventory-margin sine wave — retailers systematically overshoot inventory in upcycles (post-COVID 2021-22) and undershoot in downturns, creating violent margin inflections that precede major leg turns. Against the 11 GICS sectors, Retail moves in the same direction as Discretionary (XLY) and Financials and inversely to Utilities and Staples; it underperforms the SPY in risk-off regimes, over-earns in full-risk reflation quads, and is uniquely vulnerable to simultaneous rate-shock + tariff-import-cost squeezes (2022, 2024-25).","summary_zh":"零售是美国消费周期的杠杆代理，由三股反复出现的结构性力量放大：（1）就业-收入飞轮——失业率下降与实际工资上涨时，可选支出急剧拐升；（2）利率与美元挤压——加息抬高借贷成本、压缩高倍数零售估值，强美元则推高商品密集型商家的进口到岸成本；（3）库存-利润率正弦波——零售商在上行周期系统性地库存过剩（疫后2021-22年），在下行中库存不足，产生剧烈的利润率拐点，先于主要腿部拐点出现。对比11个GICS板块，零售与可选消费（XLY）、金融同向，与公用事业、必需消费反向；在避险环境中跑输SPY，在全力再通胀象限中超额，对利率冲击+关税进口成本双重挤压（2022年、2024-25年）的脆弱性尤为突出。","top_signals":["10-year Treasury yield at cycle high and turning (rate-peak signal compresses retail multiples)","Inventory-to-sales ratio at multi-year high and retailers issuing margin-warning guidance","Consumer confidence index diverging lower while SPY still elevated (sentiment lead)","VIX below 15 after a prolonged bull run with Discretionary outperforming SPY by >15%"],"top_signals_zh":["10年期美债收益率触周期高点并转向（利率峰值信号压缩零售估值）","库销比处多年高位且零售商发出利润率预警指引","消费者信心指数背离下行而SPY仍高企（情绪领先指标）","VIX低于15、持续牛市后可选消费跑赢SPY逾15%"]},"b-robotics_automation":{"analog":"Closest analog is the Jul-2023 peak (leg start 2023-07-31): same post-parabolic setup where the basket had just completed a massive AI-narrative-driven leg (+63% from the Oct-2022 low) and rolled over as the 10-year yield surged and the dollar firmed. Today's entry mirrors that peak — a massive prior bull leg (+90%), a broadening market that no longer rewards narrow-breadth semis leadership, a stronger dollar (DXY +3.4%), and growth lagging value (-15.2%). In 2023 the subsequent drawdown was -22%; if the analog holds, the current rolling-over phase risks a similar 15-25% correction before the next trough.","analog_zh":"最接近的类比是 2023 年 7 月见顶（腿段起点 2023-07-31）：同样是抛物线后的设置——篮子刚完成一段大规模 AI 叙事驱动的腿段（从 2022 年 10 月低点 +63%），随后在 10 年期收益率飙升、美元转强之际见顶回落。当前入场与该顶部如出一辙——前一牛市腿段巨大（+90%）、市场广度扩展不再奖励窄幅半导体领涨格局、美元走强（DXY +3.4%）、成长落后价值（-15.2%）。2023 年随后回撤 -22%；若类比成立，当前见顶回落阶段面临类似的 15-25% 回调风险后方能触底。","bottom_signals":["VIX spike to extreme levels (28+) accompanied by defensives sharply outperforming cyclicals — maximum fear = maximum exit","SMH suffering a -20%+ drawdown (semis lead the sector in and out of bottoms)","Dollar reversing from strength to weakness after a rate shock","Fed pivot language ('patient', 'flexible', 'considering cuts') or actual first cut after a tightening cycle"],"bottom_signals_zh":["VIX 飙至极端水平（28+），伴随防御性板块大幅跑赢周期——最大恐慌=最大出货","SMH 遭受 -20%+ 回撤（半导体引领板块进出底部）","美元在利率冲击后从强势反转走弱","美联储转向措辞（'耐心'、'灵活'、'考虑降息'）或紧缩周期后首次实际降息"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["Rate/duration sensitivity: long-duration growth multiples compress sharply when yields surge and expand when yields fall","Dollar sensitivity: globally sourced hardware supply chains (sensors, motors, chips from Asia) face direct headwinds from DXY strength","Semis/tech regime coupling: when SMH leads, the basket outperforms; when semis de-rate, the basket de-rates faster","Capex cycle lag: automation order books track industrial capex 6-12 months behind the rate/credit cycle","Thematic narrative premium: periodic re-ratings (early-AI 2022-23, physical-AI/humanoid 2023-26) add non-cyclical multiple lift"],"drivers_zh":["利率/久期敏感性：收益率飙升时长久期成长倍数急剧压缩，下行时扩张","美元敏感性：全球化硬件供应链（亚洲传感器、电机、芯片）面临 DXY 走强的直接逆风","半导体/科技 regime 联动：半导体领涨时篮子跑赢；半导体去估值时篮子去得更快","资本开支周期滞后：自动化订单簿跟踪工业资本开支，较利率/信贷周期滞后 6-12 个月","主题叙事溢价：周期性重估（2022-23 年近 AI、2023-26 年实体 AI/人形机器人）添加非周期性倍数提振"],"median_cycle_months":11.5,"summary":"Robotics & Automation cycles as a high-beta industrial-tech amplifier of the macro regime — it has no independent cycle; it leverages the SPY cycle 1.5-2x in both directions. The recurring engine is: (1) a long-duration growth multiple that is rate-sensitive (rising yields = compression, falling yields = expansion); (2) a supply-chain-intensive hardware base that is tariff- and dollar-sensitive; (3) a thematic narrative layer (factory automation → near-AI → physical AI/humanoid) that provides intermittent multiple-expansion premiums above and beyond the macro beta; and (4) a capex-cycle dependency — automation orders track industrial capex, which lags the credit/rate cycle by 6-12 months. The series has beaten SPY cumulatively (+927% vs SPY over the period) by riding tech/semis leadership in bull regimes but gives back ground steeply in risk-off/rate-shock episodes because its valuation is priced on long-dated earnings.","summary_zh":"机器人与自动化作为宏观 regime 的高贝塔工业科技放大器循环运行——它没有独立周期，在两个方向以 1.5-2 倍放大标普 500 周期。循环引擎：（1）对利率敏感的长久期成长倍数（收益率上升=压缩，下行=扩张）；（2）对关税与美元敏感的供应链密集型硬件基础；（3）主题叙事层（工厂自动化→近 AI→实体 AI/人形机器人）在宏观贝塔之上提供间歇性估值溢价；（4）资本开支周期依赖——自动化订单跟踪工业资本开支，较信贷/利率周期滞后 6-12 个月。该系列通过在牛市 regime 中搭乘科技/半导体领涨累计跑赢标普（+927%），但在避险/利率冲击期间因估值定价于长期盈利而大幅回吐。","top_signals":["Semis (SMH) or growth-vs-value rolling over while basket is near all-time highs — divergence precedes peak by 4-8 weeks","Dollar strengthening (DXY trend reversal upward) after a prolonged weaker-dollar rally leg","VIX bottoming at historically low levels (sub-14) after a long low-vol melt-up, with the basket trading at 2+ standard deviations above its 200-day moving average","Fed shifting from dovish/neutral to hawkish signal — rate hike cycle initiation or end of 'patient' language"],"top_signals_zh":["半导体（SMH）或成长-价值开始回落，而篮子接近历史高位——背离往往提前见顶 4-8 周","美元走强（DXY 趋势反转上行），出现在一段持续弱美元反弹腿之后","VIX 在历史低位触底（低于 14），伴随长期低波动融涨，篮子交易于 200 日均线 2 个标准差以上","美联储从鸽派/中性转向鹰派信号——加息周期启动或'耐心'措辞结束"]},"b-semicap_equipment":{"analog":"Closest to the January 2022 peak: same late-cycle mega-cap-tech-led tape with deeply narrow breadth (RSP lagging SPY), a stronger dollar creating multinational headwind, a stretched high-beta spread, and WFE at historically extreme relative highs following a multi-year AI/capex supercycle. The January 2022 peak was also preceded by a +322% bull leg off a macro-shock trough (COVID), just as the current +424% leg launched off the April 2025 tariff-shock low — nearly identical setup anatomy. In 2022, the catalyst that broke the cycle was Fed rate normalization plus memory capex cuts plus China export controls. Today the analog risk is an eventual WFE order-book digestion (equipment delivery backlogs clearing), renewed export-control escalation, or any macro shock that re-prices growth multiples downward. The 2022 analog would imply a -40% peak-to-trough drawdown over 6-7 months from the current top.","analog_zh":"与2022年1月顶部最为相似：同样是周期末期大盘科技主导、市场广度极度收窄（RSP跑输SPY）、美元走强形成跨国公司逆风、高贝塔利差极度拉伸，且WFE处于历史极端相对高位，此前经历了多年AI/资本开支超级周期。2022年1月高点同样发生在从宏观冲击低点（新冠疫情）飙升+322%之后，与当前从2025年4月关税冲击低点飙升+424%如出一辙——结构解剖几乎完全相同。2022年打破周期的催化剂是美联储利率正常化叠加内存资本开支削减叠加中国出口管制。当前的类比风险在于WFE订单积压最终消化（设备交付积压清空）、出口管制升级重演，或任何重新向下压缩成长股估值的宏观冲击。以2022年类比推算，当前顶部或将迎来约-40%的峰谷回撤，历时6-7个月。","bottom_signals":["Memory maker capex cut announcements bottoming out / DRAM-NAND price trough confirmed by multiple suppliers","Fed policy pivot to easing or explicit patience (the Jan 4, 2019 Powell pause and Mar 2020 zero-rate cut as blueprints)","New device-architecture or AI-capex catalyst announced unlocking a structural WFE order cycle (3D NAND, FinFET, genAI)","High-beta extreme capitulation with VIX spike into 36-66 range marking prior three major troughs"],"bottom_signals_zh":["内存厂商资本开支削减公告触底/DRAM-NAND价格谷底获多家供应商确认","美联储政策转向宽松或明确观望（2019年1月4日鲍威尔暂停加息和2020年3月零利率为参照蓝本）","新设备架构或AI资本开支催化剂宣布开启结构性WFE订单周期（3D NAND、FinFET、生成式AI）","高贝塔极端恐慌抛售伴随VIX飙升至36-66区间标志前三次主要低点"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["Memory capex cycle (DRAM/NAND boom-bust governs ~40% of WFE spend)","Foundry/logic node transitions (FinFET, EUV, GAA) driving equipment intensity","AI and hyperscaler infrastructure capex waves (leading-edge + HBM demand)","Fed rate regime and growth/duration factor pricing (WFE = long-cycle high-multiple)","US-China export control policy (China = 30-50% of AMAT/LRCX/KLAC revenue)","Dollar direction (multinational revenue FX headwind/tailwind)"],"drivers_zh":["内存资本开支周期（DRAM/NAND繁荣-萧条主导约40%的WFE支出）","晶圆代工/逻辑节点转型（FinFET、EUV、GAA）驱动设备强度提升","AI和超大规模云厂商基础设施资本开支浪潮（先进制程+HBM需求）","美联储利率格局与成长/久期因子定价（WFE=长周期高估值）","美中出口管制政策（中国占AMAT/LRCX/KLAC收入30-50%）","美元方向（跨国公司收入外汇顺风/逆风）"],"median_cycle_months":22.8,"summary":"Semiconductor Equipment (WFE) is a pure-play cyclical amplifier of the global semiconductor capex cycle, which is itself governed by memory-maker investment decisions (DRAM/NAND boom-bust), foundry node transitions (FinFET, EUV, GAA), and hyperscaler AI infrastructure waves. Because WFE revenue lags chip demand by 6-18 months (equipment orders precede wafer output), the sector consistently overshoots in both directions relative to SPY and even SMH. The recurring structural pattern is: a macro regime shift (Fed pivot or risk-on rebound) coincides with a new device-architecture or AI-capex catalyst (3D NAND, FinFET, genAI), triggering a WFE order cycle that drives 100-300%+ rallies. Peaks arrive when the memory capex cycle tops, export-control risk materializes, or a macro rate shock deflates the high-multiple growth narrative. The 2022 US export controls added a persistent structural overhang — China revenue risk now amplifies both the selloff (tightening) and recovery (relief) legs.","summary_zh":"半导体设备（WFE）是全球半导体资本开支周期的纯周期放大器，该周期本身受内存厂商投资决策（DRAM/NAND繁荣-萧条）、晶圆代工节点转型（FinFET、EUV、GAA）以及超大规模云厂商AI基础设施浪潮所驱动。由于WFE收入滞后于芯片需求6-18个月（设备订单先于晶圆产出），该板块相对SPY乃至SMH在双向均会系统性超调。反复出现的结构性规律是：宏观格局转变（美联储转向或风险偏好反弹）与新设备架构或AI资本开支催化剂（3D NAND、FinFET、生成式AI）共振，触发WFE订单周期驱动100-300%+涨幅。当内存资本开支周期见顶、出口管制风险成真或宏观利率冲击压缩高估值成长叙事时，顶部出现。2022年美国出口管制新增持续性结构性隐患——中国收入风险如今放大了抛售腿（收紧）和复苏腿（缓解）的幅度。","top_signals":["Memory maker public capex guidance cuts from Samsung/SK Hynix/Micron (order deferrals precede stock peak by 1-2 quarters)","WFE stock-to-SPY relative strength at historical extremes with deepening breadth narrowing (RSP lagging SPY -20%+)","China export-control escalation announcements targeting WFE tools (AMAT/LRCX/KLAC direct revenue hit)","Fed tightening re-acceleration or hawkish pivot surprise compressing growth multiples (TLT selloff)"],"top_signals_zh":["三星/SK海力士/美光公开资本开支指引削减（订单递延领先股票见顶1-2个季度）","WFE相对SPY强度处于历史极值且市场广度持续收窄（RSP跑输SPY -20%以上）","针对WFE工具的对华出口管制升级公告（AMAT/LRCX/KLAC收入直接受损）","美联储再度收紧或鹰派政策转向意外压缩成长股估值（TLT抛售）"]},"b-space_economy":{"analog":"Closest analog to the Oct-2018 rate-shock-into-narrow-leadership selloff: the current setup (post-May-2026 peak, -42% in 4 weeks, milestone failure + capital siphon from a dominant competitor, stagflation-ish regime) most rhymes with the August-December 2022 leg. In Aug-Dec 2022, the basket fell -34% after a violent oversold bounce (just as the Oct-2025 to May-2026 run was 200%+), driven by a re-tightening macro signal (Jackson Hole) combined with a specific milestone reset — and then launched +83% in the January 2023 leg when the soft-landing re-risk arrived. The current position: the regime (reflation/growth-up, cyclicals leading, oil +19.2%) is actually more constructive than in Q4 2022 when defensives were leading, suggesting the -42% may be more milestone-specific than regime-driven — which means a violent recovery could arrive faster once Neutron qualification and the SpaceX IPO overhang digest.","analog_zh":"与2018年10月利率冲击叠加行情收窄领涨的回调最相近：当前格局（2026年5月峰值后、4周-42%、里程碑失败+强势竞争对手上市虹吸、类滞胀regime）最类似于2022年8月至12月的那段。彼时篮子在剧烈超卖反弹后（恰如2025年10月至2026年5月的200%+行情）跌-34%，由宏观再收紧信号（杰克逊霍尔）叠加特定里程碑重置驱动——随后在2023年1月软着陆再担风险时暴涨+83%。当前位置：Regime（再通胀/增长上行、周期领涨、油价+19.2%）实际上比2022年Q4防御领涨时更具建设性，表明-42%可能更多是里程碑特定因素而非regime驱动——一旦Neutron资格测试和SpaceX IPO消化完毕，剧烈复苏可能来得更快。","bottom_signals":["VIX spikes above 30 and high-beta (SPHB-SPLV) sells off sharply: risk-off flush incoming","TLT breaks down (yields surging): long-duration names lose their valuation support; monitor 10Y direction","A key milestone fails or slips (rocket test failure, launch delay, contract loss): binary single-name catalyst can lead the group 3-6 months before the macro turns","Breadth narrows sharply (RSP-SPY -5% or worse): space is the first to be cut when only mega-caps bid"],"bottom_signals_zh":["VIX飙升超过30且高贝塔（SPHB-SPLV）急剧抛售：避险冲刷来临","TLT破位下行（收益率飙升）：长久期个股失去估值支撑；监控10年期走势","关键里程碑失败或滑期（火箭测试失败、发射延期、合同落空）：二元单一个股催化剂可在宏观转向前3-6个月领跑板块","广度急剧收窄（RSP-SPY-5%或更差）：只有大市值获得买盘时太空首先被砍"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["Rate/yield cycle: falling rates turbocharge long-duration discounting; rate hikes are the primary structural bear","Risk-on/risk-off beta: 2-4x SPY amplification in both directions via SPHB-SPLV and growth-value spread","Tech/semis leadership: when SMH and growth lead, space benefits via shared speculative flow and duration","Milestone catalysts: launch cadence records, contract wins (SDA, NASA, defense), and test failures create binary single-name moves","Dollar cycle: weaker dollar removes a headwind for global-contract, internationally-traded names; stronger dollar caps them","Defense-space policy: Golden Dome, SDA proliferated architecture, and NDAA spending cycles are structural re-rating triggers"],"drivers_zh":["利率/收益率周期：收益率下行为长久期折现提速；加息是主要结构性熊市因素","风险偏好/避险贝塔：通过SPHB-SPLV和成长-价值利差双向放大SPY 2-4倍","科技/半导体领涨：当SMH和成长领涨时，太空通过共同的投机资金流和久期受益","里程碑催化剂：发射节奏记录、合同获取（SDA、NASA、国防）及测试失败造成二元单一个股走势","美元周期：美元走弱为全球合同、国际交易个股移除逆风；美元走强压制","国防航天政策：Golden Dome、SDA扩散架构及NDAA支出周期是结构性重估触发器"],"median_cycle_months":8,"summary":"Space Economy is structurally the highest-beta, longest-duration theme on the US equity board — a leveraged call option on the macro risk-on/risk-off cycle amplified by milestone-driven single-name catalysts. Its recurring engine is simple: it multiplies whatever the tape is doing (2-4x SPY in both directions), with long-duration discounting meaning it is acutely sensitive to the rate cycle (falling yields are rocket fuel; surging yields are napalm). On top of the macro beta, the sector trades on binary milestones (rocket landing, launch delay, contract win, failed test), which can cause 10-15% single-day moves that are decoupled from the broader regime. The 2016-2019 and 2023-2025 mega-cycles show that when falling yields, tech/semis risk-on, and real fundamental progress (launch cadence, defense-space contracts) align simultaneously, the basket can compound 300-400% in a single leg. Conversely, when rates rise, risk appetite collapses, or a key milestone slips, it gives back 35-45% in weeks. The sector rhymes with hypergrowth/innovation ETFs (ARKK, WCLD) more than it does with the GICS Industrials label it carries.","summary_zh":"太空经济在结构上是美国股市最高贝塔、最长久期的主题——宏观风险偏好周期的杠杆化看涨期权，由里程碑驱动的单一个股催化剂进一步放大。其循环引擎简单明确：以2-4倍SPY的幅度双向放大行情，长久期折现使其对利率周期极度敏感（收益率下行是火箭燃料，收益率飙升是汽油）。在宏观贝塔之上，该板块还以二元里程碑（火箭着陆、发射延期、合同获取、测试失败）交易，可造成10-15%单日波动且与整体regime脱钩。2016-2019年和2023-2025年的超级周期表明，当收益率下行、科技/半导体风险偏好、真实基本面进展（发射节奏、国防航天合同）同时对齐，篮子单段可复利300-400%。反之，当利率上升、风险偏好崩溃或关键里程碑滑期，它在数周内回吐35-45%。该板块与超成长/创新ETF（ARKK、WCLD）的共鸣远胜于其所挂靠的GICS工业标签。","top_signals":["VIX drops below 18 and stays there for 3+ weeks (risk appetite confirmed)","SMH breaks to new highs while TLT holds or rallies (falling rates + tech-led = ideal)","A major government contract win (SDA, NASA, DoD) for a basket anchor name","Growth-value spread turns positive and widens: SPHB-SPLV +5% or more in 30 days signals the cycle is re-engaging"],"top_signals_zh":["VIX跌破18并持续3周以上（风险偏好确认）","SMH创新高而TLT企稳或上涨（收益率下行+科技领涨=理想组合）","篮子核心个股赢得重大政府合同（SDA、NASA、国防部）","成长-价值利差转正并走阔：SPHB-SPLV在30天内+5%或更多，标志周期重新接合"]},"b-travel":{"analog":"Closest to the July 2023 peak (2023-07-18): the same late-cycle topping structure is rhyming — a 13-16 month rally off a major low carrying the basket to pos ~78, with oil and DXY both turning adverse simultaneously (in 2023 it was the 10-year to 5% plus DXY +6.6%; today it is the Hormuz oil shock +19.2% plus DXY +3.4%), while the broad tape remains constructive but Discretionary has already begun lagging within the risk-on regime. The 2023 analog resolved into a 26% selloff over the following 3 months as the 'higher for longer' narrative crystallized — today's analog suggests elevated caution as a similar cost-squeeze/consumer-squeeze dynamic builds, though the 2025 cycle's tariff-pause-driven demand recovery may be structurally stickier than the 2023 'end of revenge-travel' fear. (Note: the raw peak-to-peak median is dragged down to ~9 months by the 2020-22 COVID micro-cycles; the structural, non-pandemic cycle length is closer to 15-26 months.)","analog_zh":"与2023年7月峰值（2023-07-18）最为相似：同样的晚周期顶部结构正在重演——从重大低点持续约13-16个月的涨势将篮子推至约78的位置，同时油价与美元双双转为不利（2023年是10年期收益率破5%加上DXY+6.6%；当前是霍尔木兹油价冲击+19.2%加上DXY+3.4%），大盘整体仍具建设性但可选消费已在风险偏好体制内开始落后。2023年的类比在随后3个月内以26%的跌势收场，'更高更长'叙事固化——当前的类比暗示需保持高度警惕，类似的成本挤压/消费者挤压动态正在积聚，尽管2025年关税暂停驱动的需求复苏在结构上或比2023年'报复性旅游终结'担忧更具粘性。（注：原始峰间中位数因2020-22疫情微周期被拉低至约9个月；非疫情的结构性周期长度更接近15-26个月。）","bottom_signals":["VIX spike to 25+ combined with Discretionary as worst-performing GICS sector","Oil collapse (below -20% on leg) from a high base — removes the key cost headwind","Fed dovish pivot signal (pause or cut) within 3-6 months of a peak VIX reading","Pent-up booking data showing a surge in forward reservations post-crisis"],"bottom_signals_zh":["VIX飙升至25+同时可选消费为GICS最差板块","油价从高基数崩溃（单段跌幅超-20%）——消除关键成本逆风","美联储转向鸽派（VIX峰值后3-6个月内暂停或降息）","被压抑的预订数据显示危机后远期预订激增"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["Oil price direction (lower = cost tailwind for airlines; higher = dual demand + cost headwind)","Macro risk regime (VIX, SPHB-SPLV, cyclicals vs defensives, credit spreads)","Fed policy cycle (rate cuts expand consumer credit and corporate capex; hikes compress both)","USD direction (weaker DXY = international travel economics improve for US multinationals)","Demand-shock events (pandemics, travel bans, vaccine announcements)"],"drivers_zh":["油价走向（下跌=航空公司成本顺风；上涨=需求+成本双重逆风）","宏观风险体制（VIX、SPHB-SPLV、周期vs防御、信用利差）","美联储政策周期（降息扩大消费信贷与企业资本支出；加息双向收紧）","美元走向（美元弱势=美国跨国公司国际旅游经济改善）","需求冲击事件（疫情、旅行禁令、疫苗公告）"],"median_cycle_months":9.2,"summary":"Travel & Experiences is a pure high-beta consumer-cyclical basket (airlines, cruises, lodging, OTAs, gaming/entertainment) that amplifies the broad risk-on/risk-off regime by a factor of 2-4x SPY. Its structural cycle engine has two distinct gears: (1) a macro-regime gear where oil prices, the dollar, and the risk-appetite regime (VIX, SPHB-SPLV spread, cyclicals vs defensives) are the primary drivers — oil is uniquely bidirectional, a tailwind when falling (lower jet-fuel costs lift airline margins) but a compounding headwind when rising (consumer budget squeeze plus higher operating costs simultaneously); and (2) a virus/demand-shock gear that was dominant during 2020-2022 and which collapsed and restored the entire addressable market in weeks. Outside of pandemic shocks, the group peaks when cyclical breadth narrows, when oil/dollar turn adverse late in a growth cycle, and when rate-sensitive consumers face compressing real income. It troughs deepest during peak recession fear (VIX extremes, credit-spread blowouts) and recovers fastest when the macro regime snaps back to reflation and when specific demand catalysts (pent-up bookings, vaccine announcements) converge with broad cyclical leadership.","summary_zh":"旅行与体验是纯粹的高贝塔消费周期篮子（航空、邮轮、酒店、在线旅游平台、博彩/娱乐），以2-4倍SPY幅度放大整体风险偏好/避险体制。其结构性周期引擎有两个截然不同的档位：（1）宏观体制档——油价、美元和风险偏好体制（VIX、SPHB-SPLV利差、周期vs防御）是核心驱动力；油价具有独特的双向性，下跌是顺风（低燃油成本提升航空利润率），上涨则是复合逆风（同时挤压消费者预算与抬高运营成本）；（2）病毒/需求冲击档——在2020-2022年占主导地位，在数周内摧毁并重建了整个可寻址市场。在疫情冲击之外，该板块在周期股广度收窄、油价/美元在增长周期晚期转为不利、对利率敏感的消费者面临实际收入压缩时见顶。在衰退恐惧最深时（VIX极端值、信用利差爆破）跌幅最深，当宏观体制突然转向再通胀、且特定需求催化剂（被压抑的预订、疫苗公告）与周期股广泛领涨叠加时复苏最快。","top_signals":["Cyclicals narrow in leadership (Discretionary lags Tech/Financials within the same risk-on tape)","Oil and DXY both rising simultaneously for 6+ weeks — the dual margin/demand squeeze","Travel basket at pos >75 with RS rank slipping below top 10 vs all sectors","VIX at multi-year lows with the consumer increasingly strained by cumulative inflation"],"top_signals_zh":["周期股领涨收窄（可选消费在同一风险偏好环境下落后于科技/金融）","油价与美元同时上涨超过6周——利润率/需求双重挤压信号","旅游篮子位置>75且相对强度排名从前十滑落","VIX处于多年低点，消费者被累积通胀日益压榨"]},"b-uranium_miners":{"analog":"Closest to the Sep-2022 trough: same geometry where a semis-led, narrow-breadth AI tape (Tech +18.4% in this current leg, SMH +37%) pulled flows away from uranium even as the reflation quad and oil surged, leaving miners deeply washed out while spot held above the prior structural floor. The Sep-2022 to May-2023 leg was -40.8% in eight months and preceded the +164% breakout to $100 when the spot/supply narrative reconnected with a reflationary tape. The current setup is near-identical: deep washout inside a reflation-up quad with a strong dollar as the key headwind, sitting at structural support as the supply-deficit thesis awaits a confirmed spot-price catalyst.","analog_zh":"最接近2022年9月筑底：同为半导体领涨、窄幅广度AI行情（当前这段科技+18.4%、SMH+37%）将资金从铀股抽离，即便再通胀象限与油价飙升，矿商仍深度超跌，而现货守住前期结构性支撑上方。2022年9月至2023年5月为-40.8%（历时8个月），随后在现货/供给叙事与再通胀行情重新共振时交出+164%突破至100美元。当前形态几乎相同：在再通胀向上象限内深度洗盘，强势美元为关键逆风，守在结构性支撑上方等待现货催化确认。","bottom_signals":["equity miners trading at or near primary production cost equivalent","spot price stabilizes after prolonged equity selloff: miners de-rate faster than spot","macro regime shifts to reflation/growth-up with oil and copper-gold recovering","high-beta washout complete: highbeta-lowvol at multi-year lows with vol collapsing"],"bottom_signals_zh":["股票矿商交易价接近或达到一次生产成本等量线","铀现货在长期股票抛售后企稳：矿商估值下杀快于现货","宏观体制转为再通胀/增长向上、油价与铜金比回升","高贝塔洗盘完成：高贝塔减低波动处于多年低点且波动率崩溃"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["uranium spot price supply/demand balance vs reactor consumption","macro beta amplification risk-on/risk-off regime","supply-side shocks mine curtailments and producer cuts","demand narratives reactor restarts and AI-power baseload","geopolitical fuel-security events Russia and Kazakhstan","dollar and oil regime strong DXY headwind reflation tailwind"],"drivers_zh":["铀现货价格供需平衡对反应堆消耗","宏观贝塔放大风险偏好/避险体制","供给侧冲击矿山停产与生产商减产","需求叙事反应堆重启与AI电力基荷","地缘政治燃料安全事件俄罗斯与哈萨克斯坦","美元与油价体制强势美元逆风再通胀顺风"],"median_cycle_months":12.5,"summary":"Uranium miners cycle structurally via the interplay of three forces: (1) uranium spot price, driven by the supply/demand balance of primary mine production versus global reactor consumption and secondary inventory drawdowns; (2) macro beta, where the basket is one of the highest-beta commodity plays in the market, amplifying broad risk-on/risk-off regimes by 3-15x; and (3) narrative optionality, where periodic geopolitical or technology shocks (Fukushima 2011, Kazatomprom cuts 2017, SPUT launch 2021, AI-power 2023-24) reset the spot equilibrium and launch outsized rallies. Peaks form when spot reaches cycle highs and the narrative is fully priced, while troughs occur after the macro-beta unwinds of those prior rallies, leaving the group at or below primary production cost equivalents. The SPY/GICS sector context matters greatly: rallies extend when Tech and Energy co-lead in reflation/growth-up quads; selloffs deepen when defensives lead or when Tech rotates to a narrow growth-only subset (AI/semis alone) that excludes the uranium fuel-cycle trade.","summary_zh":"铀矿商的周期从结构上由三股力量互动驱动：（1）铀现货价格，取决于一次矿山产量与全球反应堆消耗量及二次库存消耗之间的供需平衡；（2）宏观贝塔，该组合为市场中贝塔最高的大宗商品交易之一，将广泛的风险偏好/避险体制放大3-15倍；（3）叙事期权性，即地缘政治或技术冲击（2011年福岛、2017年哈萨克斯坦减产、2021年SPUT上市、2023-24年AI电力）周期性重置现货均衡并引发超常涨幅。顶部形成于现货触及周期高点且叙事完全定价之时，底部则出现于此前涨势的宏观贝塔平仓之后，使该组别处于或低于一次生产成本等量线。标普500/GICS行业背景至关重要：科技与能源在再通胀/增长向上象限共同领涨时涨势延续；防御股领涨或科技轮动至排除铀燃料循环交易的窄幅成长子集（仅AI/半导体）时跌势加深。","top_signals":["spot price reaches multi-year highs with equity premium at peak (miners trading at large premium to NAV/spot equivalent)","broad macro goes narrow/growth-only: semis-only melt-up with commodities left behind","VIX at cycle lows with high-beta minus low-vol at extremes","narrative fully consensus: AI-nuclear or restart deal euphoria peak"],"top_signals_zh":["现货价达多年高位且股票溢价见顶（矿商对资产净值/现货等量大幅溢价交易）","宏观广度收窄至仅成长/半导体暴涨、大宗商品被甩在身后","VIX处于周期低点且高贝塔减低波动处于极值","叙事完全共识：AI核电或重启协议狂热见顶"]},"b-us_sector_comm":{"analog":"Closest analog to the Oct-2018 peak / Dec-2018 trough recovery: the current bottoming setup (rs_rank 41, below 200d, growth-value at -15.2, EW slightly beating cap-weight) shares the most structural similarity with the Dec 2018 to Jan 2020 recovery leg — a prior tech/growth-led cyclical peak was broken by a macro shock (rate/tariff), the catalyst resolved (Fed pivot then; tariff truce now), and the sector re-entered recovery with Tech/Semis leading. The key difference is the additional sector-specific overhang (AI capex-trap + regulatory risk) that the 2019 recovery did not face, suggesting the rebound may be more hesitant and narrower in the equal-weight construct.","analog_zh":"最接近的历史类比为2018年10月见顶/12月见底后的复苏行情：当前筑底形态（相对强弱排名41，低于200日均线，成长价值利差-15.2，等权小幅跑赢市值加权）与2018年12月至2020年1月的复苏腿结构最为相似——此前由科技/成长主导的周期性高点被宏观冲击（利率/关税）打破，触发因素随后消解（当时是美联储转向，现在是关税休战），板块在科技/半导体带领下重入复苏轨道。关键区别在于，当前存在2019年复苏所没有的板块特有阻力（AI资本支出陷阱+监管风险），意味着反弹力度可能更为迟疑，在等权构建中幅度也更为有限。","bottom_signals":["VIX spike above 30 with defensives leading by >10pp (2018-12 at 36, 2020-03 at 66, 2025-04 at 52 all marked troughs within weeks)","EW matching or beating cap-weight during a selloff (breadth broadening while Comm falls = rotation nearing exhaustion)","Fed pivot signal or explicit rate-cut forecast (Jan 2019 and Apr 2025 tariff pause both triggered immediate reversals)","Comm sector trailing SPY by >15pp over 3 months with growth-value spread deeply negative (current setup)"],"bottom_signals_zh":["VIX飙升超过30且防御板块领先超过10个百分点（2018年12月VIX=36、2020年3月VIX=66、2025年4月VIX=52均在数周内标志底部）","抛售期间等权指数追平或跑赢市值加权指数（市场广度扩大而通信服务下跌=轮动接近筋疲力尽）","美联储转向信号或明确降息预期（2019年1月和2025年4月关税暂停均触发立即反转）","通信服务板块3个月内落后标普500超过15个百分点且成长价值利差深度负值（当前形态）"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["Fed rate cycle (easing/pausing = tailwind; hiking/hawkish = headwind)","10-year yield direction (TLT direction is the single strongest correlate)","Digital advertising cycle (GDP-linked corporate spend)","AI capex vs monetization balance (post-2022 sector-specific driver)","Regulatory/antitrust risk on Alphabet and Meta","Growth-vs-value regime (growth-led tapes outperform; value rotations punish)"],"drivers_zh":["美联储利率周期（宽松/暂停=顺风；加息/鹰派=逆风）","10年期美债收益率方向（TLT走向是最强单一相关指标）","数字广告周期（与GDP挂钩的企业支出）","AI资本支出与货币化的平衡（2022年后的板块特有驱动因素）","谷歌和Meta面临的监管/反垄断风险","成长vs价值风格（成长股主导行情跑赢；价值轮动时受压）"],"median_cycle_months":15.6,"summary":"Communication Services (EW) cycles are overwhelmingly driven by the macro interest-rate and risk-appetite regime acting on its two dominant engines: (1) long-duration internet/ad-platform valuations (Alphabet, Meta, Netflix) that re-rate sharply when rates fall or risk appetite rises, and fall hard when yields spike or VIX surges; and (2) advertising-cycle sensitivity, which ties Comm's earnings directly to GDP and corporate-spending confidence. The sector's GICS 2018 reclassification turned what was a sleepy telecom sector into the second most growth-oriented sector in the S&P 500, making it functionally a rate-sensitive twin of Tech. Structurally, Comm outperforms in goldilocks/disinflation regimes (Fed on hold or easing, stable VIX, falling yields) and underperforms acutely in stagflation or rate-shock episodes. Equal-weight construction creates additional volatility versus cap-weight XLC because it amplifies smaller Comm names (telecom carriers, entertainment) relative to the Alphabet/Meta duopoly.","summary_zh":"通信服务（等权）的周期性走势主要受宏观利率与风险偏好环境主导，通过两大核心引擎传导：(1) 长久期互联网/广告平台估值（谷歌、Meta、Netflix），在利率下行或风险偏好上升时大幅重估，在收益率飙升或VIX激增时大幅下跌；(2) 广告周期敏感性，将板块盈利与GDP和企业支出信心直接挂钩。2018年GICS重新分类将原本沉寂的电信板块转化为标普500第二大成长导向板块，使其在功能上成为科技板块的利率敏感孪生体。结构上，板块在黄金/去通胀环境（美联储按兵不动或降息、VIX稳定、收益率下行）中跑赢大市，在滞胀或利率冲击期间大幅跑输。等权构建方式相对市值加权XLC制造额外波动，因为它放大了较小的通信公司（运营商、娱乐媒体）相对于谷歌/Meta双寡头的权重。","top_signals":["Narrow breadth extremes: EW lagging cap-weight by >10pp (flow concentrated in Alphabet/Meta, late-cycle crowding)","VIX complacency (sub-14) alongside semis at multi-year highs: past peaks in 2018-09 and 2025-02 both occurred with VIX at 12-15","Growth-minus-value spread above +40pp (historically preceded both the 2018 and pre-COVID 2020 peaks)","AI capex guidance acceleration without proportionate revenue beat (2025-02 analog: capex guides raised while ad-growth decelerated)"],"top_signals_zh":["市场广度极端收窄：等权落后市值加权超过10个百分点（资金集中流入谷歌/Meta，周期末期拥挤）","VIX极度低迷（低于14）叠加半导体处于多年高位：2018年9月和2025年2月两次见顶均发生在VIX处于12-15区间","成长股领先价值股利差超过+40个百分点（历史上先于2018年和2020年新冠前的高点出现）","AI资本支出指引加速但收入增速未同步提升（2025年2月类比：资本支出指引上调但广告增速放缓）"]},"b-us_sector_discretionary":{"analog":"Closest analog is the Dec-2018 trough setup: same post-tariff/trade-shock VIX spike (36 in 2018, 52 in 2025), same Fed-policy-driven uncertainty re-anchoring, and the same subsequent recovery pattern where Discretionary ranks among the top-3 cyclical sectors once policy risk is removed and growth is confirmed. The current Recovery phase at 27.2% cycle position with lagging RS and a reflation quad rhymes with the Feb-2019 setup (4-6 weeks after the Dec-2018 bottom), when Discretionary had recovered its beta but had not yet claimed sector leadership. In 2019 the dollar was also modestly stronger (+3.4% DXY, matching the current reading exactly), so if growth confirms and tariff uncertainty fades further, the 2019 playbook suggests 6-9 months of relative outperformance ahead for the sector before the next peak cycle signal arrives.","analog_zh":"最近似的历史类比为2018年12月底部格局：同样是关税/贸易冲击VIX暴升（2018年36，2025年52），同样美联储政策不确定性重新锚定，同样在政策风险消除后非必需消费在周期股中进入前三强。当前复苏阶段位置27.2%且RS落后，与2019年2月的格局相仿（2018年12月底部约4-6周后），当时Beta已回升但尚未夺得板块领先地位。2019年美元同样小幅偏强（DXY+3.4%，与当前读数完全吻合），若经济数据健康且关税不确定性继续淡化，过去的剧本表明未来6-9个月将进入相对盈利阶段。","bottom_signals":["Fed pause or explicit pivot language after multi-hike cycle (patient, data dependent, rate cuts)","CPI showing sequential monthly deceleration from peak","VIX spiking above 40-50 (panic exhaustion) then declining","Discretionary RS rank below 20th percentile with valuation gap vs SPY at multi-year wides"],"bottom_signals_zh":["美联储暂停加息或明确转鸽（耐心等待、数据驱动或安排降息）","CPI展示月环比从高点开始下行","VIX暴升至40-50（恐慌耗竭）后回落","非必需相对强度排名大幅低于第20百分位且相对SPY估值差距处于多年最大"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["real household income and consumer confidence","Fed rate cycle (hikes compress, pivots unleash spending)","dollar direction (stronger = import cost headwind for retailers/autos)","oil and inflation pass-through to discretionary spending budgets","fiscal stimulus (CARES, ARP) and tariff policy shocks"],"drivers_zh":["家庭实际收入与消费者信心","美联储利率周期（加息压制，转鸽释放）","美元走向（强元=零售/汽车进口成本逆风）","油价/通胀传导压缩非必需支出预算","财政刺激（CARES、ARP）及关税政策冲击"],"median_cycle_months":11.4,"summary":"Consumer Discretionary (EW) cycles as a textbook risk-sentiment amplifier: it outperforms in reflation/growth-up quads and underperforms in slowdown/stagflation quads, with drawdowns that consistently exceed SPY by 10-20pp on the downside. The recurring structural driver is consumer confidence and real household income: rate hikes, dollar strength, and inflation directly compress discretionary spending budgets, while Fed pivots, fiscal stimulus, and disinflation unleash spending booms. Equal-weighting removes the Amazon/Tesla mega-cap buffer, making the basket purer on smaller consumer names (retailers, homebuilders, autos, restaurants) that are more rate- and confidence-sensitive than the cap-weighted index. The sector's cycle peaks historically coincide with Fed overtightening warnings, CPI above 7%, and VIX spikes above 35; its troughs coincide with Fed pauses/pivots, CPI declining sequentially, and oil pulling back from supply-driven spikes.","summary_zh":"非必需消费（等权）是典型的风险情绪放大器：在再通胀/增长向上格局中超额上涨，在慢速/滞胀格局中大幅落后，跌幅通常超过市场整体10-20pp。核心驱动力为家庭实际收入和消费信心：加息、美元强势和通胀直接压缩非必需消费预算，而美联储转鸽、财政刺激和去通胀则释放消费热潮。等权剪除了亚马逊/特斯拉大市值缓冲，使该篮子更纯粹地反映小市值零售、建屋、汽车和餐饮公司的利率敏感性。","top_signals":["Fed language shifts to long way from neutral or accelerated taper/hike cadence","CPI above 7% for multiple months with no peak visible","VIX breaks above 30-35 on rate/policy panic not just vol spike","Discretionary leading a rally while defensives and equal-weight breadth are both narrowing (blow-off exhaustion)"],"top_signals_zh":["美联储表态转鹰，如距中性远或加速缩减/加息节奏","CPI连续多月处于7%以上且见顶信号不明","VIX突破30-35，因利率/政策恐慌而非单纯量化冲击","非必需持续领先而市场广度收窄时（吹顶耗尽信号）"]},"b-us_sector_energy":{"analog":"Closest to the June-2022 peak analog: the March-2026 peak shares the same structural setup — a geopolitically-extended oil spike (Ukraine→Russia Feb-2022; Iran-Hormuz Feb-2026) that drove Energy to sector leadership at stretched valuations, followed by a sharp derating as the risk premium collapsed and demand/supply fundamentals reasserted (recession fears then, Iran peace deal now). In the 2022 analog, the peak-to-trough drawdown was 27.4% over 4 weeks (Jun→Jul-2022), then another 20% selloff (Nov-2022→May-2023) as AI/tech dominated — today's downturn mirrors that pattern with the peace-deal risk-premium collapse acting as the first leg and potential AI/tech flow competition likely to persist as a second headwind.","analog_zh":"与2022年6月高点最为相似：2026年3月高点与其呈现相同的结构性形态——由地缘政治引发的石油超级反弹（乌克兰→俄罗斯2022年2月；伊朗→霍尔木兹2026年2月），推动能源板块以高估值站上板块领导地位，随后随着风险溢价崩塌、供需基本面重新主导而急剧重新定价（彼时是衰退担忧，此次是伊朗和平协议）。在2022年的类比中，峰值至谷底回撤为4周内27.4%（2022年6-7月），之后随AI/科技主导又下跌20%（2022年11月→2023年5月）——当前下行趋势映射了这一模式：和平协议引发的风险溢价崩塌构成第一腿，AI/科技资金流竞争可能持续为第二阶段的逆风。","bottom_signals":["Oil at multi-year lows with VIX elevated and credit spreads wide — oversold energy stocks near cash-cost support","OPEC+ announces historic production cuts or geopolitical supply shock emerges","Fed pivots to easing (or signals pause) — removes the rate-shock overhang","Equal-Weight energy deeply oversold relative to cap-weight (EW lagging XLE by >10%) — small E&P bounce leverage"],"bottom_signals_zh":["油价处于多年低位，波动率指数高企、信用利差走阔——能源股超卖至现金成本支撑附近","OPEC+宣布历史性减产或爆发地缘政治供应冲击","美联储转向宽松（或暗示暂停加息）——解除加息冲击压力","等权能源相对市值加权大幅超卖（等权落后XLE超10%）——中小型勘探商反弹杠杆效应"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["Oil supply-demand balance (OPEC+ discipline vs US shale growth)","Global macro quad regime (reflation/growth-up = bull; slowdown/deflation = bear)","US dollar direction (DXY rise = headwind; DXY fall = tailwind)","Geopolitical supply-shock events (Middle East, Russia)","Fed policy cycle (easing = tailwind; aggressive tightening = headwind via recession pricing)","Natural gas price cycle (amplifier for EW vs cap-weight given E&P/OFS over-weight)"],"drivers_zh":["石油供需平衡（OPEC+纪律 vs 美国页岩油产量增长）","全球宏观格局（再通胀/增长向上=牛市；放缓/通缩=熊市）","美元方向（美元升=逆风；美元贬=顺风）","地缘政治供应冲击事件（中东、俄罗斯）","美联储政策周期（宽松=顺风；激进加息=通过衰退定价构成逆风）","天然气价格周期（因勘探/油服超配而放大等权 vs 市值加权的差异）"],"median_cycle_months":18,"summary":"Equal-Weight Energy is a leveraged oil-price proxy: it cycles mechanically with WTI/Brent at 1.5-2x oil's magnitude because the EW construction over-weights smaller E&P and OFS names (vs. the cap-weighted XLE concentration in Exxon/Chevron), amplifying both upswings and drawdowns. The recurring engine is a three-force interaction: (1) the oil supply-demand balance (OPEC+ discipline vs. US shale growth), (2) the global macro 'quad' — Energy peaks in reflation/growth-up phases and troughs in slowdown/deflation-scare phases in near-perfect alignment with every cycle in 15 years; (3) the dollar cycle — a rising DXY is consistently a headwind, falling DXY a tailwind. Geopolitical supply shocks (Ukraine 2022, Iran 2026) act as exogenous accelerants that can extend bull legs beyond fundamental valuations, but they also create particularly sharp reversals when the risk premium collapses. Energy persistently lags during 'Goldilocks/disinflation' regimes when tech and growth dominate flow allocations.","summary_zh":"等权能源板块是油价的杠杆代理：等权构建对中小型勘探开采和油服公司的超配使其涨跌幅均为WTI/布伦特的1.5-2倍，远大于市值加权XLE中埃克森美孚/雪佛龙的集中度。循环驱动引擎是三力交互：(1) 石油供需平衡（OPEC+纪律 vs 美国页岩油增长）；(2) 全球宏观格局——能源在再通胀/增长向上阶段见顶，在放缓/通缩恐慌阶段触底，与过去15年每个周期几乎完美对应；(3) 美元周期——美元走强持续构成逆风，走弱则构成顺风。地缘政治供应冲击（2022年乌克兰、2026年伊朗）作为外生加速器可将牛市腿延伸超出基本面估值，但风险溢价崩塌时也会产生特别急剧的逆转。能源板块在科技和成长风格主导流量配置的'金发/通胀下行'环境中持续落后。","top_signals":["Oil prices at multi-year highs with bullish consensus and analyst upgrades — geopolitical risk premium stretched","DXY breaking out to the upside while Fed turns more hawkish (rate-shock risk)","Defensives begin to close the gap vs cyclicals while VIX starts rising — rotation away from beta","OPEC+ compliance weakens or production waivers/increases announced"],"top_signals_zh":["油价处于多年高位，市场共识看涨、分析师纷纷上调目标价——地缘风险溢价过度拉伸","美元指数向上突破，美联储鸽转鹰（加息冲击风险）","防御板块开始缩小对周期板块的差距，VIX开始攀升——资金轮出高贝塔","OPEC+执行纪律松动或宣布增产/豁免"]},"b-us_sector_financials":{"analog":"Closest to the mid-2019 goldilocks-but-lagging-financials setup (Dec 2018 trough to Feb 2020 peak): in that leg, the equal-weight basket gained 56% but underperformed Tech +81% in a narrow, megacap-led tape after the Fed cut rates with a flat-to-soft yield curve. Today the same dynamic plays out: reflation/growth-up quad, financials underperforming Tech and Energy, NIM expansion path muted by a flat Fed, and dollar strengthening, creating a mid-cycle drag rather than either a confirmed top or a bottom signal. The current setup is NOT the 2020 March trough analog (which required VIX above 60 and Fed going to zero), nor the 2016 supercycle launch (which required a Trump deregulation catalyst).","analog_zh":"最接近2019年中期'黄金迪尔利但金融落后'格局（2018年12月低点至2020年2月高点段）：该段等权篮子涨56%，但在窄幅、科技巨头主导的行情中跑输科技+81%，收益率曲线在美联储三次降息后才平缓陡化。当前同样格局：反通胀/增长上行、金融跑输科技和能源、净息差扩张路径受平坦美联储政策约束、美元走强，构成周期中段拖累特征，而非顶部或底部信号。当前格局既不是2020年3月低点类比（需要VIX突破60且美联储降至零利率），也不是2016年超级周期启动类比（需要特朗普监管放松催化剂）。","bottom_signals":["Fed dovish pivot or rate cut cycle combined with yield curve re-steepening","VIX compression from extreme levels above 40 combined with credit spread normalization","dollar weakening (DXY turning lower) signaling global growth reacceleration","policy catalyst such as deregulation or tax cuts that directly expands bank earnings power"],"bottom_signals_zh":["美联储转鸽或降息周期叠加收益率曲线再度陡化","VIX从极端高位（40以上）回落叠加信用利差正常化","美元走弱（美元指数掉头下行）预示全球增长再加速","监管放松或减税等政策催化剂直接扩大银行盈利能力"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["yield curve slope (steeper curve = wider NIM = higher bank earnings)","credit cycle quality (energy HTM deposit-run tail risks)","Fed policy pivots (rate hike cycle vs easing cycle)","macro policy deregulation and tax cuts amplify sector re-rating","dollar regime (strong DXY = EM credit stress; weaker DXY = global risk-on flows)","growth vs recession probability (direct impact on loan book quality and demand)"],"drivers_zh":["收益率曲线斜率（越陡峭净息差越宽银行盈利越高）","信贷周期质量（能源贷款/持有至到期/存款挤兑尾部风险）","美联储政策转向（加息周期vs降息周期）","宏观政策监管放松和减税放大板块估值重估","美元格局（强美元=新兴市场信用压力；弱美元=全球风险偏好回升利好银行）","增长vs衰退概率（直接影响贷款账簿质量和贷款需求）"],"median_cycle_months":17,"summary":"Financials (Equal-Weight) cycles structurally on the interaction of three recurring forces: (1) the Fed rate and yield-curve regime, where steepening curves expand NIM and flat or inverted curves compress it; (2) credit cycle quality, where loan-book stress from energy credits, HTM losses, or deposit runs amplifies selloffs while credit expansion amplifies rallies; and (3) macro policy pivots including deregulation and tax cuts, which deliver outsized sector re-ratings beyond what SPY or other cyclicals receive. The basket is a leveraged beta to economic expansion but with a critical vulnerability: it is the first casualty when liquidity or solvency fears emerge, lagging defensives during risk-off episodes even when the absolute rate environment appears benign.","summary_zh":"金融（等权）的周期性结构上由三股反复出现的力量驱动：（1）美联储利率和收益率曲线格局，曲线陡化扩大净息差，平坦或倒挂则压制；（2）信贷周期质量，贷款账簿压力（能源信贷、持有至到期亏损、存款挤兑）放大下跌，信贷扩张则放大上涨；（3）宏观政策转向（监管放松、减税），能为板块带来超出标普500或其他周期板块的超额估值重估。该篮子对经济扩张具有杠杆贝塔特征，但存在关键脆弱性：每当流动性或偿付能力恐慌出现时，金融板块是首先受创的板块，即便绝对利率环境尚可，风险规避期间也明显跑输防御板块。","top_signals":["yield curve flattening or inversion (2s10s or 3m10y approaching or crossing zero)","VIX spike above 30 coinciding with credit spread widening (HYG underperforming LQD)","oil or commodity shock threatening energy-sector loan books","Fed guidance turning hawkish with insufficient growth offset (rate hike into slowdown)"],"top_signals_zh":["收益率曲线趋平或倒挂（2s10s或3m10y趋近或穿越零值）","VIX飙升至30以上同时信用利差走阔（高收益跑输投资级）","油价或大宗商品冲击威胁能源贷款账簿","美联储转鹰而增长动能不足（加息叠加经济放缓）"]},"b-us_sector_health":{"analog":"Closest to the Feb-2016 trough leg (2016-02-11 start): same combination of a prior sharp selloff driven by macro shock plus sector-specific regulatory overhang (2015 Clinton tweet / 2024-25 MA rate crisis), followed by a risk-on reflation recovery where healthcare participates in absolute terms but substantially underperforms Tech/Industrials as cyclicals dominate. In both cases the equal-weight basket gained roughly 25-30% in the first year of recovery while SPY surged past 40%, confirming healthcare as a defensive follower rather than a cycle leader in the reflation phase.","analog_zh":"与2016年2月低点阶段（2016-02-11起始）最为相似：均为宏观冲击叠加行业特定监管压力（2015年希拉里推文/2024-25年Medicare Advantage费率危机）导致前期大幅下跌，随后风险偏好主导的再通胀复苏中医疗保健绝对收益可观，但大幅落后于科技和工业板块，周期性行业主导格局清晰。两种情形下，等权重篮子在复苏首年均上涨约25-30%，而标普500涨幅超过40%，印证医疗保健在再通胀阶段作为防御性跟随者而非周期引领者的结构性定位。","bottom_signals":["oil/commodities crashing alongside VIX spike and credit spread widening (deflation scare maximizing defensive bid)","healthcare RS rank falling to bottom quartile vs peers AND absolute price making new 52-week lows simultaneously","political overhang peak (M4A primary resolved, drug pricing bill passes and priced-in) removing the sector-specific de-rating","10Y yield peaking/falling and TLT reversing higher while healthcare is still selling off (rate-driven bottom)"],"bottom_signals_zh":["油价/大宗商品崩盘叠加VIX飙升和信用利差走阔（通缩恐慌最大化防御买盘）","医疗保健相对强度排名跌至同类板块后四分之一且绝对价格同时创52周新低","政治压力消退峰值（Medicare全覆盖初选落定、药价法案通过并消化）消除行业特定估值折价","10年期国债收益率见顶/回落且TLT反转走高，而医疗保健仍在下跌（利率驱动的底部）"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["macro quad (slowdown=defensive bid, reflation=laggard)","drug pricing / M4A political risk events","Fed rate cycle (rate-sensitive via biotech duration)","biotech innovation supercycles and busts","equal-weight structure amplifies small/mid-cap biotech beta","CMS Medicare/Medicaid rate policy shocks"],"drivers_zh":["宏观象限（放缓=防御买盘，再通胀=落后）","药价/Medicare全覆盖政治风险事件","美联储利率周期（通过生物科技久期敏感）","生物科技创新超级周期与崩溃","等权重结构放大中小盘生物科技贝塔","CMS医疗保险/医疗补助费率政策冲击"],"median_cycle_months":19,"summary":"Health Care (EW) cycles primarily on the interplay of three forces: (1) macro-regime beta -- the sector outperforms in slowdown/deflation-scare quads when defensives are bid and underperforms in reflation/growth-up quads when cyclicals dominate; (2) political/regulatory risk -- drug pricing threats (Clinton tweet 2015, IRA 2022), Medicare-for-All scares (2018-2020 primary cycle), and CMS rate proposals create idiosyncratic peaks and troughs unconnected to the macro cycle; and (3) biotech duration sensitivity -- equal-weight healthcare holds a larger-than-cap-weight biotech allocation, making it more rate-sensitive than XLV, such that rising yields amplify selloffs (2015, 2022, 2023) and falling yields amplify rallies. The sector reliably underperforms in risk-on melt-up environments (2016-2018, 2020-2021, 2025-2026 current) because equal-weight construction dilutes mega-cap pharma alpha while amplifying biotech volatility.","summary_zh":"医疗保健（等权）主要受三大力量驱动而周期性波动：（1）宏观象限贝塔——在经济放缓/通缩恐慌象限中防御性资金买盘，在再通胀/增长向上象限中跑输周期性行业；（2）政治/监管风险——药价威胁（2015年希拉里推文、2022年《通胀削减法案》）、Medicare全覆盖恐慌（2018-2020年初选周期）及CMS费率提案制造与宏观周期无关的行业特定峰谷；（3）生物科技久期敏感性——等权重医疗保健持有比市值加权更高的生物科技比例，使其对利率更为敏感，利率上行放大下跌（2015、2022、2023年），利率下行放大上涨。板块在风险偏好主导的融断行情中（2016-2018、2020-2021、当前2025-2026）可靠地落后，因为等权重结构稀释了大盘制药阿尔法，同时放大了生物科技波动性。","top_signals":["defensives outperforming cyclicals for 3+ months signals healthcare near-cycle peak (last sustained outperformance exhausted)","political drug-pricing catalyst (legislation or election rhetoric) hitting coincident with stretched valuation","biotech (IBB) making new 52-week highs while VIX is low and rates are flat-to-falling (blow-off condition)","healthcare RS rank surging into top decile vs SPY peers (sector rotation complete, fading)"],"top_signals_zh":["防御性行业连续3个月以上跑赢周期性行业，暗示医疗保健接近周期峰值","药价政治催化剂（立法或选举言论）叠加估值拉伸","生物科技（IBB）创52周新高同时VIX低位、利率平稳或下降（吹顶状态）","医疗保健相对强度排名跃升至同类板块前十分位（行业轮动完成，动能减弱）"]},"b-us_sector_industrials":{"analog":"Closest to the Jan-2016 trough analog: the April 2025 low also followed a maximum-tariff/policy-shock selloff (2015-16 China devaluation then, Liberation Day now), a VIX spike to extreme levels (28 then, 52 now), and a commodity trough that resolved into a reflation upcycle as the policy headwind lifted. In 2016 the catalyst was China stabilization + Trump reflation trade; in 2025 it is the US-China tariff truce + AI capex supercycle. Both saw Industrials rank among the top-3 sectors early in the ensuing rally. The key risk to the analog is that the 2016-18 leg lasted 32 months and 109% before the trade-war reversal; the current leg at 57% and 14 months is still in its earlier phase, but the analog suggests watchfulness for any PMI rollover or tariff re-escalation signal.","analog_zh":"与2016年1月低点最为相似：2025年4月低点同样发生在最大化政策冲击后的抛售（彼时为中国汇率贬值，今次为'解放日'关税）、VIX极端飙升（彼时28，今次52）以及大宗商品触底，随后随政策逆风消散进入再通胀上行周期。2016年催化剂为中国稳定+特朗普再通胀交易，2025年为中美关税休战+AI资本支出超级周期。两轮反弹初期工业板块均位列前三强板块。关键风险在于：2016-18年那轮持续32个月累涨109%后才被贸易战终结；当前这轮历时14个月已涨57%，仍处于早中期，类比提示需密切警惕PMI拐头向下或关税重新升级的信号。","bottom_signals":["Global PMI troughing and new orders re-accelerating above 50","Fed pivot signal (patient language or explicit pause/cut)","Oil and copper bouncing from multi-month lows confirming demand recovery","VIX declining from spike (>40) as credit spreads peak and tighten"],"bottom_signals_zh":["全球PMI见底，新订单重新回升至50以上","美联储转向信号（'耐心'措辞或明确暂停/降息）","油价与铜价从多月低点反弹，确认需求复苏","VIX从峰值（>40）回落，信用利差见顶收窄"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["Global PMI cycle and manufacturing output trajectory","USD cycle: weak dollar boosts export/multinational revenue","Oil and copper prices as capex-order proxies","US fiscal policy: infrastructure, defense, and industrial policy","Fed rate cycle: rate-sensitivity via capital project financing costs"],"drivers_zh":["全球PMI周期与制造业产出走势","美元周期：弱美元提振出口/跨国公司营收","油价与铜价作为资本开支订单代理指标","美国财政政策：基础设施、国防与产业政策","美联储加息周期：通过资本项目融资成本传导利率敏感性"],"median_cycle_months":23,"summary":"Industrials (Equal-Weight) cycles primarily on the intersection of the global growth regime (PMI direction), the dollar cycle (export competitiveness), commodity/energy prices (input costs and capex orders), and US fiscal/policy cycles (infrastructure, defense, and trade policy). The sector amplifies SPY in risk-on phases but underperforms defensively in risk-off regimes because its revenue base is heavily tied to capital spending and global trade volumes. Its cyclicality exceeds the SPY average but is less tech-driven than Discretionary or Comm, making it a reliable leading indicator of real-economy activity rather than monetary-liquidity repricing.","summary_zh":"工业板块（等权）的周期主要由全球增长象限（PMI方向）、美元周期（出口竞争力）、大宗商品/能源价格（投入成本与资本开支订单）以及美国财政/政策周期（基建、国防、贸易政策）四大力量交织驱动。该板块在风险偏好上行阶段放大标普500涨幅，但在风险规避时期相对防御板块明显落后，因其营收高度依赖资本支出与全球贸易量。其周期性强于标普500均值，但较可选消费或通信板块对科技/流动性的依赖度低，使其成为实体经济活动的可靠领先指标而非货币流动性重定价的放大器。","top_signals":["Global PMI rolling over below 52 with new orders sub-index falling","DXY surging >5% over a 3-6 month window compressing multinational earnings","Fed hiking cycle with real rates turning positive and TLT declining >10%","Cyclicals-vs-defensives spread narrowing or reversing while VIX spikes above 25"],"top_signals_zh":["全球PMI从52以上向下拐头，新订单分项下滑","美元指数在3-6个月内飙升超5%，压缩跨国企业盈利","美联储加息周期中实际利率转正，TLT下跌超10%","周期板块与防御板块价差收窄或反转，同时VIX飙升至25以上"]},"b-us_sector_materials":{"analog":"Closest to the April 2022 peak analog: same late-reflation-quad rollover with a strong dollar, a hawkish Fed signaling continuation, and commodity prices fading from their supercycle highs. In April 2022 Materials had just posted a massive 196.8% two-year run, copper hit record $10,476/t, and the DXY was accelerating — the sector then dropped 19.8% to a July trough before a false-pivot bounce and a second leg down to September 2022. The current setup (Feb 2026 peak after a 56.6% run, DXY re-strengthening +3.4%, hawkish Fed repricing copper to 2026 lows) rhymes with that early-selloff phase: the first trough may be shallow, followed by a bear-bounce on pivot hopes before a second test if the dollar stays firm.","analog_zh":"与2022年4月峰值情形最为相似：同属通胀反弹末期的滚顶形态，美元走强、美联储暗示持续紧缩、大宗商品价格从超级周期高点回落。2022年4月材料板块刚结束196.8%的两年长牛，铜价创历史高点10476美元/吨，美元指数加速走强——板块随后下跌19.8%至7月低谷，经历一次虚假转向反弹后再度二次探底至2022年9月。当前格局（2026年2月峰值后56.6%的涨幅，美元指数重新走强+3.4%，鹰派美联储将铜价压向2026年低位）与彼时的初期下跌阶段高度相似：首次低谷可能较浅，之后或有一次转向预期驱动的熊市反弹，若美元维持强势则面临二次考验。","bottom_signals":["DXY peak and reversal — each major trough coincided with dollar turning (2016 Shanghai Accord, 2022 Sep peak, 2025 Apr)","China reopening or major stimulus announcement — revives the world's largest commodity demand engine","Commodity price capitulation: sector EV/EBITDA at 15-year lows, buy-side copper targets cut aggressively","Fed dovish pivot / rate-cut signal releases the dollar and re-prices commodity cash flows higher"],"bottom_signals_zh":["美元指数见顶并逆转——每次重大低谷均与美元转向吻合（2016年上海协议、2022年9月峰值、2025年4月）","中国重新开放或重大刺激政策宣布——重振全球最大大宗商品需求引擎","大宗商品价格恐慌性抛售：板块EV/EBITDA创15年低位，买方铜价目标被大幅下调","美联储转鸽/降息信号释放美元压力并推高大宗商品现金流重新定价"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["US Dollar Index (DXY): inverse relationship — weaker dollar is the single most reliable tailwind","China industrial demand: consumes ~50% global copper and ~65% iron ore; slowdown signals trigger outsize selloffs","Fed policy quadrant: rate hikes = dollar up = commodity headwind; rate cuts/pause = dollar softens = tailwind","Oil and commodity supercycle positioning: Materials and Energy move together in reflation quads","Global fiscal stimulus: large-scale spending on infrastructure, clean energy, and defense drives structural commodity demand","Trade policy / tariffs: the sector has extreme sensitivity to US-China trade escalation given global supply chains"],"drivers_zh":["美元指数（DXY）：反向关系——美元走弱是最可靠的单一顺风因素","中国工业需求：消耗全球约50%铜和约65%铁矿石；放缓信号触发超额抛售","美联储政策象限：加息=美元升=大宗商品阻力；降息/暂停=美元软化=顺风","油价和大宗商品超级周期定位：通胀反弹象限中材料与能源联动","全球财政刺激：大规模基建、清洁能源和国防支出驱动结构性大宗商品需求","贸易政策/关税：板块对美中贸易升级极度敏感，因全球供应链高度交织"],"median_cycle_months":35,"summary":"Materials (Equal-Weight) is structurally a levered proxy on the global commodity cycle, with its turns dictated by the intersection of the US dollar, global (especially Chinese) industrial demand, and the macro policy quadrant. The sector reliably leads in reflation/growth-up quads when the dollar is weakening and commodity pricing power is rising, but it punishes investors severely in slowdown/deflation-scare quads when the dollar strengthens and China demand contracts. The equal-weight construction amplifies this cyclicality because it overweights smaller miners and specialty chemical names with higher commodity-price beta. Historically, every major cycle bottom has coincided with a dollar peak or Chinese stimulus signal, and every major peak has coincided with a hawkish Fed shock, dollar surge, or demand-destruction catalyst. The sector exhibits a median peak-to-peak cycle of roughly 35 months, with major legs (over 30%) requiring a sustained reflation impulse (fiscal, monetary, or China demand) rather than a mere risk-on rally.","summary_zh":"材料（等权）在结构上是全球大宗商品周期的杠杆代理，其转折点由美元、全球（尤其是中国）工业需求以及宏观政策象限的交汇决定。在通胀反弹/增长向上象限中，美元走弱、大宗商品定价权上升时，该板块可靠领涨；但在放缓/通缩恐慌象限中，美元走强、中国需求收缩时，则会对投资者造成严重损失。等权构建方式放大了这种周期性，因为它超配了商品价格贝塔更高的小型矿商和特种化学品公司。历史上，每次重大周期底部都与美元见顶或中国刺激信号吻合，每次重大峰值都与鹰派美联储冲击、美元飙升或需求破坏催化剂吻合。该板块中位峰值到峰值周期约为35个月，超过30%的重大腿段需要持续的通胀反弹脉冲（财政、货币或中国需求），而非单纯的风险偏好反弹。","top_signals":["DXY reversal from a downtrend back to strength — historically preceded every major peak (2015, 2018, 2022 Apr, 2024)","Fed hawkish pivot or rate-hike shock in a late-cycle environment (2018 Dec hike, 2022 Jackson Hole)","China demand concern / PMI break below 50 alongside commodity price rollover (copper-gold ratio turning negative)","Cyclical-to-defensive spread collapses as VIX spikes above 25 — sector underperforms the first 5% of that move"],"top_signals_zh":["美元指数从下行趋势转为走强——历史上每次重大峰值前均有此信号（2015、2018、2022年4月、2024年）","晚周期环境中美联储鹰派转向或加息冲击（2018年12月加息、2022年杰克逊霍尔）","中国需求担忧/PMI跌破50叠加大宗商品价格回落（铜金比率转负）","VIX飙升至25以上时顺周期与防御价差崩塌——板块在首个5%下跌中跑输"]},"b-us_sector_realestate":{"analog":"Closest analog to the Aug-2022 peak setup (August 15, 2022): same 'reflation/growth-up quad with narrow mega-cap breadth and modest yield tailwind already fading' configuration. In Aug-2022, REITs had bounced +18.9% off a trough, reached a local peak at the 10th month of a hiking cycle, with TLT only +3.7% (insufficient yield relief), DXY still firm, and growth leading over defensives — the sector then fell -22.5% over the next two months as Jackson Hole killed the pivot narrative. Today's setup mirrors this: a +23.6% bounce from a crisis trough (April 2025), the yield relief is thin (TLT +4.2%), cyclicals dominate by a wide margin (+50.3% vs defensives +22.3%), and at rs_rank 19, REIT relative strength is already deteriorating. The key risk is a bond-market re-steepening or a hot inflation print that kills the current soft-pivot narrative, which would reprice the current peak into the next multi-month selloff leg.","analog_zh":"与2022年8月15日高点设置最为相近：当时同样是\"通胀/增长上行格局+大盘科技市场广度收窄+有限利率顺风已趋于消退\"的组合。2022年8月，REITs在加息周期第10个月从低点反弹18.9%至局部高点，TLT仅涨3.7%（利率松动不足），美元依然强势，成长板块领先防御——随后在杰克逊霍尔\"转向预期破灭\"后两个月内下跌22.5%。当前格局高度类似：从2025年4月危机低点反弹23.6%，利率松动有限（TLT +4.2%），周期股大幅领先防御股（+50.3% vs +22.3%），相对强弱排名第19位已显示持续恶化。核心风险在于债市利率曲线再度陡峭化或通胀数据超预期，打破当前温和转向叙事，届时现有高点可能演变为下一轮数月级别的回调。","bottom_signals":["10Y Treasury yield surges to new multi-year highs / TLT multi-year lows","Fed hawkish re-pricing event (Jackson Hole 2022, hot NFP Feb 2023, terminal rate revision higher)","REIT NAV discounts widen to -25% to -30% vs. private market valuations — peak pessimism","Dollar surge >8% concurrent with rising yields — double squeeze on REIT borrowing costs"],"bottom_signals_zh":["10年期美债收益率飙升至多年新高/TLT多年新低","美联储鹰派重定价事件（2022年杰克逊霍尔、2023年2月热门非农、终端利率上修）","REIT NAV折价扩大至相对私募市场估值的-25%至-30%——悲观情绪见顶","美元大涨超8%并与收益率上行同步——对REIT融资成本形成双重挤压"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["Long-bond yield direction (TLT / 10Y Treasury): primary NAV and cap-rate driver","Fed rate policy cycle: easing = REIT re-rating, hiking = de-rating","Dollar direction: stronger DXY raises financing costs and pressures international property assets","Growth/Tech melt-up (narrow breadth): siphons institutional flow away from yield-proxy REITs","Credit/systemic stress events: CRE loan exposure via regional banks amplifies selloffs"],"drivers_zh":["长债收益率方向（TLT/10年期美债）：首要NAV与资本化率驱动力","美联储利率政策周期：宽松=REITs重估上行，加息=估值下行","美元方向：美元走强提高融资成本并压制国际物业资产","成长/科技熔涨（市场广度收窄）：机构资金从收益率代理型REITs虹吸至成长板块","信用/系统性压力事件：商业地产贷款经区域银行放大下行冲击"],"median_cycle_months":14,"summary":"US Real Estate (Equal-Weight) cycles with dominant sensitivity to the direction of long-bond yields (10-year Treasuries / TLT), which sets cap-rate spreads, NAV multiples, and borrowing costs for the sector's structurally leveraged balance sheets. The recurring causal engine is: (1) when yields fall or the Fed signals easing, REITs re-rate up as their dividend yields become attractive vs. Treasuries and NAV multiples expand; (2) when yields rise aggressively — especially from rate-shock catalysts like the 2022 hiking cycle or 2023 'higher for longer' repricing — REITs are the first and deepest victim among equity sectors because they carry the highest effective equity duration. The sector shows a second recurring driver: tech/AI-led growth environments that concentrate returns in mega-cap growth create a flow-siphoning headwind even when rates are stable, producing underperformance vs. SPY during narrow-breadth melt-ups. Vs. the 11 GICS SPDR sectors, REITs cycle most like XLU (Utilities) — yield-proxy, rate-inverse — but with additional property-income and leverage sensitivity that creates larger drawdowns during credit-stress events (COVID, SVB, tariff shocks).","summary_zh":"美国房地产（等权）板块的周期核心驱动力在于长债收益率（10年期美债/TLT）的方向性变动，后者决定资本化率利差、NAV估值倍数及板块高杠杆资产负债表的融资成本。核心循环机制为：当收益率下行或美联储释放宽松信号时，REIT股息率相对国债吸引力提升，NAV倍数扩张，板块随之上涨；当收益率激进上行——尤其是2022年加息周期或2023年\"更高更久\"重定价等利率冲击——REITs因持有股票类资产中最高的有效久期而成为率先也是跌幅最深的受害板块。第二个循环驱动为：科技/AI主导的成长行情将收益集中于大盘成长股，即便利率稳定，也会对REITs形成资金虹吸，在窄幅市场广度的熔涨行情中显著跑输SPY。在11个GICS SPDR板块中，REITs与公用事业（XLU）周期最为相似——均为收益率代理、利率反向资产——但额外具有物业收入和杠杆敏感性，在信用压力事件（新冠、硅谷银行、关税冲击）期间产生更大回撤。","top_signals":["10Y Treasury yield falling to new lows / TLT at multi-month high — cap-rate compression imminent","Fed rate cut cycle begins or signals first cut, especially in disinflation context","VIX spike to 30+ followed by rapid compression — REITs bounce from oversold yield-proxy washout","DXY weakening trend (>5% move) concurrent with yield pullback"],"top_signals_zh":["10年期美债收益率下行创新低/TLT多月高点——资本化率压缩在即","美联储启动降息周期或释放首次降息信号，尤其在去通胀背景下","VIX飙升至30以上后快速回落——REITs从超卖收益率代理低点反弹","美元走弱趋势（>5%跌幅）与收益率回落同步出现"]},"b-us_sector_staples":{"analog":"Closest to the May 2023 trough/selloff entry (Leg 8 pattern): the current post-February 2026 phase rhymes with the post-May 2023 setup — Staples peaked in a defensive rally as the broader index was at highs, then sold off as the tape rotated back toward growth and higher-for-longer rates reasserted. Today, Staples at rs_rank 29 with cyclicals (Tech +24%, Energy +21%) leading by >10pp over defensives (+6.9%) mirrors the April-September 2022 and May-October 2023 legs where the sector underperformed in a reflation/growth-up quad while absorbing valuation drag from yields and dollar. The sector is not in breakdown territory (above 200d, BUY signal), but the setup argues for continued underperformance vs SPY until either a growth scare forces defensive rotation or the rate cycle turns materially dovish again.","analog_zh":"与2023年5月见顶后的抛售形态最为相似（第8腿）：当前2026年2月峰后阶段与2023年5月后走势高度重合——必需消费在防御反弹中见顶（此时大盘同处高位），随后在行情重回成长股、利率\"高位更持久\"预期重燃时回落。当前rs_rank仅29、科技（+24%）与能源（+21%）领先防御板块（+6.9%）超过10个百分点，复刻了2022年4-9月及2023年5-10月两轮区间中再通胀/增长格局下该板块落后、同时承受收益率与美元估值阻力的特征。板块尚未跌破（站稳200日均线，买入信号），但格局指向在成长恐慌迫使防御轮动或利率周期实质性转鸽之前，相对标普500持续跑输。","bottom_signals":["10-year yield at a multi-year high (>4.5-5%), TLT severely oversold — bond-proxy valuation maximally compressed, mean-reversion setup","Staples down 15-20%+ in absolute terms while SPY down less than 10% — the AI/growth-flow rotation overshooting, positioning washout","VIX spike >35 with cyclicals down 40%+ — defensive relative rotation bids about to surge into Staples from portfolio rebalancing","DXY reversing from a >10% multi-quarter spike — multinationals EPS tailwind about to emerge"],"bottom_signals_zh":["10年期收益率达多年高位（>4.5-5%），TLT严重超卖——类债券估值压缩至极限，均值回归机会","必需消费绝对跌幅达15-20%以上而标普500跌幅不足10%——AI/成长资金轮动过度，仓位洗出","波动率指数飙升>35且周期板块跌逾40%——防御轮动买盘即将从组合再平衡涌入必需消费","美元指数从多季度10%以上涨幅回落——跨国企业盈利顺风即将显现"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["risk-on/risk-off-regime-shift (VIX, credit spreads, defensives-vs-cyclicals ratio)","interest-rate-bond-proxy-channel (yields up = de-rate; yields down = re-rate)","dollar-strength-headwind-for-multinationals","oil-commodity-prices (inversely correlated — oil down = sector tailwind; oil up = cost headwind + cyclical rotation out)","Fed-policy-pivot (dovish = rate tailwind; hawkish = double compression via yields + risk-on flows away)"],"drivers_zh":["风险偏好切换（波动率/信用利差/防御vs周期领涨格局）","利率/类债券估值通道（收益率上行=估值受压；收益率下行=估值提升）","美元强势对跨国企业的持续阻力","油价/大宗商品（反向关联：油价下跌=成本顺风；油价上涨=成本阻力+资金转向周期）","美联储政策转向（转鸽=利率顺风；转鹰=收益率+资金外流双重压缩）"],"median_cycle_months":34,"summary":"Consumer Staples (Equal-Weight) cycles primarily in response to two interlocking macro forces: the risk-on/risk-off regime (defined by VIX, credit spreads, and whether cyclicals or defensives lead) and the interest rate and bond-proxy valuation channel (Staples' stable earnings trade like long-duration bonds — yields rising = Staples de-rated; yields falling = Staples re-rated). When the macro quad is reflation or goldilocks growth-up, capital flows to Energy, Industrials, and Tech, and Staples is a structural laggard. When the quad is slowdown/deflation-scare or a flight-to-safety event triggers, Staples absorbs relative bids and outperforms on a relative basis — but still loses money in acute risk-off selloffs (COVID: -24%; Q4 2018: -14%). The equal-weight construction amplifies the rate channel because it overweights smaller, higher-yielding names vs the cap-weighted basket. Dollar strength is a recurring headwind for multinationals in the basket (Procter & Gamble, Colgate, etc.). The structural laggard pattern in risk-on tapes (2014-2018, 2020-2022, 2023-2026) is consistent: Staples participates but trails SPY by 10-25 percentage points in multi-year growth upcycles.","summary_zh":"必需消费（等权）的周期性主要由两组宏观力量交互驱动：一是风险偏好/风险规避切换（由波动率、信用利差及周期股vs防御股领跑关系定义）；二是利率与类债券估值通道（稳定盈利类股票等同于长久期债券——收益率上升则板块估值受压，收益率下降则估值提升）。当宏观格局为再通胀或金发女孩增长向上时，资金流向能源、工业与科技，必需消费结构性落后；当格局切换为经济放缓/通缩恐慌或避险事件，必需消费吸收相对买盘、相对跑赢，但在急性风险规避中仍难免绝对亏损。等权构造放大了利率通道效应，因其相对市值加权超配更多高股息率小盘名称。美元强势是篮子内宝洁、高露洁等跨国巨头的持续阻力。在风险偏好主导的行情中，必需消费始终是结构性落后者，多年成长周期通常落后标普50010-25个百分点。","top_signals":["Defensives leading cyclicals (>5pp outperformance sustained) while SPY is near all-time highs — historically a late-cycle warning, not a reason to add Staples","XLP/Staples near upper Bollinger Band with MACD rolling over while TLT has already rallied (bond-proxy trade crowded)","Equity VIX compressing toward 12-14 with high-beta/low-vol spread widening — peak positioning, cyclicals about to take over","DXY multi-month rally (>8%) combined with rising 10-year yields — dual headwind peak for Staples multinationals"],"top_signals_zh":["防御板块在标普500接近历史高点时持续领先周期板块5个百分点以上——历史上为周期晚期预警，而非加仓必需消费信号","XLP触碰布林带上轨同时MACD趋弱，且TLT已大幅上涨（类债券拥挤交易信号）","波动率指数压缩至12-14且高贝塔/低波动利差扩大——仓位见顶，周期股即将接棒","美元指数多月上涨超8%叠加10年期收益率上行——跨国企业双重顶部压力"]},"b-us_sector_tech":{"analog":"Closest analog to the Oct-2018 peak: the current 2026 Topping phase at 77.1 percentile mirrors Sep-2018's setup — semis already up 200%+ from trough, VIX compressed to 13-16, growth-minus-value diverging negatively, and the headline earnings narrative (AI infrastructure then vs cloud/FAANG then) still intact while the macro headwind (then: Fed at 2.5% with further hikes signaled; now: growth-minus-value at -15.2pp despite price leadership) is building beneath the surface. The 2018 setup saw a -23% selloff in under 4 months when the macro headwind triggered; the present analog suggests a similar sharp, fast correction risk rather than a grinding bear market.","analog_zh":"与2018年10月见顶格局最为相似：当前2026年顶部阶段（历史分位77.1%）与2018年9月高点如出一辙——半导体已从低点飙升200%以上，VIX压缩至13-16，成长相对价值大幅背离走弱，主线叙事（当时为云计算/FANG，现为AI基础设施）看似仍坚实，但宏观逆风（当时美联储利率在2.5%且继续加息；现为成长落后-15.2个百分点尽管科技价格领涨）正在水面下积聚。2018年格局在宏观逆风触发后不足4个月内引发-23%急跌；当前类比提示短期急速修正风险大于漫长熊市。","bottom_signals":["Decisive Fed policy reversal (pivot to patience / emergency rate cut / QE launch) — all four major bottoms coincided with explicit policy shift","VIX above 30-36 with credit spreads (HYG-LQD) widening — capitulation in both equity vol and credit","Semis (SMH) breaking below 52-week lows on volume after already declining 25%+ from peak","External catalyst resolution: trade-truce announcements, tariff reversals, or geopolitical ceasefires have each triggered V-shaped recoveries"],"bottom_signals_zh":["美联储政策决定性逆转（转向耐心/紧急降息/启动QE）——四次主要底部均与明确政策转变同步","VIX超过30-36同时信用利差（HYG-LQD）扩大——股票波动率与信用市场双重恐慌出逃","半导体（SMH）在已从高点下跌25%以上后放量跌破52周低点","外部催化剂解除：贸易休战公告、关税逆转或地缘政治停火均曾触发V形复苏"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["Fed rate regime: ZIRP inflates, tightening compresses long-duration multiples","Semiconductor capex/demand cycle as the sector high-beta amplifier (SMH 1.4-2.5x sector)","Episodic AI/tech narrative regime shifts capturing institutional flow","Risk-on/risk-off macro: VIX compression enables tech rallies; VIX spikes force cyclical unwind","US dollar direction: DXY weakness is a tailwind for multinational tech revenue translation","Trade policy and supply-chain risk for chip/hardware supply chains"],"drivers_zh":["美联储利率体制：零利率推升、紧缩压缩长久期成长股估值倍数","半导体资本开支/需求周期作为板块高贝塔放大器（SMH幅度约为板块的1.4-2.5倍）","阶段性AI/科技叙事体制切换捕获机构资金流","风险偏好宏观：VIX压缩推动科技上涨；VIX飙升迫使周期股出逃","美元方向：DXY走弱是跨国科技公司收入折算的顺风","贸易政策与芯片/硬件供应链风险"],"median_cycle_months":18,"summary":"Technology (Equal-Weight) cycles structurally on the interaction of three forces: (1) the Fed's discount-rate regime, which determines how aggressively long-duration growth multiples are discounted — ZIRP inflates them, tightening cycles compress them; (2) the semiconductor capex/demand cycle, which amplifies every leg (semis are the sector's high-beta bellwether, with SMH moves consistently 1.4-2.5x the sector's own return); and (3) episodic narrative-regime shifts — FANG dominance (2014-18), COVID digital transformation (2020-21), and AI/ChatGPT (2022-present) — that create sustained institutional flows into tech above index weight. Peaks have coincided with the Fed's most aggressive tightening (2018, 2022) or an external demand-narrative shock (DeepSeek 2025), while troughs have been marked by decisive policy reversal (Powell pivots Jan-2019, Mar-2020 QE, the May-2025 trade truce). Between-leg duration is asymmetric: selloffs are sharp and short (2-5 months), whereas rallies compound over 14-28 months on durable growth narratives.","summary_zh":"科技（等权）的周期结构性地由三大力量交织驱动：（1）美联储折现率体制——决定长久期成长股估值倍数被压缩的程度，零利率推高估值，加息周期则压缩；（2）半导体资本开支/需求周期——放大每一段行情（半导体是板块内部的高贝塔风向标，SMH涨跌幅持续为板块本身的1.4-2.5倍）；（3）阶段性叙事体制切换——FANG主导（2014-18年）、新冠数字化转型（2020-21年）、AI/ChatGPT（2022年至今）——持续吸引机构资金超配科技板块。历史上，周期顶部往往与美联储最激进的紧缩节点重合（2018、2022年），或外部需求叙事冲击（DeepSeek 2025年）；而底部则标志性地出现在决定性政策逆转时（鲍威尔2019年1月转向、2020年3月QE、2025年5月贸易休战）。段间时长不对称：下跌段急促而短暂（2-5个月），而上涨段则依托持久成长叙事复利延伸14-28个月。","top_signals":["VIX at multi-year lows (13-15) while semis (SMH) have already surged 100%+ from trough — late-cycle exhaustion","Fed at or near peak tightening with real rates deeply positive, repricing long-duration at full force","Growth-minus-value spread goes deeply negative diverging from price (as in current 2026 setup: growth -15.2pp despite Tech price leadership)","Extreme narrow breadth: equal-weight lagging cap-weight by 20pp+ signals Magnificent-7 concentration risk"],"top_signals_zh":["VIX处于多年低点（13-15）而半导体（SMH）已从低点飙升100%以上——周期末期耗竭信号","美联储处于或接近紧缩峰值，实际利率深度为正，对长久期估值充分施压","成长股相对价值股大幅跑输而价格仍领涨（如当前2026年格局：成长落后-15.2个百分点但科技价格仍领涨）","市场广度极度偏窄：等权落后市值加权20个百分点以上，标志'七巨头'集中风险"]},"b-us_sector_utilities":{"analog":"Closest analog to the Oct-2018 trough leg (Feb 2018→Feb 2020): the same rate-peak-then-pivot dynamic and defensive-over-cyclical squeeze created a 63.4% rally as the Fed cut three times in 2019 and yields fell. Today's setup (trough at 14.3 pos, BUY signal, reflation quad headwind currently, but above 200d MA) rhymes with February 2018 in that: the prior big rally (2023-2026 AI-driven 95%) has corrected and repriced, rates have potentially peaked or are peaking in the current tariff-inflation cycle, and the next catalyst will be the Fed's next easing signal or a growth-scare macro shift that redirects flows back into defensive yield. The difference is that the AI power-demand secular tailwind means any yield-led rally in utilities is likely to be accompanied by fundamental earnings upgrades — a stronger base than pure bond-proxy repricing in 2018-2019.","analog_zh":"与2018年2月低点启动的那轮走势（2018年2月至2020年2月）最为相近：当时美联储利率触顶后转向，2019年三度降息叠加收益率下行催生了63.4%的大牛市，防御跑赢周期格局确立。当前公用事业处于历史分位14.3低位、发出BUY信号、在再通胀象限中暂时承压但仍在200日均线上方，与2018年2月的处境高度相似：前一轮大涨（2023-2026年AI驱动的95%）已经修正和重新定价，利率在当前关税-通胀周期中可能已触顶或即将触顶，下一个催化剂将是美联储再次释放宽松信号，或增长恐慌型宏观转换将资金重新引回防御性股息资产。关键差异在于AI电力需求的长期顺风意味着任何收益率驱动的公用事业反弹都将伴随基本面盈利上修，基础比2018-2019年纯粹的债券替代重估更为扎实。","bottom_signals":["TLT trough / 10-year yield peak — utilities bottoms form 0-6 weeks after yields peak","VIX spike + flight-to-safety in broad selloff — defensives temporarily sell off with everything but rebound fastest","Growth-value spread collapsing / value re-rating — capital rotates back to yield and safety","Extreme relative underperformance vs SPY (sector at multi-year price lows while absolute earnings stable) — value bottom"],"bottom_signals_zh":["TLT触底/10年期收益率见顶——公用事业底部通常在收益率见顶后0-6周形成","VIX飙升+大盘抛售中避险需求——防御板块随大盘短暂下跌但反弹最快","成长-价值利差收窄/价值重估——资金重新流向股息与安全资产","相对标普极端落后（板块多年股价低点而绝对盈利稳定）——价值底部"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["10-year Treasury yield direction (bond-proxy mechanism)","Fed rate cycle (hike/pause/cut pivots)","macro regime quad (slowdown→defensives lead; reflation→cyclicals lead)","oil/dollar regime (deflation = utilities outperform; reflation = underperform)","AI data-center electricity demand (post-2023 structural growth overlay)"],"drivers_zh":["10年期国债收益率方向（债券替代机制）","美联储利率周期（加息/暂停/降息转向）","宏观象限（衰退→防御领涨；再通胀→周期领涨）","油价/美元机制（通缩=公用事业跑赢；再通胀=落后）","AI数据中心电力需求（2023年后结构性成长叠加）"],"median_cycle_months":27,"summary":"Utilities (Equal-Weight) cycles almost exclusively on the interest-rate transmission mechanism: when the 10-year yield falls (or is expected to fall), the sector re-rates upward as a bond-proxy and safe-haven income vehicle; when yields surge, it reprices lower as dividend yield spreads compress against Treasuries. A secondary cycle driver is macro regime rotation — in slowdown/deflation quads, defensives (led by Utilities) outperform, while in reflation/growth quads, capital flows into cyclicals and tech, leaving Utilities as a laggard even when it posts absolute gains. The 2023-2026 AI data-center electricity demand supercycle added a new growth narrative on top of the bond-proxy base, allowing utilities to rally even in a narrow-breadth tech tape — a structural shift that was absent in prior cycles.","summary_zh":"公用事业（等权）的周期几乎完全由利率传导机制驱动：当10年期国债收益率下行（或预期下行），板块作为债券替代品和避险追息工具重新估值上涨；当收益率飙升，股息利差对国债收益率优势收窄，板块随之承压。第二驱动力是宏观象限轮动——在衰退/通缩象限中，防御板块（公用事业领涨）跑赢；在再通胀/增长象限中，资金流入周期与科技，公用事业即便绝对收益为正也沦为相对落后者。2023-2026年AI数据中心电力需求超级周期在债券替代基础上叠加了新的成长叙事，使公用事业得以在窄幅科技主导行情中同样上涨——这一结构性转变在以往周期中并不存在。","top_signals":["TLT peak / 10-year yield trough — utilities typically peak 1-3 months after bond yields bottom","VIX normalization after a flight-to-safety spike — risk appetite returning redirects flows out of defensives","Cyclicals/Discretionary beginning to lead the tape while defensives plateau — sector rotation signal","Reflation regime confirmation (oil + copper-gold recovering, growth-value spread widening)"],"top_signals_zh":["TLT见顶/10年期收益率触底——公用事业通常在债券收益率见底后1-3个月触顶","避险飙升后VIX回归正常——风险偏好回升将资金从防御板块引走","周期/非必需消费开始领涨而防御板块高位盘整——板块轮动信号","再通胀机制确认（油价+铜金比率回升，成长-价值利差走阔）"]}};
